#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> is a program that lets you to manage your "
"recipes, create shopping lists, choose a recipe based on available "
"ingredients and plan your menu/diet in advance."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> je program koji vam omogućava upravljanje "
"vašim receptima, pravljenje listi za kupovinu, odabir recepta na osnovu "
"dostupnih sastojaka i planiranje vašeg jelovnika/dijete."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"
msgstr "Upotreba <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Familiar"
msgstr "Upoznavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> starts, the window displays the "
"following components &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kada se <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> pokrene, prozor prikazuje sljedeće "
"komponente &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A menubar containing selections for <guimenu>File</guimenu>, <guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu>, <guimenu>View</guimenu>, <guimenu>Tools</guimenu>, "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and <guimenu>Help</guimenu>"
msgstr ""
"Traka menija koja sadrži odabir za <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu>, "
"<guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu>, <guimenu>Pogledaj</guimenu>, <guimenu>Alati</"
"guimenu>, <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A toolbar with icons for <guiicon>New</guiicon>, <guiicon>Save</guiicon>, "
"and <guiicon>Print</guiicon>"
msgstr ""
"Alatna traka sa ikonama za <guiicon>Novi</guiicon>, <guiicon>Snimi</guiicon> "
"i <guiicon>Štampaj</guiicon>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A left-hand pane containing icons depicting and buttons for access to the "
"various components of <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Okno na lijevoj strani koje sadrži ikone koje prikazuju i tastere za pristup "
"raznim komponentama <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A right-hand pane, which is the main <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window, "
"that by default contains a recipe category list"
msgstr ""
"Okno na desnoj strani, koje je glavni <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"prozor, koje obično sadrži listu kategorije recepata"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the main &krecipes; window."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana glavnog &krecipes; prozora."

