msgstr "Snimljena slika ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Screen"
msgstr "Glavni <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ekran"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Finding and Editing Recipes"
msgstr "Pronalaženje i izmjena recepata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> starts with the <emphasis>Find/"
"Edit Recipes</emphasis> component selected in the left pane of the window."
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> se pokrene sa <emphasis>Pronađi/"
"Izmijeni recepte</emphasis> komponentom izabranom u lijevom oknu prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section describes the method of finding recipes in the <emphasis>Find/"
"Edit Recipes</emphasis> component. For more specific details on "
"<emphasis>Editing</emphasis> recipes, see the section <link linkend=\"edit-"
"recipe\">Editing Saved Recipes</link>"
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje opisuje način pronalaženja recepata u <emphasis>Pronađi/"
"Izmijeni recepte</emphasis> komponenti. Za više specifičnih detalja o "
"<emphasis>Izmjeni</emphasis> recepata, vidite poglavlje <link linkend=\"edit-"
"recipe\">Izmjena snimljenih recepata</link>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With the <guibutton>Find/Edit Recipes</guibutton> component button selected, "
"the main <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window displays the following "
"&mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kada je taster <guibutton>Pronađi/Izmijeni recepte</guibutton> komponente "
"izabran, glavni <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozor prikazuje sljedeće "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "A title showing the name of the component selected"
msgstr "Naslov koji prikazuje ime izabrane komponente"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Basic</guilabel> (the default) and <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> "
"tabs"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Osnovna</guilabel> (podrazumijevana) i <guilabel>Napredna</"
"guilabel> kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "A text box to <userinput>enter search criteria</userinput>"
msgstr "Okvir za tekst za <userinput>unos kriterija pretraživanja</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cool feature here is that <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will search for "
"recipes as you type a text string in the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> box. "
"For example, if you wanted to find a recipe containing the word "
"<quote>apple</quote>, the recipes that display in the recipe view would show "
"only those recipes that contain the text string and would be filtered more "
"finely as each subsequent letter is typed."
msgstr ""
"Zgodna osobina ovdje je da će <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> tražiti "
"recepte dok vi kucate tekstualni niz u okvir za tekst <guilabel>Pretraži:</"
"guilabel>. Na primjer, ako biste željeli da pronađete recepat koji sadrži "
"riječ <quote>jabuka</quote>, recepti koji se prikazuju u pogledu recepata bi "
"prikazali samo one recepte koji sadrže tekstualni niz i bili bi filtrirani "
"preciznije sa svakim narednim otkucanim slovom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "A list of all recipe categories"
msgstr "Lista svih kategorija recepata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Buttons for show, edit and delete the selected recipes."
msgstr "Tasteri za prikaz, izmjenu i brisanje izabranih recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will notice the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"system-help.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject></guiicon> icon in the bottom, right-hand corner of the "
"pane containing the component list. This icon appears in all &krecipes; "
"components and when clicked, will open the corresponding section of this "
"Handbook if you need extra help at any time."
msgstr ""
"Vi ćete primijetiti <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"system-help.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikonu u donjem desnom uglu okna koje sadrži "
"listu komponenti. Ova ikona se pojavljuje u svim &krecipes; komponentama i "
"kada se klikne, otvoriće odgovarajuće poglavlje ovog priručnika ako vi "
"trebate dodatnu pomoć u bilo kojem trenutku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With the <guilabel>Basic</guilabel> tab active and the list of recipe "
"categories displayed, a category can be expanded by clicking on the "
"<guibutton>+</guibutton> button beside the category name. The category will "
"automatically expand to show your recipes and/or subcategories, if there are "
"any. From this list, you may select a recipe to open, edit or delete (see "
"the section <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Editing Saved Recipes</link> for "
"more information). Additionally, if you <action>select just one recipe</"
"action>, the <interface>status bar</interface> will show the date that it "
"was <emphasis> created</emphasis>, <emphasis>modified</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>last accessed </emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Kada je <guilabel>Osnovna</guilabel> kartica aktivna i lista kategorija "
"recepata prikazana, kategorija se može proširiti klikom na <guibutton>+</"
"guibutton> taster pored imena kategorije. Kategorija će se automatski "
"proširiti da prikaže vaše recepte i/ili podkategorije, ako postoje. Iz ove "
"liste možete izabrati recept za otvaranje, izmjenu ili brisanje (vidite "
"poglavlje <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Izmjena snimljenih recepata</link> "
"za više informacija). Osim toga, ako vi <action>izaberete samo jedan recept</"
"action>, <interface>statusna traka</interface> će prikazati datum kada je "
"bio <emphasis>napravljen</emphasis>, <emphasis>izmijenjen</emphasis> i "
"<emphasis>posljednji put pristupljen</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Conversely, clicking the <guibutton>-</guibutton> button beside the category "
"name will collapse the category."
msgstr ""
"Suprotno tome, klik na <guibutton>-</guibutton> taster pored kategorije će "
"suziti kategoriju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <quote>Right-Click</quote>Menu"
msgstr "Meni <quote>desnog klika</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> allows a multitude of ways to perform "
"various actions on your recipes. These actions are described in their "
"corresponding sections in this Handbook. However, in addition to the various "
"key combinations and/or menu selections, <action>right-clicking</action> on "
"a recipe in the Basic search pane will bring up a menu from which the "
"following actions can be selected &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> omogućava mnoštvo načina za izvršavanje "
"raznih radnji na vašim receptima. Ove radnje su opisane u njihovim "
"odgovarajućim poglavljima u ovom priručniku. Međutim, pored raznih "
"kombinacija tipki i/ili izbora menija, <action>desni klik</action> na recept "
"u oknu Osnovno pretraživanje će prikazati meni iz kojeg se mogu izabrati "
"sljedeće radnje &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show recipe(s) &ndash; Shows the selected recipes."
msgstr "Prikaži recept(e) &ndash; Prikazuje izabrane recepte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit recipe &ndash; Opens the selected recipe for editing."
msgstr "Izmijeni recept &ndash; Otvara izabrani recept za izmjenu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Export... &ndash; Exports the selected recipe. See the section <link linkend="
"\"export-recipe\">Exporting Recipes to Other Formats</link> for a complete "
"description of this function."
msgstr ""
"Eksportuj... &ndash; Eksportuje izabrani recept. Vidi poglavlje <link "
"linkend=\"export-recipe\">Eksportovanje recepata u druge formate</link> za "
"potpun opis ove funkcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add to Shopping List &ndash; Adds the selected recipe to your shopping list. "
"See the section <link linkend=\"shopping-list\">The Shopping List</link> for "
"information regarding the use of the Shopping List."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj u listu za kupovinu &ndash; Dodaje izabrani recept u vašu listu za "
"kupovinu. Vidite poglavlje <link linkend=\"shopping-list\">Lista za "
"kupovinu</link> za informacije u vezi sa upotrebom liste za kupovinu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copy to Clipboard &ndash; Makes a copy of the recipe and places in on the "
"clipboard so that it can be pasted into another application for example, an "
"email. The format of the copy is dependent on what is selected as a "
"preference. For a complete description of the <quote>Copy to Clipboard</"
"quote> functionality, see the section <link linkend=\"copy-clipboard"
"\">Copying to the Clipboard</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kopiraj u međuspremnik &ndash; Pravi kopiju recepta i postavlja u "
"međuspremnik tako da se može umetnuti u drugu aplikaciju, na primjer email. "
"Format kopije zavisi od toga šta je izabrano kao preferirano. Za potpun opis "
"<quote>Kopiraj u međuspremnik</quote> funkcionalnosti, vidite poglavlje "
"<link linkend=\"copy-clipboard\">Kopiranje u međuspremnik</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Categorize &ndash; This option applies only when there are recipes listed as "
"<emphasis>Uncategorized</emphasis>. Allows you to select one or more recipes "
"that appear in the <emphasis>Uncategorized</emphasis> group and place them "
"in the appropriate category by selecting the it from a pop-up instead of "
"having to edit the recipe(s)."
msgstr ""
"Kategoriši &ndash; Ova opcija važi samo kada ima recepata koji su navedeni "
"kao <emphasis>Nekategorisani</emphasis>. Omogućava vam da izaberete jedan "
"ili više recepata koji se pojavljuju u <emphasis>Nekategorisani</emphasis> "
"grupi i postavite ih u odgovarajuću kategoriju tako što ćete ga izabrati iz "
"pop-upa umjesto da morate izmjenjivati recept(e)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remove From Category &ndash; Removes the recipe from its current category. "
"If the recipe is not included in any other category, places it in the "
"<emphasis>Uncategorized</emphasis> group. From the <emphasis>Uncategorized</"
"emphasis> group, the recipe can be selected for editing to re-categorize it. "
"See the section <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Editing Saved Recipes</link> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ukloni iz kategorije &ndash; Uklanja recept iz njegove trenutne kategorije. "
"Ako recept nije uključen ni u jednu drugu kategoriju, postavlja ga u "
"<emphasis>Nekategorisani</emphasis> grupu. Iz <emphasis>Nekategorisani</"
"emphasis> grupe, recept se može izabrati za izmjenu da se ponovo kategoriše. "
"Vidite poglavlje <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Izmjena snimljenih recepata</"
"link> za više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete &ndash; Deletes the selected recipes from the database."
msgstr "Izbriši &ndash; Briše izabrane recepte iz baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some of the actions explained above may be applied to multiple recipes. You "
"can select various recipes thusly: hold the &Ctrl; key and select the "
"desired recipes by clicking on them."
msgstr ""
"Neke od radnji koje su objašnjene gore mogu se primijeniti na više recepata. "
"Možete izabrati različite recepte ovako: držite &Ctrl; tipku i izaberite "
"željene recepte klikom na njih."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Advanced Tab"
msgstr "Napredna kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab is to provide advanced "
"search capability. Queries for recipes can be made based on nine search "
"criteria, alone or in combination &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Svrha <guilabel>Napredna</guilabel> kartice je da pruži mogućnost naprednog "
"pretraživanja. Upiti za recepte mogu biti napravljeni na osnovu devet "
"kriterija pretraživanja, samostalno ili u kombinaciji &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Naslov"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Ingredients</para>"
msgstr "<para>Sastojci</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Autori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yield"
msgstr "Prinos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preparation Time"
msgstr "Vrijeme pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Instructions</para>"
msgstr "<para>Uputstvo</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Meta Data"
msgstr "Metapodaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Ratings</para>"
msgstr "<para>Ocjene</para>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the available components in the &krecipes; Advanced "
"Search tab."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana komponenti dostupnih u &krecipes; kartici "
"Napredno pretraživanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Advanced Search Component"
msgstr "<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> komponenta naprednog pretraživanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab is selected, the components will "
"be collapsed and show &gt;&gt; beside the label of the component. To expand "
"a section, simply click on the label of the component. Conversely, with the "
"component expanded, &lt;&lt; will show beside the label and clicking on the "
"label will collapse the section."
msgstr ""
"Kada je <guilabel>Napredna</guilabel> kartica izabrana, komponente će biti "
"sužene i prikazivati &gt;&gt; pored oznake komponente. Da proširite sekciju, "
"jednostavno kliknite na oznaku komponente. Suprotno tome, kada je komponenta "
"proširena, &lt;&lt; će biti prikazano pored oznake i klik na oznaku će "
"suziti sekciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A section can be collapsed simply to get it out of the way when it is not "
"needed for a search. However, if you enter search criteria in any one of the "
"search components, you can close the component and the search criteria will "
"still be considered in the search."
msgstr ""
"Sekcija se može suziti jednostavno da se skloni kada nije potrebna za "
"pretraživanje. Međutim, ako unesete kriterije pretraživanja u bilo koju od "
"komponenti pretraživanja, možete zatvoriti komponentu i kriteriji "
"pretraživanja će i dalje biti uzeti u obzir pri pretraživanju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For all search components in the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab, click "
"the <guibutton>Search</guibutton> button to initiate the search once all "
"desired search criteria have been selected. Clicking the <guibutton>Clear</"
"guibutton> button will clear the search selections and the search results."
msgstr ""
"Za sve komponente pretraživanja u <guilabel>Napredna</guilabel> kartica, "
"kliknite <guibutton>Pretraži</guibutton> taster da pokrenete pretraživanje "
"nakon što su svi željeni kriterije pretraživanja izabrani. Klik na "
"<guibutton>Očisti</guibutton> taster će očistiti izbor i rezultate "
"pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only recipes meeting ALL criteria will display! No matter which parameters "
"are used for the recipe search, should no recipes meeting the specified "
"criteria be found, the message <quote>&mdash; No matching recipes found "
"&mdash;</quote> will display in the recipe list area."
msgstr ""
"Samo recepti koji ispunjavaju SVE kriterije će biti prikazani! Bezi obzira "
"koji parametri se koriste za pretraživanje recepata, ako nije pronađen "
"nijedan recept koji ispunjava navedene kriterije, poruka <quote>&mdash; "
"Odgovarajući recepti nisu pronađeni &mdash;</quote> će se prikazati u "
"području liste recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid "The various components are used as follows &mdash;"
msgstr "Razne komponente se koriste na sljedeći način &mdash;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Title Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po naslovu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter words that appear as part of the recipe title, for example, "
"<emphasis>Chicken Rice</emphasis>. Using these words, recipes that contain "
"the words <quote>Chicken</quote>, or <quote>Rice</quote>, or <emphasis>both</"
"emphasis> in the title will appear in your results. However, if you click "
"the tickbox beside the <guilabel>Require All Words</guilabel> label, only "
"those recipes that have both <quote>Chicken</quote> <emphasis>AND</emphasis> "
"<quote>Rice</quote> in the title will be found."
msgstr ""
"Unesite riječi koje se pojavljuju kao dio naslova recepta, na primjer, "
"<emphasis>Piletina s rižom</emphasis>. Koristeći ove riječi, recepti koji "
"sadrže riječi <quote>Piletina</quote>, ili <quote>s rižom</quote>, ili "
"<emphasis>obje</emphasis> u naslovu će se pojaviti u vašim rezultatima. "
"Međutim, ako kliknete potvrdni okvir pored <guilabel>Zahtijevaj sve riječi</"
"guilabel> oznake, samo oni recepti koji imaju i <quote>Piletina</quote> "
"<emphasis>I</emphasis> <quote>s rižom</quote> u naslovu će biti pronađeni."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ingredients Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po sastojcima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Ingredients</guilabel> component of the <guilabel>Advanced</"
"guilabel> tab, single or multi-word ingredients can be searched for. Single "
"word ingredients are entered in the text box with a space between each "
"ingredient. Multi-word ingredients are enclosed in quotes, for example, "
"<quote>ice cream</quote>."
msgstr ""
"U komponenti <guilabel>Sastojci</guilabel> kartice <guilabel>Napredno</"
"guilabel> se mogu tražiti sastojci od jedne ili više riječi. Sastojci od "
"jedne riječi se unose u okvir za tekst sa razmakom između svakog sastojka. "
"Sastojci od više riječi su stavljeni pod navodnike, na primjer, <quote>ice "
"cream</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Searches may also be done using wild cards &ndash; <quote>*</quote> to "
"replace any number of characters, or <quote>?</quote> to replace a single "
"character. For an explanation on the use of wildcards, see the section <link "
"linkend=\"using-wildcards\">Using Wildcards in Searches</link>."
msgstr ""
"Pretraživanja se mogu vršiti i pomoću džokera &ndash; <quote>*</quote> da "
"zamijeni bilo koji broj znakova, ili <quote>?</quote> da zamijeni jedan "
"znak. Za objašnjenje o upotrebi džokera, vidite poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"using-wildcards\">Upotreba džokera u pretraživanjama</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although the ingredient that you are searching for might appear in the title "
"of the recipe listed in the search results, it is the ingredient that has "
"caused a particular recipe to show in the list, NOT the fact that the "
"ingredient name might appear in the title."
msgstr ""
"Iako bi se sastojak kojeg vi tražite mogao pojaviti u naslovu recepta "
"navedenog u rezultatima pretraživanja, sastojak je taj koji je izazvao da se "
"određeni recept prikaže u listi, a NE činjenica da bi se ime sastojka moglo "
"pojaviti u naslovu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recipes can be searched for based on various criteria &mdash;"
msgstr "Recepti se mogu tražiti na osnovu raznih kriterija &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Uses all:</guilabel> &ndash; If the search terms are entered in "
"this text box, it is being stated that the recipe(s) <emphasis>MUST</"
"emphasis> contain all ingredients listed and therefore, only those recipes "
"that contain <emphasis>ALL</emphasis> ingredients will be returned as "
"results of the search."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Upotrebljava sve:</guilabel> &ndash; Ako su pojmovi za "
"pretraživanje uneseni u ovaj okvir za tekst, navodi se da recept(i) "
"<emphasis>MORA(JU)</emphasis> sadržavati sve navedene sastojke i zbog toga, "
"samo oni recepti koji sadrže <emphasis>SVE</emphasis> sastojke će biti "
"vraćeni kao rezultati pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Uses any of:</guilabel> &ndash; If the search terms are entered in "
"this text box, it is being stated that the recipe(s) <emphasis>MAY</"
"emphasis> contain any of the ingredients specified. The search results will "
"return recipes that contain <emphasis>ANY OR ALL</emphasis> of the "
"ingredients."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Upotrebljava bilo koji:</guilabel> &ndash; Ako su pojmovi za "
"pretraživanje uneseni u ovaj okvir za tekst, navodi se da recept(i) "
"<emphasis>MOGU</emphasis> sadržavati bilo koji od navedenih sastojaka. "
"Rezultati pretraživanja će vratiti recepte koji sadrže <emphasis>BILO KOJI "
"ILI SVE</emphasis> sastojke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Without:</guilabel> &ndash; If the search terms are entered in "
"this text box, it is being specified that the recipes returned as results of "
"the search <emphasis>MUST NOT</emphasis> contain <emphasis>ANY</emphasis> of "
"the listed ingredients."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bez:</guilabel> &ndash; Ako su pojmovi za pretraživanje uneseni u "
"ovaj okvir za tekst, navodi se da recepti koji se vraćaju kao rezultati "
"pretraživanja <emphasis>NE SMIJU</emphasis> sadržavati <emphasis>BILO KOJI</"
"emphasis> od navedenih sastojaka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Categories Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po kategorijama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As in the <guilabel>Ingredients</guilabel> component of the "
"<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab, search parameters in the "
"<guilabel>Categories</guilabel> component are entered with a space between "
"each parameter, or enclosed in quotes for multi-word parameters. You can "
"also use wildcards for searching categories. See the section, <link linkend="
"\"using-wildcards\">Using Wildcards in Searches</link> for an explanation on "
"the use of wildcards."
msgstr ""
"Kao u komponenti <guilabel>Sastojci</guilabel> kartice <guilabel>Napredno</"
"guilabel>, parametri pretraživanja u komponenti <guilabel>Kategorije</"
"guilabel> se unose sa razmakom između svakog parametra, ili pod navodnicima "
"za parametre od više riječi. Možete upotrebljavati i džokere za "
"pretraživanje po kategorijama. Vidite poglavlje, <link linkend=\"using-"
"wildcards\">Upotreba džokera u pretraživanjima</link> za objašnjenje o "
"upotrebi džokera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Searching for recipes in <guilabel>Categories</guilabel> is done by "
"specifying the criteria on which you wish to base the search as follows "
"&mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Pretraživanje recepata u <guilabel>Kategorije</guilabel> se vrši navođenjem "
"kriterija na kojima želite da bazirate pretraživanje na sljedeći način "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>In all:</guilabel> &ndash; indicates that the recipes returned in "
"the search should be in all the categories listed. This search might be used "
"if you are looking for a recipe that appears in the <emphasis>Dessert</"
"emphasis> category and also, in the <emphasis>Cakes</emphasis> category."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>U svim:</guilabel> &ndash; ukazuje da bi recepti vraćeni pri "
"pretraživanju trebali biti u svim navedenim kategorijama. Ovo pretraživanje "
"se može upotrebljavati ako tražite recept koji se pojavljuje i u kategoriji "
"<emphasis>Desert</emphasis> i u kategoriji <emphasis>Kolači</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>In any of:</guilabel> &ndash; is specifying that recipes returned "
"in the search may be from <emphasis>ANY</emphasis> of the categories, but a "
"recipe may not necessarily be found in all categories listed."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>U bilo kojoj:</guilabel> &ndash; navodi da bi recepti vraćeni pri "
"pretraživanju mogli biti iz <emphasis>BILO KOJE</emphasis> od kategorija, "
"ali se recept ne mora pronaći u svim navedenim kategorijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Not in:</guilabel> &ndash; is indicating that the recipes returned "
"in the search <emphasis>MUST NOT</emphasis> be from the categories listed."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Nije u:</guilabel> &ndash; ukazuje da recepti vraćen pri "
"pretraživanju <emphasis>NE SMIJU</emphasis> biti iz navedenih kategorija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The use of the <guilabel>Categories</guilabel> search is most useful when "
"combined with other search parameters."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba pretraživanja <guilabel>Kategorije</guilabel> je najkorisnija u "
"kombinaciji sa drugim parametrima pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the following screenshot, it is being specified that recipes should be "
"searched for in the <emphasis>Desserts</emphasis> and <emphasis>Main Dishes</"
"emphasis> categories."
msgstr ""
"Na sljedećoj snimljenoj slici ekrana je navedeno da bi recepti trebali biti "
"traženi u kategorijama <emphasis>Deserti</emphasis> i <emphasis>Glavna jela</"
"emphasis>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of a completed search in &krecipes; specifying a "
"category only."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završenog pretraživanja u &krecipes; koje navodi "
"samo kategoriju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Search &ndash; Category Only Specified"
msgstr "Napredno pretraživanje &ndash; navedena samo kategorija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the next screenshot, recipes are still being searched for in the "
"<emphasis>Desserts</emphasis> and <emphasis>Main Dishes</emphasis> "
"categories. However, recipes that contain some form of the word "
"<quote>apple</quote> (note the use of the wildcard) are being excluded."
msgstr ""
"Na sljedećoj snimljenoj slici ekrana recepti se još uvijek traže u "
"kategorijama <emphasis>Deserti</emphasis> i <emphasis>Glavna jela</"
"emphasis>. Međutim, recepti koji sadrže neki oblik riječi <quote>apple</"
"quote> (obratite pažnju na upotrebu džokera) su isključeni."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of a completed search in &krecipes; specifying a "
"category and additional criteria."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završenog pretraživanja u &krecipes; koje navodi "
"kategoriju i dodatne kriterije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Search - Ingredient and Category Specified"
msgstr "Napredno pretraživanje - navedeni sastojak i kategorija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Authors Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po autorima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Are you looking for a recipe given to you by a certain person or input into "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> from a specific magazine? The "
"<guilabel>Authors</guilabel> component of the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> "
"tab allows you to find that recipe!"
msgstr ""
"Da li tražite recept kojeg vam je dala određena osoba ili unos u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> iz određenog časopisa? Komponenta "
"<guilabel>Autori</guilabel> kartice <guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> vam "
"omogućava da pronađete taj recept!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with the searches previously described, you can search using wildcards. "
"For a description of using wildcards, see the section <link linkend=\"using-"
"wildcards\">Using Wildcards in Searches</link>. Names are entered with a "
"space between if, for instance, you are searching for a recipe by only a "
"first name. Whole names, or for situations where you have entered a magazine "
"name as the recipe source (Author), the name is entered enclosed in quotes, "
"for example, <quote>Jason Kivlighn</quote>, or <quote>Vegetarian Times</"
"quote>."
msgstr ""
"Kao pri prethodno opisanim pretraživanjima, možete upotrebljavati džokere "
"pri pretraživanju. Za opis upotrebe džokera, vidite poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"using-wildcards\">Upotreba džokera pri pretraživanju</link>. Imena se "
"unose sa razmakom između ako, na primjer, tražite recept samo po imenu. Puno "
"ime, ili u slučaju da ste unijeli ime časopisa kao izvor recepta (autor), se "
"unosi pod navodnicima, na primjer, <quote>Jason Kivlighn</quote>, ili "
"<quote>Vegetarian Times</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searches can be performed in the following ways &mdash;"
msgstr "Pretraživanje se može izvršiti na sljedeće načine &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:510
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>By any of:</guilabel> &ndash; This search would be used if the "
"recipes desired are by <emphasis>ANY</emphasis> of the authors listed in the "
"text box."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Od bilo kojeg:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo pretraživanje se "
"upotrebljava ako su željeni recepti od <emphasis>BILO KOJEG</emphasis> od "
"autora navedenih u okviru za tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>By all:</guilabel> &ndash; This search would be used in situations "
"where recipes have <quote>co-authors</quote>. An example of this would be: "
"<quote>Canadian Living Cooks</quote> <quote>Elizabeth Baird</quote>. This "
"would return only recipes where <emphasis>Canadian Living Cooks</emphasis> "
"and <emphasis>Elizabeth Baird</emphasis> are both listed as the recipe "
"source/author."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Od svih:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo pretraživanje se upotrebljava u "
"slučajevima u kojima recepti imaju <quote>koautore</quote>. Primjer za to bi "
"bio: <quote>Canadian Living Cooks</quote> <quote>Elizabeth Baird</quote>. "
"Ovo bi vratilo samo recepte za koje su i <emphasis>Canadian Living Cooks</"
"emphasis> i <emphasis>Elizabeth Baird</emphasis> navedeni kao izvor recepta/"
"autor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Not by:</guilabel> &ndash; This search would be used when you want "
"to exclude certain authors from your search."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Nije od:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo pretraživanje se upotrebljava kada "
"želite da isključite određene autore iz vašeg pretraživanja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Yield Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po prinosu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Yield</guilabel> component in the <guilabel>Advanced</"
"guilabel> tab is slightly different from the searches described thus far in "
"that it must be <emphasis>Enabled</emphasis> in order to have it utilized in "
"the search criteria."
msgstr ""
"Komponenta <guilabel>Prinos</guilabel> kartice <guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> "
"se malo razlikuje od do sad opisanih pretraživanja po tome da mora biti "
"<emphasis>Omogućena</emphasis> da bi se upotrebljavala u kriterijima "
"pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable <guilabel>Yield</guilabel> as a criteria for your search, click "
"the tick box beside the <guilabel>Enabled</guilabel> label. Once you have "
"designated this to be part of your search, you can define the yield by "
"selecting from the drop-down menu as follows &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Da omogućite <guilabel>Prinos</guilabel> kao kriterij za vaše pretraživanje, "
"kliknite potvrdni okvir pored oznake <guilabel>Omogućena</guilabel>. Nakon "
"što ste naveli da je to dio vašeg pretraživanja, možete odrediti prinos "
"odabirom iz padajućeg menija na sljedeći način &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Yields at least:</guilabel> &ndash; This would be specified if you "
"want the recipe(s) to be able to provide a minimum number of portions. The "
"recipe(s) returned COULD yield <emphasis>MORE</emphasis> than this number, "
"but cannot yield less."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Daje najmanje:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo se navodi ako želite da "
"recept(i) može (mogu) dati minimalan broj porcija. Recept(i) koji je (su) "
"vraćen(i) MOŽE (MOGU) dati <emphasis>VIŠE</emphasis> od ovog broja, ali ne "
"može (mogu) dati manje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Yields at most:</guilabel> &ndash; This would be specified if you "
"want recipe(s) that are returned in the search to yield <emphasis>NO MORE "
"THAN</emphasis> a specified number of portions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Daje najviše:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo se navodi ako želite da recept"
"(i) koji je (su) vraćen(i) pri pretraživanju da(ju) <emphasis>NE VIŠE OD</"
"emphasis> navedenog broja porcija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Yields about:</guilabel> &ndash; This would be used to approximate "
"the number of portions you want in the recipe(s). The recipes(s) returned "
"could yield <emphasis>SLIGHTLY MORE</emphasis> or <emphasis>SLIGHTLY LESS</"
"emphasis> than a specified number of portions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Daje oko:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo se upotrebljava da date približan "
"broj porcija koje želite u receptu (receptima). Recept(i) koji je (su) vraćen"
"(i) mogao (mogli) bi dati <emphasis>MALO VIŠE</emphasis> ili <emphasis>MALO "
"MANJE</emphasis> od navedenog broja porcija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:561
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After defining the type of search that is desired, the spinbox next to the "
"drop-down menu is used to increment (or decrement) the actual "
"<emphasis>yield amount</emphasis> that goes along with the defined "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Nakon određivanja željene vrste pretraživanja, spinbox pored padajućeg "
"menija se upotrebljava da se poveća (ili smanji) stvarna <emphasis>količina "
"prinosa</emphasis> koja ide uz određene parametre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When inputting recipes, a <emphasis>yield type</emphasis>, for example, "
"<emphasis>servings</emphasis> or <emphasis>dozen</emphasis> is allowed. Keep "
"in mind that when including <emphasis>Yield</emphasis> as a search "
"parameter, using a yield of 2 in a search will return results for 2 dozen, 2 "
"servings, 2 loaves, but will <emphasis>NOT</emphasis> return results for 24 "
"cookies, 24 squares, etc., even though these are technically 2 dozen."
msgstr ""
"Kada unosite recepte, <emphasis>vrsta prinosa</emphasis>, na primjer, "
"<emphasis>obroci</emphasis> ili <emphasis>tuce</emphasis> je dozvoljen. "
"Imajte na umu da kada uključite <emphasis>Prinos</emphasis> kao parametar "
"pretraživanja, upotreba prinosa 2 pri pretraživanju će vratiti rezultate za "
"2 tuceta, 2 obroka, 2 vekne, ali <emphasis>NEĆE</emphasis> vratiti rezultate "
"za 24 kolačića, 24 kvadrata, itd., iako su oni u stvari 2 tuceta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Preparation Time Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po vremenu pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Preparation Time</guilabel> component in the "
"<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab is used in the same manner as the "
"<guilabel>Yield</guilabel> component. It must be <emphasis>Enabled</"
"emphasis> in order to have it utilized in the search criteria."
msgstr ""
"Komponenta <guilabel>Vrijeme pripreme</guilabel> u kartici "
"<guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> se upotrebljava na isti način kao komponenta "
"<guilabel>Prinos</guilabel>. Ona mora biti <emphasis>Omogućena</emphasis> da "
"bi se upotrebljavala u kriterijima pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable <guilabel>Preparation Time</guilabel> as a criteria for your "
"search, click the tick box beside the <guilabel>Enabled</guilabel> label. "
"Once you have designated this to be part of your search, you can define the "
"time criteria by selecting from the drop-down menu as follows &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Da omogućite <guilabel>Vrijeme pripreme</guilabel> kao kriterij za vaše "
"pretraživanje, kliknite potvrdni okvir pored oznake <guilabel>Omogućena</"
"guilabel>. Nakon što ste naveli da je to dio vašeg pretraživanja, možete "
"odrediti kriterij vremena odabirom iz padajućeg menija na sljedeći način "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Ready in at most:</guilabel> &ndash; This would be utilized if you "
"want the recipe(s) to be ready within a specified time frame. The recipe(s) "
"returned COULD be ready in <emphasis>LESS THAN</emphasis> or "
"<emphasis>EXACTLY</emphasis> the time specified, but cannot be ready in "
"greater than the time chosen for preparation."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Gotovo za najviše:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo se upotrebljava ako "
"želite da recept(i) bude (budu) gotov(i) u određenom vremenskom periodu. "
"Recept(i) koji je (su) vraćen(i) MOŽE (MOGU) biti gotov(i) za "
"<emphasis>MANJE OD</emphasis> ili <emphasis>TAČNO</emphasis> navedeno "
"vrijeme, ali ne može (mogu) biti gotov(i) za više od vremena izabranog za "
"pripremu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Ready in about:</guilabel> &ndash; This choice allows some "
"flexibility and would be used to approximate the time needed to prepare the "
"recipe. The recipe(s) that are returned in the search can be ready in "
"<emphasis>SLIGHTLY MORE</emphasis>, <emphasis>EXACTLY</emphasis>, or "
"<emphasis>SLIGHTLY LESS</emphasis> than the time specified for preparation."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Gotovo za oko:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovaj izbor dozvoljava nešto "
"fleksibilnosti i upotrebljava se da se da približno vrijeme potrebno za "
"pripremu recepta. Recept(i) koji je (su) vraćen(i) pri pretraživanju može "
"(mogu) biti gotov(i) za <emphasis>MALO VIŠE</emphasis>, <emphasis>TAČNO</"
"emphasis>, ili <emphasis>MALO MANJE</emphasis> od vremena navedenog za "
"pripremu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After defining the type of search that is desired, the spinbox next to the "
"drop-down menu is used to increment (or decrement) the actual "
"<emphasis>time</emphasis> parameter. Select the digits before the "
"<emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> symbol to increment the hour portion of the time "
"and then select the digits after the <emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> symbol to "
"increment the minute portion of the time. The hour and minute parameters can "
"be used alone or in combination."
msgstr ""
"Nakon određivanja željene vrste pretraživanja, spinbox pored padajućeg "
"menija se upotrebljava da se poveća (ili smanji) stvarni parametar "
"<emphasis>vremena</emphasis>. Izaberite cifre prije <emphasis>&#058;</"
"emphasis> znaka da povećate broj sati i onda izaberite cifre poslije "
"<emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> znaka da povećate broj minuta. Parametri sati i "
"minute se mogu upotrebljavati samostalno ili u kombinaciji."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Instructions Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po uputstvu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Are you interested in finding a recipe that contains certain instructions or "
"is prepared a certain way? The <guilabel>Instructions</guilabel> component "
"in the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab allows you to search the recipe "
"instructions for specific terms that might include a preparation method, "
"such as <quote>Bake at 350</quote>, or a suggested garnish. However, these "
"are just examples of how this component might be used. Any term(s) that "
"might appear in the <emphasis>Instructions</emphasis> of a recipe can be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Da li ste zainteresovani da nađete recept koji sadrži određeno uputstvo ili "
"se priprema na određeni način? Komponenta <guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel> u "
"kartici <guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> omogućava vam da pretražujete određene "
"pojmove po uputstvu recepta, koji mogu uključivati način pripreme, kao što "
"je <quote>Peći na 350</quote>, ili predloženi ukras. Međutim, ovo su samo "
"primjeri kako se ova komponenta može upotrebljavati. Bilo koji pojam koji bi "
"se mogao pojaviti u <emphasis>Uputstvu</emphasis> recepta se može "
"upotrebljavati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To utilize the <guilabel>Instructions</guilabel> search, simply type the "
"keyword or keywords in the text box beside the <guilabel>Keywords:</"
"guilabel> label. Enter keywords separated by spaces, or multi-word "
"instructions enclosed in quotes. Wild cards can also be used. For "
"instructions on the use of wildcards, see the section <link linkend=\"using-"
"wildcards\">Using Wildcards in Searches</link>."
msgstr ""
"Da upotrijebite pretraživanje po <guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel>, jednostavno "
"ukucajte ključnu riječ ili riječi u okvir za tekst pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Ključne riječi:</guilabel>. Unesite ključne riječi odvojene "
"razmacima, ili uputstvo od više riječi pod navodnicima. Džokeri se mogu "
"upotrebljavati, takođe. Za uputstvo o upotrebi džokera, vidite poglavlje "
"<link linkend=\"using-wildcards\">Upotreba džokera pri pretraživanju</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:634
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Should you require that the search contain all the keywords listed, click "
"the tick box beside the <guilabel>Require All Words</guilabel> label."
msgstr ""
"Ako pretraživanje treba da sadrži sve navedene ključne riječi, kliknite "
"potvrdni okvir pored oznake <guilabel>Potrebne sve riječi</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:641
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Meta Data Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po metapodacima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By definition, <emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> is <quote>data about data</"
"quote>, or expressed another way, is <quote>information that describes "
"another set of data</quote>. The <guilabel>Meta Data</guilabel> component in "
"the <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab allows you to search your recipes "
"based on information about them, as follows &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Po definiciji, <emphasis>metapodaci</emphasis> su <quote>podaci o podacima</"
"quote>, ili drukčije kazano, <quote>informacije koje opisuju drugi skup "
"podataka</quote>. Komponenta <guilabel>Metapodaci</guilabel> u kartici "
"<guilabel>Napredno</guilabel> vam omogućava da pretražujete vaše recepte na "
"osnovu informacija o njima, na sljedeći način &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:651
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Created:</guilabel> &ndash; This is the date that the recipe was "
"created on."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Napravljen:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo je datum kada je recept "
"napravljen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Modified:</guilabel> &ndash; This is the date that the last "
"revision was made to the recipe."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izmijenjen:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo je datum kada je posljednji put "
"napravljena izmjena na receptu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Last accessed:</guilabel> &ndash; This is the date that the recipe "
"was last opened or <quote>used</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Posljednji put pristupljen:</guilabel> &ndash; Ovo je datum kada "
"je recept bio posljednji put otvoren ili <quote>upotrijebljen</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:661
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each of the <emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> descriptions, the date may be "
"entered as an exact date if this is known or desired, or as a <quote>date "
"range</quote>. Dates are interpreted in the format that has been set within "
"the &kde; environment. For example, if the date format has been set to "
"display as DD-MM-YYYY, you may enter the date directly into the text box in "
"the format of <quote>DD-MM-YYYY</quote>. When entering the date, the two "
"initial digits of the year may be entered, but are not absolutely necessary. "
"However, it is imperative that you use the exact separator <abbrev>i.e. </"
"abbrev> the dash (&ndash;), in the example, as set in the date format in "
"&kde;. You may also use the drop-down arrow beside the box in which you want "
"to enter the date to reveal a calendar."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki od opisa <emphasis>metapodataka</emphasis>, datum se može unijeti "
"kao tačan datum ako je poznat ili ako se to želi, ili kao <quote>opseg "
"datuma</quote>. Datumi se tumače u formatu koji je postavljen u &kde; "
"okruženju. Na primjer, ako je format datuma postavljen da se prikazuje kao "
"DD-MM-YYYY, možete unijeti datum direktno u okvir za tekst u formatu "
"<quote>DD-MM-YYYY</quote>. Kada unosite datum, prve dvije cifre godine mogu "
"se unijeti, ali nisu apsolutno neophodne. Međutim, morate upotrijebiti isti "
"separator <abbrev>tj.</abbrev> crtica (&ndash;), u primjeru, kao što je "
"postavljen format datuma u &kde;. Takođe, možete upotrijebiti padajuću "
"strelicu pored okvira u koji želite da unesete datum da otkrijete kalendar."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to enter the date directly into the text box and are using a "
"<emphasis>date range</emphasis> as opposed to an exact date, ensure that the "
"dates for the start and end of the range are entered in the same format. For "
"example, if you enter the starting date for the range in the format of "
"<quote>DD-MM-YY</quote> and the ending date for the range in the format of "
"\"DD/MM/YY\", either no recipes will be found or the results returned will "
"include only those recipes that fit the criteria for the starting date, if "
"this date agrees with the format as set in &kde;."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se odlučite da direktno unesete datum u okvir za tekst, koristite "
"<emphasis>opseg datuma</emphasis> za razliku da li je ispravan datum, "
"osigurati da se početak i kraj raspona upisuju u istom formatu. Na primjer, "
"ukoliko unesete datum početka raspona u formatu <quote>DD-MM-YY</quote> i "
"datum kraja raspona upisuju se u istom formatu \"DD/MM/YY\",nijedan recept "
"se neće naći ili će vratiti samo one recepte koju se uklapaju u kriterije za "
"pokretanje datuma, ukoliko se ovaj datum slaže sa formatom kao što je "
"navedeno u &kde;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Calendar Interface"
msgstr "Upotreba interfejsa kalendara"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:685
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The calendar allows you to easily navigate though months and years to select "
"any date."
msgstr ""
"Kalendar vam omogućava da se jednostavno krećete kroz mjesece i godine da "
"izaberete bilo koji datum."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the calendar is revealed, the current month is shown and the current "
"day is highlighted. Below the calendar is a text box, which shows the date "
"and beside this a drop-down menu that displays the specific week of the year."
msgstr ""
"Kada se kalendar otkrije, trenutni mjesec je prikazan i trenutni dan je "
"naglašen. Ispod kalendara je okvir za tekst koji prikazuje datum i pored "
"ovog padajući meni koji prikazuje određenu sedmicu u godini."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One way to select a date would be to use the drop-down menu to select a "
"particular week in the year, for example <guimenuitem>Week 26</guimenuitem>. "
"Doing this will change the date in the text box and will also position the "
"highlighted date in the calendar to the beginning of Week 26. Note that "
"<emphasis>Monday</emphasis> is used as the starting day for the week. To use "
"a date from this week either, click the highlighted date in the calendar, or "
"select another date from the week and the date will be transferred to the "
"<emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> text box where the calendar was utilized."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od načina da izaberete datum da bi koristili padajući izbornik za "
"odabir odabir određene sedmice u godini, na primjer <guimenuitem>Sedmica 26</"
"guimenuitem>. Tako ćete promijeniti datum u tekstu i to će također postaviti "
"istaknuti datum u kalendaru od početka sedmice 26. Imajte na umu da se "
"<emphasis>Ponedjeljak</emphasis> koristi kao poćetni dan u sedmici. Za "
"korižtenje datuma ove sedmice, kliknite na istaknute datume u kalendaru ili "
"odaberite drugi datum iz sedmice i datum će biti prebačen u <emphasis>Meta "
"Data</emphasis> tekst u kojem je koristio kalendar."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the text box that is displaying the date at the beginning of the "
"chosen week of the year (or the current week if no choice has been made), "
"there is a list of additional choices for date selection. Specifically, "
"these are: &ndash; <emphasis>Today</emphasis>, <emphasis>Tomorrow</"
"emphasis>, <emphasis>Next Week</emphasis>, and <emphasis>Next Month</"
"emphasis>. Clicking on one of these selections, will result in this date "
"being shown in the <emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> text box being used. It "
"should be noted here that each of the choices is relevant to today's date. "
"For instance, if today's date is the 15th, clicking the <guibutton>Today</"
"guibutton> would place today's date in the <emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> "
"text box being used. Clicking <guibutton>Tomorrow</guibutton> would, of "
"course, place tomorrow's date in the box. <guibutton>Next Week</guibutton> "
"would place the date that is one week forward today in the box. "
"<guibutton>Next Month</guibutton> would place next month's date that "
"corresponds to today's date in the box, in the example from above, the 15th "
"of the previous month."
msgstr ""
"Ispod okvira za tekst koji se prikazuje datum na početku odabrane sedmice u "
"godini (ili trenutna sedmica, ako nema drugog izbora da se izabere), postoji "
"lista dodatnih izbora za izbor datuma. Naime, to su: &ndash; "
"<emphasis>Danas</emphasis>, <emphasis>Sutra</emphasis>, <emphasis>Sljedeća "
"sedmica</emphasis>, i <emphasis>Sljedeći mjesec</emphasis>. Klikom na jedan "
"od ovih sekcija, će rezultirati da se ovaj datum prikazuje u <emphasis>Meta "
"Data</emphasis> tekstu koji se koristi. Treba napomenuti  da svaki od izbora "
"je relevantan na danasljni datum. Na primjer, ako je današnji datum 15. "
"klikom na <guibutton>Danas</guibutton> će staviti današnji datum u "
"<emphasis>Meta Data</emphasis> tekst koji će se koristiti. Klikom na tipku "
"<guibutton>Sutra</guibutton> će, naravno, staviti sutračnji datum u mjesto. "
"<guibutton>Sljedeća sedmica</guibutton> će staviti datum koji je jednu "
"sedmicu dalje u odnostu na trenutni datum. <guibutton>sljedeci mjesec</"
"guibutton> će staviti datum narednog mjeseca koji odgovara na današnji datum "
"u zadani prostor, u primjeru odozgo, 15. u prethodnom mjesecu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, the calendar itself can be utilized to navigate to a specific "
"date. When the arrow beside the text box in which you want to display the "
"date is clicked, thus revealing the calendar, there are a number of ways to "
"select a date &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Pored toga, sam kalendar se može koristiti za kretanje do određenog datuma. "
"Kada se klikne strelica pored okvira za tekst u kojem želite prikazati "
"datum, tako otkrivajući kalendar, postoji niz načina za odabir datuma &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the month displayed &ndash; This will reveal a list from which you "
"can select a desired month."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na prikazani mjesec &ndash; Ovo će otkriti listu iz koje možete "
"izabrati željeni mjesec."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the year displayed &ndash; This is reveal a text box that displays "
"the current year, but in which another year can be entered."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na prikazanu godinu &ndash; Ovo će otkriti okvir za tekst koji "
"prikazuje trenutnu godinu, u koji druga godina može biti unesena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:731
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the left and right of the month and year heading on the calendar, there "
"are arrows that can be used to navigate through various months and years. "
"Clicking on the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"arrow-left.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></"
"guiicon> icon will reveal the previous month's calendar. Conversely, "
"clicking the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"arrow-right.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></"
"guiicon> icon will advance the calendar to the next month."
msgstr ""
"Za pomjeranje lijevo i desno mjeseca i godine nakalendaru, mogu se koristiti "
"strelice za navigaciju kroz različite mjesece i godine. Klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-left.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikona će "
"prikazati kalendar za prethodni mjesec. Nasuprot tome, klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-right.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikona će "
"prikazati kalendar za sljedeći mjesec."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigating between years is done in the same manner, but the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-left-"
"double.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> is "
"used to navigate to previous years and the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-right-"
"double.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> is "
"used to navigate to following years. In each case, once a date is selected, "
"it will be transferred to the text box at the point where the calendar was "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Kretanje između godina se vrši na isti način, ali  "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-left-"
"double.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>  "
"se koristi za navigaciju na prethodne godine i "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"arrow-right-"
"double.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> se "
"koristi za navigaciju do sljedeće godine. U svakom slučaju, kada je izabran "
"datum, to će biti prebačen na okvir sa tekstom na mjestu gdje je izabran u "
"kalendaru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ratings Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po ocjenama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:757
#, no-c-format
msgid "When a Rating search is selected, it can be done in two ways &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kada je pretraživanje po ocjenama izabrano, može se izvršiti na dva načina "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid "By average:"
msgstr "Po prosječnoj ocjeni:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:762
#, no-c-format
msgid "By criteria:"
msgstr "Po kriterijima ocjenjivanja:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:766
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching by Average Rating"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po prosječnoj ocjeni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to search by average rating, select the <emphasis>Radio "
"Button</emphasis> beside the <guilabel>By average:</guilabel> label. Then, "
"enter a numerical value in the text box that precedes the label "
"<guilabel>stars</guilabel>. This value is the average of the number of stars "
"assigned to each parameter under which the recipe was rated and can be a "
"fixed value or a range, for example <emphasis>3-4</emphasis> stars. "
"Fractional amounts are also permitted, for example, 3.5."
msgstr ""
"Ako se odlučite za pretraživanje po prosjeku ocjena, odaberite "
"<emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> pored oznake <guilabel>Po prosjeku:</"
"guilabel>. Zatim, unestite numeričku vrijednost u okvir za tekst pored "
"oznake <guilabel>zvijezdice</guilabel>. Ova vrijednost je procjek broja "
"zvijezdica dodjeljen svakom parametru pod kojim je recept ocijenjen, na "
"primjer<emphasis>3-4</emphasis> zvijezdice. Dozvoljeni su i razlomci, na "
"primjer, 3.5."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:776
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have entered your search parameters, click the <guibutton>Search</"
"guibutton> button and the recipes that meet the search criteria will display "
"under the <guilabel>Title</guilabel> label on the right. Should no recipes "
"meet the criteria, <emphasis>--- No matching recipes found ---</emphasis> "
"will display."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste unijeli parametre pretraživanja, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Pretraži</guibutton> i recepti koji ispunjavaju kriterije "
"pretraživanja će se prikazati pod oznakom <guilabel>Naslov</guilabel> na "
"desnoj strani. Ako nijedan recept ne ispunjava kriterije, <emphasis>--- "
"Odgovarajući recepti nisu pronađeni  ---</emphasis> će se prikazati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:784
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching by Rating Criteria"
msgstr "Pretraživanje po kriterijima ocjenjivanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:785
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To search by rating criteria, select the <emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> "
"beside the <guilabel>By criteria:</guilabel> label. First, select the "
"criteria that you want to use for your rating from the drop-down menu. In "
"the text box next to this, enter the value of the number of stars for which "
"you want recipes displayed, for example, 4. Entry is permitted in the "
"following formats &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Da pretražujete po kriterijima ocjenjivanja, izaberite <emphasis>radio "
"button</emphasis> pored oznake <guilabel>Po kriterijima:</guilabel>. Prvo, "
"izaberite kriterij kojeg želite da koristite za svoju ocjenu iz padajućeg "
"menija. U okviru za tekst pored ovog, unesite vrijednost broja zvjezdica za "
"kojeg želite prikazati recepte, na primjer, 4. Unos je dozvoljen u sljedećim "
"formatima &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:794
#, no-c-format
msgid "whole numbers, &eg; 3"
msgstr "cijeli brojevi, &eg; 3"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:795
#, no-c-format
msgid "numbers that include fractional amounts, &eg; 3.5"
msgstr "brojevi koji uključuju razlomljeni dio, &eg; 3.5"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid "whole number ranges, &eg; 3-4"
msgstr "opsezi cijelih brojeva, &eg; 3-4"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid "ranges that include fractional amounts, &eg; 3.5-4"
msgstr "opsezi koji uključuju razlomljeni dio, &eg; 3.5-4"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that, if you enter a fractional amount, for instance, 3.5, it will "
"display in the format that you have chosen for your preferences when "
"transferred to the listbox &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev>3.5 will display as "
"3.5 if you have chosen numbers to display in decimal format, or 3&#189; if "
"you have chosen numbers to display as fractions. See the section <link "
"linkend=\"custom-formatting\">Customizing Formatting</link> for an "
"explanation of setting formatting preferences."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da, ukoliko unesete razlomak, na primjer, 3.5, on će biti "
"prikazan u formatu koji ste odabrali za vaše preference kada je prebačen u "
"listbox &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev>3.5 će biti prikazano kao 3.5 ukoliko "
"ste odabrali prikaz brojava u decimalnom formatu, ili 3&#189; ako ste "
"odabrali brojeve kako bi se prikazao kao frakcija. Pogledaj poglavlje <link "
"linkend=\"custom-formatting\">Prilagođeno oblikovanje</link> za objašnjenje "
"podešavanje postavki formatiranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:810
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, if no range is specified, the search will find recipes that "
"have an assigned star rating in a range of &#177;&#189; of the value "
"entered, 3&#189; to 4&#189; stars in the example."
msgstr ""
"Osim toga, ako opseg nije naveden, pretraživanje će naći recepte koji imaju "
"dodijeljenu zvjezdicu u opsegu od &#177;&#189; od navedene vrijednosti, "
"3&#189; do 4&#189; zvjezdice u ovom primjeru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:814
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have chosen the parameters by which you want to search, click the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> beside the "
"text box in which you entered the number of stars to have the criteria added "
"to the list. More than one criteria may be utilized in the search. Once you "
"have entered your search parameters, click the <guibutton> Search</"
"guibutton> button and the recipes that meet the search criteria will display "
"under the <guilabel>Title</guilabel> label on the right. Should no recipes "
"meet the criteria, <emphasis>--- No matching recipes found ---</emphasis> "
"will display."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste izabrali parametre po kojim želite da tražite, kliknite "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> pored okvira "
"za tekst u kojem ste unijeli broj zvijezdica da se kriterij doda na lisu. U "
"pretrezi se može koristi više od jednog kriterija. Nakon što se unijeli "
"parametre pretrage, kliknite na tipku <guibutton> Pretraživanje</guibutton> "
"i recepti koji zadovoljavaju kriterije pretrage će se prikazati ispod oznake "
"<guilabel>Naslova</guilabel> na desnoj strani. Ukoliko nema recepata koji ne "
"ispunjavaju kriterije, prikazati će se poruka <emphasis>--- Nema pronađenih "
"recepata---</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:825
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For english language, the decimal separator is <quote>.</quote> (period), "
"however if you have configured &kde; for other language, the decimal "
"separator may be different. Note that if you are typing an invalid number "
"the text becomes red to warn you."
msgstr ""
"Za engleski jezik, decimalni zarez je <quote>.</quote> (period), međutim, "
"ako ste podesili &kde; za drugi jezik, decimalni zarez se može razlikovati. "
"Imajte na umu da ako kucate nevažeći broj tekst postaje crven da vas upozori."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Wildcards in Searches"
msgstr "Upotreba džokera pri pretraživanju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:837
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Wildcards</emphasis> are a single character used to replace either "
"multiple or single characters in a text string. Wildcards supported in "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> are the <quote>*</quote> and <quote>?</"
"quote> characters. The <quote>*</quote> character is used to replace any "
"number of characters in a string, while the <quote>?</quote> is used to "
"replace a single character. Both can be used to replace any alpha-numeric "
"character, including a space."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Džokeri</emphasis> su jedan znak koji se koristi za zamjenu jednog "
"ili više znakova u tekstu. Znakovi koji su podržani kao džokeri u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> su <quote>*</quote> i <quote>?</quote>. "
"<quote>*</quote> znak se koristi za zamjenu bilo kojeg brja ili znaka u niz, "
"dok se <quote>?</quote> koristi za zamjenu jednog znaka. Oba se mogu "
"koristiti za zamjenu bilokojeg  alfa-numeričkog znaka, uključujući i prazan "
"prostor."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:845
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples of Wildcard Searches"
msgstr "Primjeri pretraživanja sa džokerima"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:849
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wildcard Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje sa džokerima"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:849
#, no-c-format
msgid "Possible Results Returned"
msgstr "Mogući vraćeni rezultati"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:853
#, no-c-format
