msgstr "jaja"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:874
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering and Editing Recipes"
msgstr "Unos i izmjena recepata"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:877
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a New Recipe"
msgstr "Dodavanje novog recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:879
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a new recipe, click on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"document-new."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> icon that "
"appears in the first position on the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"toolbar. The <quote>Edit Recipe</quote> screen will display."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate novi recept, kliknite na ikonu "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"document-new."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> koja se "
"prikazuje na prvom mjestu u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> alatnoj traci. "
"Prikazaće se ekran <quote>Izmijeni recept</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:886
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Edit Recipe</quote> screen has four tabs. Each permits entry of a "
"different aspect of the recipe. These tabs are &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<quote>Izmijeni recept</quote> ekran ima četiri kartice. Svaka dozvoljava "
"unos različitog aspekta recepta. Ove kartice su &mdash;"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:890
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recipe"
msgstr "Recept"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:891
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Ingredients</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Sastojci</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:892
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Instructions</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:893
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Ratings</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Ocjene</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:899
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the recipe entry screen showing the 4 tabs."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana za unos recepta koji prikazuje 4 kartice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:908
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Recipe Entry Interface"
msgstr "Interfejs za unos recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:913
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It should also be noted that in the left-hand pane of the window, a button "
"shows at the bottom of the component list that initially displays "
"<quote>Write the recipe title here</quote>. This will change to the name of "
"the recipe once it has been entered."
msgstr ""
"Takođe treba napomenuti da se u lijevom oknu prozora prikazuje taster na dnu "
"liste komponenti koja na početku prikazuje <quote>Napišite naziv recepta "
"ovdje</quote>. Ovo će se promijeniti u ime recepta nakon što je on unesen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:921
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Recipe Description"
msgstr "Opis recepta"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:924
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding the Recipe Name"
msgstr "Dodavanje imena recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:925
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The title of the recipe is entered in the text box containing the prompt "
"<quote>Write the recipe title here</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Naslov recepta se unosi u okvir za tekst koji sadrži prompt <quote>Napišite "
"naziv recept ovdje</quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:930
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding the Recipe Author/Contributor"
msgstr "Dodavanje autora/saradnika recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:932
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter an author for the recipe, click on the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" format="
"\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> that appears to the "
"right of the <quote>Authors</quote> box."
msgstr ""
"Da unesete autora za recept, kliknite na <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" format="
"\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> taster koji se nalazi "
"desno od okvira za tekst <quote>Autori</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:937
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window will appear where the author or contributor of the recipe can be "
"selected from the drop-down menu. Once selected, transfer the name to the "
"list box below by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button that "
"appears to the right of the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Pojaviće se prozor u kojem se može izabrati autor ili saradnik recepta iz "
"padajućeg menija. Nakon što je izabrano, prenesite ime u okvir za listu "
"ispod klikom na taster <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"list-add.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></"
"guiicon> koji se prikazuje desno od padajućeg menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:944
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An author's name can be typed directly into the text box and transferred to "
"the list box as described above. As you start entering characters, if there "
"are authors that match the text string typed, the menu will display a list "
"of existing choices from which you can choose to transfer the author's name "
"to the list box, as described above."
msgstr ""
"Ime autora se može otkucati direktno u okvir za tekst i prenijeti u okvir za "
"listu kao što je gore opisano. Nakon što počnete da unosite znakove, ako "
"postoje autori koji odgovaraju ukucanom nizu znakova, meni će prikazati "
"listu postojećih izbora iz koje možete izabrati da prenesete ime autora u "
"okvir za listu, kao što je opisano gore."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:950
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, in the situation where the author does not exist in your list, no "
"choices will be listed as you type and when you click the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button to "
"transfer the author to the listbox, the author will automatically be added "
"to your list of authors as well. Also see <link linkend=\"authors-component"
"\">The Authors Component.</link> for information on adding an author to the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, u situaciji u kojoj autor ne postoji u listi, izbor će biti odabran "
"kada upišete i kliknete "
"na<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> tipku za "
"prijenos autoa na listbox, autor će automatski biti dodan u vašu listu "
"autora. Također pogledajte <link linkend=\"authors-component\">The Authors "
"Component.</link> za informacije o dodavanju autora na listu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:959
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An author may also be removed from the list by clicking the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button."
msgstr ""
"Autor se može takođe ukloniti iz liste klikom na taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:966
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to accept. The window will "
"close and the name of the selected author will appear under the heading."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da prihvatite. Prozor će se "
"zatvoriti i ime izabranog autora će se pojaviti pod naslovom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:969
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To cancel selection of an author, click on the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Da otkažete izbor autora, kliknite na taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:975
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting the Recipe Category"
msgstr "Odabir kategorije recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:977
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, the recipe category is selected by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> beside the "
"category box."
msgstr ""
"Onda, kategorija recepta se izabere klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> pored okvira za "
"tekst kategorije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:982
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a category, click on the check box beside the category name and "
"click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to accept the selection or, the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the selection. Either way, "
"the window will close."
msgstr ""
"Za odabir kategorije, kliknite na potvrdni okvir pored imena kategorije i "
"kliknite na taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da prihvatite izbor ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da poništite izbor. U svakom slučaju, prozor "
"će se zatvoriti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:987
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add a category here. Simply click on the "
"<guibutton>New Category...</guibutton> button. Add a new category in the "
"same manner as described in the section entitled <link linkend=\"categories-"
"component\">The Categories Component</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je takođe moguće dodati kategoriju. Jednostavno kliknite na taster "
"<guibutton>Nova kategorija...</guibutton>. Dodajte novu kategoriju na isti "
"način kao što je opisano u poglavlju pod naslovom <link linkend=\"categories-"
"component\">Komponenta Kategorije</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:995
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the Yield Amount and Type"
msgstr "Postavljanje količine i vrste prinosa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:997
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting the amount that the recipe will yield is performed by entering a "
"value in the text box beneath the <guilabel>Amount</guilabel> label. It is "
"possible to enter a numerical range for this number, for example, 3-4. When "
"entering a range, if an incorrect value or format is entered, the entry will "
"turn red indicating that a correction is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje količine koju će recept dati se vrši unosom vrijednosti u okvir "
"za tekst ispod oznake <guilabel>Količina</guilabel> label. Moguće je da "
"unesete opseg brojeva za ovaj broj, na primjer, 3-4. Kada unosite opseg, ako "
"se unosi pogrešna vrijednost ili format, unos će postati crven što ukazuje "
"da je potrebna ispravka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1004
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second part of entering a yield is to enter the <emphasis>type</"
"emphasis>. This is done by entering text in the text box beneath the "
"<guilabel>Type</guilabel> label. The text entered can be anything you choose "
"that is appropriate for the recipe yield type, for example, "
"<emphasis>servings</emphasis>, <emphasis>dozen</emphasis>, or "
"<emphasis>squares</emphasis>. As you begin to type the yield type, "
"&krecipes; will match it to any previously entered yield types and if any "
"are found, they will appear in a list from which you can select the "
"appropriate one."
msgstr ""
"Drugi dio unosa ploda je unos u <emphasis>tip</emphasis>. To se radi unosom "
"teksta u okvir za tekst ispod oznake <guilabel>Tip</guilabel>. Uneseni tekst "
"može biti bilo šta, da odaberete koji je recept prikladan za potrebu, na "
"primjer, <emphasis>porcije</emphasis>, <emphasis>desetak</emphasis>, ili "
"<emphasis>squares</emphasis>. Kao što počnete kucati na vrstu prinosa, "
"&krecipes; će odgovarati na bilo koje prethodno unesenu vrstu prinosa i ako "
"ih ne nađe, oni će se pojaviti na listi iz koje možete odabrati jedan "
"odgovarajući."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1017
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifying Preparation Time"
msgstr "Navođenje vremena pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1019
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The time it takes to prepare a recipe is designated by utilizing a spinbox."
msgstr ""
"Vrijeme koje je potrebno za pripremu recepta se određuje upotrebom spinboxa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1022
#, no-c-format
msgid "However, the time must be specified in two steps &mdash;"
msgstr "Međutim, vrijeme se mora navesti u dva koraka &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1025
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the digits prior to the <emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> symbol that "
"specify the hours and increment the time until the desired number is reached."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite cifre prije znaka <emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> koje određuju sate i "
"povećavajte vrijeme sve dok se ne dostigne željeni broj."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1029
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the digits after to the <emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> symbol that "
"specify the minutes and increment the time until the desired number is "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite cifre poslije znaka <emphasis>&#058;</emphasis> koje određuju "
"minute i povećavajte vrijeme sve dok se ne dostigne željeni broj."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1037
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the Default Photo"
msgstr "Promjena standardne slike"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1039
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Recipe</guilabel> tab, the displayed photo can also be "
"changed by clicking on the <guibutton>...</guibutton> button and selecting a "
"photo for insertion. Alternatively, a photo may be inserted by dragging a "
"graphic from any other application, for example a web page, and dropping it "
"onto the photo in the Recipe tab while in edit mode."
msgstr ""
"U kartici <guilabel>Recept</guilabel>, prikazana slika se može promijeniti "
"klikom na taster <guibutton>...</guibutton> i izborom slike za umetanje. "
"Alternativno, slika se može umetnuti povlačenjem slike iz bilo koje druge "
"aplikacije, na primjer web stranice, i ispuštanjem na sliku u kartici Recept "
"dok je u režimu izmjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1046
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The change in the graphic applies <emphasis>only to the current recipe</"
"emphasis>."
msgstr "Promjena slike se odnosi <emphasis>samo na trenutni recept</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1049
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To revert to the original, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> graphic, click on "
"the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"edit-clear."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button. "
"This can be done before the recipe is saved or after saving it."
msgstr ""
"Da vratite originalnu, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> sliku, kliknite "
"taster <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"edit-"
"clear.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>. "
"Ovo se može uraditi prije ili nakon što se recept snimi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1054
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To display NO photo in the recipe, refer to the section <link linkend="
"\"displayed-items\">Selecting Items to Display</link> for further "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Da NE prikazujete sliku u receptu, pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"displayed-items\">Odabir stavki za prikazivanje</link> za dodatna uputstva."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1062
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of a completed recipe description in the Recipe tab of "
"the &krecipes; recipe entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završenog opisa recepta u kartici Recept "
"&krecipes; interfejsa za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1071
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Recipe Entry &ndash; The Completed Recipe Tab"
msgstr "Unos novog recepta &ndash; Kartica završenog recepta"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1081
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Recipe Ingredients"
msgstr "Unošenje sastojaka recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1083
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter the recipe ingredients, click on the <guilabel>Ingredients</"
"guilabel> tab. By default, the radio button beside the label "
"<guilabel>Ingredient:</guilabel> is selected. However, <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> also allows the entry of a <guilabel>Header:</guilabel> by "
"selecting the radio button beside this label."
msgstr ""
"Da unesete sastojke recepta, kliknite na karticu <guilabel>Sastojci</"
"guilabel>. Po defaultu, radio button pored oznake <guilabel>Sastojak:</"
"guilabel> je izabran. Međutim, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> takođe "
"dozvoljava da se unese <guilabel>Naslov:</guilabel> izborom radio buttona "
"pored ove oznake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1091
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ideally, the header should be created first, for example <quote>Cake</quote> "
"or <quote>Frosting</quote>. To do this, ensure that the <guilabel>Header:</"
"guilabel> radio button is selected. Enter the desired name for the header in "
"the text box then, press the &Enter; key, or click the <guibutton>Add "
"ingredient</guibutton> button located at the top right-hand side of the "
"ingredient list. Once this is done, the radio button will automatically "
"revert to the <guilabel>Ingredient:</guilabel> selection. Then, ingredients "
"can be entered. You will note that as you enter each ingredient, it will "
"appear below the header indented in a <quote>file tree</quote> type of "
"format."
msgstr ""
"U idealnom slučaju, zaglavlje treba prvo kreirati, na primjer<quote>Kolač</"
"quote> ili <quote>Glazure</quote>. Da biste to učinili, osigurajte da je "
"odabrano <guilabel>Zaglavlje:</guilabel>. U polje unesite željeni naziv "
"zaglavlja a zatim, pritisnite, tipku &Enter;, ili kliknite na tipku "
"<guibutton>Dodaj sastojak</guibutton> koja se nalazi u gornjoj desnoj strani "
"liste sastojaka. Kada ste to uradili, radio button će automatski vratiti na "
"sekciju <guilabel>sastojci:</guilabel>. Zatim se mogu unositi sastojci. Vi "
"ćete tako primetiti svaki unesei sastojak, on će se pojaviti ispod zaglavlja "
"uvučen u <quote>stablo datoteke</quote> vrstu formata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although it is ideal to enter the header first and then the ingredients "
"associated with that header, you can also enter the header after entering "
"the ingredients. Enter the header as described above, then move the "
"ingredient into the header by utilizing the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-down.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> or "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"up.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button to "
"position the ingredient until it appears indented below the appropriate "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Iako je idealna za prvi i onda sastojke povezati sa tim, unesite zaglavlje, "
"možete ući, nakon ulaska u sastojke. Unesite zaglavlje kako je gore opisano, "
"a zatim pomaknite sastojak u header koristeći "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-down.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ili "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"up.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> tasterza "
"pozicioniranje sastojaka unutar toga dok se ne pojavi uvučen ispod "
"odgovarajuće header."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredients are entered by filling in the appropriate text box under the "
"headings &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Sastojci se unose popunjavanjem odgovarajućeg okvira za tekst pod naslovima "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ingredient: &ndash; the ingredient is entered here, for example, Sugar"
msgstr "Sastojak: &ndash; sastojak se unosi ovdje, na primjer, šećer"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type in the first few letters of the ingredient. If it exists in the "
"ingredient list, it will appear in the text box <quote>grayed-out</quote>. "
"To select the gray-out ingredient, tab to the next text box."
msgstr ""
"Ukucajte nekoliko prvih slova sastojka. Ako sastojak postoji u listi "
"sastojaka, pojaviće se u okviru za tekst <quote>zasivljen</quote>. Da "
"izaberete zasivljeni sastojak, prijeđite tipkom TAB u sljedeći okvir za "
"tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Ingredient can also be selected from the <quote>drop-down</quote> menu."
msgstr "Sastojak se takođe može izabrati iz <quote>padajućeg</quote> menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Amount: &ndash; the amount of the ingredient required, for example, &#189; "
"or 1-2 --> note that <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will allow the entry of "
"ranges for ingredients"
msgstr ""
"Količina: &ndash; potrebna količina sastojka, na primjer, &#189; ili 1-2 --> "
"imajte na umu da će <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> dozvoliti unos opsega za "
"sastojke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unit: &ndash; the unit of measurement, for example, <emphasis>teaspoon</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Mjera: &ndash; jedinica mjere, na primjer, <emphasis>čajna kašika</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you enter a unit, if it does not exist in your <emphasis>Units list</"
"emphasis>, it will automatically be added and a dialog box will appear "
"prompting for the entry of a plural for the unit. Enter the plural in the "
"text box beside the label <guilabel>Plural:</guilabel>. Additionally, you "
"can add an abbreviation for both the singular and plural forms of the unit "
"as shown in the following diagram."
msgstr ""
"Kada unesete mjeru, ako ona ne postoji u vašoj <emphasis>listi mjera</"
"emphasis>, automatski će se dodati i okvir dijaloga će se pojaviti tražeći "
"da unesete množinu za mjeru. Unesite množinu u okvir za tekst pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Množina:</guilabel>. Osim toga, možete dodati skraćenicu i za "
"jedninu i za množinu mjere kao što je prikazano na sljedećem dijagramu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A drop-down menu is also available for selecting a <guilabel>Type:</"
"guilabel> for the new unit. Choices for this are: &nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"Padajući meni je takođe dostupan za odabir <guilabel>Vrsta:</guilabel> za "
"novu mjeru. Opcije za ovo su: &nbsp;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mass, for those units that are based on weight, for example, pound"
msgstr "Masa, za one mjere koje su zasnovane na težini, na primjer, funta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Volume, for those units that are based on a volume measure, for example "
"teaspoon, fluid ounce, or cup"
msgstr ""
"Zapremina, za one mjere koje su zasnovane na mjeri zapremine, na primjer "
"čajna kašika, tečna unca ili šolja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other, for those units that are neither a neither mass, nor volume or where "
"a weight might be dependent on the size of the unit, for example "
"<emphasis>bag</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Druga, za one mjere koje nisu ni masa ni zapremina ili za koje bi težina "
"mogla zavisiti od veličine mjere, na primjer <emphasis>kesa</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifying the unit type is important for the purpose of your unit "
"conversions which, in combination with nutrient weights, help determine the "
"nutrient values in your recipes. For a more detailed explanation of adding "
"and maintaining units of measure, see <link linkend=\"units-component\"> The "
"Units Component</link>. For more information about ingredient weights, see "
"<link linkend=\"ingredients-component\">The Ingredients Component</link>."
msgstr ""
"Navođenje vrste mjere je bitno za pretvaranja vaših mjera koje, u "
"kombinaciji sa težinom hranljivih tvari, pomažu odrediti vrijednosti "
"hranljivih tvari u vašim receptima. Za detaljnije objašnjenje dodavanja i "
"održavanja jedinica mjere, pogledajte <link linkend=\"units-component"
"\">Komponenta Mjere</link>. Za više informacija o težinama sastojaka, "
"pogledajte <link linkend=\"ingredients-component\">Komponenta Sastojci</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Preparation Method: &ndash; the method of preparing the ingredient, for "
"example, <emphasis>chopped</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Način pripreme: &ndash; način pripremanja sastojka, na primjer, "
"<emphasis>sjeckani</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1173
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Preparation Method can also be selected from a drop-down menu."
msgstr "Način pripreme se može takođe izabrati iz padajućeg menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will accept multiple preparation methods in "
"a comma-separated list, for example, <emphasis>peeled,chopped</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> će prihvatiti više načina pripreme u listi "
"odvojenoj zarezima, na primjer, <emphasis>oguljen,sjeckan</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> also permits the entry of alternate "
"ingredients. To enter an alternate ingredient, simply click on the tick box "
"that appears between the <emphasis>Preparation Method:</emphasis> text box "
"and the <guilabel>OR</guilabel> label. A row identical to the one that you "
"have just finished will appear for completing the alternative choice."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> takođe dozvoljava unos alternativnih "
"sastojaka. Da unesete alternativni sastojak, jednostavno kliknite na "
"potvrdni okvir koji se prikazuje između okvira za tekst <emphasis>Način "
"pripreme:</emphasis> i oznake <guilabel>ILI</guilabel>. Red istovjetan onom "
"kojeg ste upravo završili će se pojaviti za završavanje alternativnog izbora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add the ingredient(s) to the ingredient list, simply press the &Enter; "
"key."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate sastojak (sastojke) u listu sastojaka, jednostavno pritisnite "
"tipku &Enter;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the <guibutton>Add Ingredient</guibutton> button on "
"the right-hand side of the ingredient list."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, kliknite na taster <guibutton>Dodaj sastojak</guibutton> desno "
"od liste sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a particular field is not required to describe an ingredient <emphasis>it "
"can be left blank</emphasis>!"
msgstr ""
"Ako određeno polje nije potrebno da opiše sastojak <emphasis>može se "
"ostaviti prazno</emphasis>!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An ingredient may be removed from the list by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button to "
"the right of the ingredient list."
msgstr ""
"Sastojak se može ukloniti iz liste klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> taster desno "
"od liste sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An ingredient may also be repositioned in the list by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"up.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> or the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-down.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button that "
"appear on the right of the ingredient list."
msgstr ""
"Položaj sastojka u listi se može promijeniti klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"up.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ili "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-down.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> taster koji se "
"nalaze desno od liste sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once an ingredient has been transferred to the ingredient list, the "
"<quote>Amount</quote>, <quote>Units</quote> and <quote>Preparation Method</"
"quote> fields may be edited by double-clicking on the particular component "
"that needs to be changed."
msgstr ""
"Kada je sastojak prenesen u listu sastojaka, polja <quote>Količina</quote>, "
"<quote>Mjere</quote> i <quote>Način pripreme</quote> se mogu izmijeniti "
"dvoklikom na određenu komponentu koja treba da se promijeni."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the completed Ingredients tab in the &krecipes; "
"recipe entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završene kartice Sastojci u &krecipes; interfejsu "
"za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Entering Ingredients &ndash; Ranges for the <emphasis>Amount</emphasis> and "
"Alternate Ingredients are permitted"
msgstr ""
"Unos sastojaka &ndash; Opsezi za <emphasis>količinu</emphasis> i "
"alternativni sastojci su dozvoljeni"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Looking After Nutrients"
msgstr "Briga o hranljivim tvarima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Directly beneath the ingredients list, there is a visible means to obtain "
"the status of your recipe nutrients. Beside the label <guilabel>Property "
"Status:</guilabel>, text and an <emphasis>LED</emphasis> style indicator are "
"used to depict this information."
msgstr ""
"Odmah ispod liste sastojaka, postoji vidljivo sredstvo da dobijete stanje "
"hranljivih tvari vašeg recepta. Pored oznake <guilabel>Stanje osobine:</"
"guilabel>, tekst i <emphasis>LED</emphasis> pokazatelj stila se koriste da "
"prikažu ovu informaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A green status indicator means that your nutrient information is complete. "
"However, you will note from the above graphic, that the nutrient information "
"for this recipe is <emphasis>Incomplete</emphasis> and the indicator shows "
"as red. To find out exactly what is needed to complete the nutrient "
"information, click the <guibutton>Details</guibutton> button. A window will "
"appear explaining what the problems are, for example: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Zeleni pokazatelj stanja znači da je vaša informacija o hranljivim tvarima "
"potpuna. Međutim, primijetit ćete sa slike iznad, da je informacija o "
"hranljivim tvarima za ovaj recept <emphasis>Nepotpuna</emphasis> i "
"pokazatelj pokazuje crveno. Da saznate šta je tačno potrebno da upotpunite "
"informaciju o hranljivim tvarima, kliknite taster <guibutton>Detalji</"
"guibutton>. Pojavit će se prozor koji objašnjava šta su problemi, na "
"primjer: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog is telling you that, for the ingredient <emphasis>apples</"
"emphasis>, there are two possible reasons for the property or "
"<emphasis>nutrient</emphasis> information being incomplete: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dijalog vam govori da za sastojak <emphasis>jabuke</emphasis>, postoje "
"dva moguća razloga za  osobine ili <emphasis>nutrient</emphasis> informacije "
"koje nisu potpune: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1257
#, no-c-format
msgid "An ingredient weight or nutrient information has not been provided."
msgstr "Težina ili informacija o hranljivim tvarima sastojka nije ponuđena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredient weights and nutrient information are set in the <emphasis> "
"Ingredients</emphasis> component. Note that you can also click the links to "
"show a dialog to input the property information for the corresponding "
"ingredient. See <link linkend=\"ingredients-component\">The Ingredients "
"Component</link> for instructions on all aspects of setting ingredient "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Težine sastojka i informacija o hranljivim tvarima se postavljaju u "
"komponenti <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>. Imajte na umu da možete takođe "
"kliknuti na veze da prikažete dijalog za unos informacije osobine za "
"odgovarajući sastojak. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"ingredients-component"
"\">Komponenta Sastojci</link> za uputstvo o svim aspektima postavljanja "
"detalja sastojka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1265
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>or,</para>"
msgstr "<para>ili,</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1267
#, no-c-format
msgid "Conversion information is lacking."
msgstr "Informacija o pretvaranju nedostaje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For this example, you are being told that a conversion from <quote>No unit</"
"quote> to <quote>cup</quote> and <quote>cup</quote> to <quote>grams</quote> "
"cannot be done. Conversion factors for your units are set in the "
"<emphasis>Units</emphasis> component. For more information on Units and "
"their conversions see <link linkend=\"units-component\">The Units Component</"
"link>."
msgstr ""
"U ovom primjeru, rečeno vam je da se pretvaranje iz <quote>Nema mjere</"
"quote> u <quote>čaša</quote> i iz <quote>čaša</quote> u <quote>grami</quote> "
"ne može uradi. Faktori pretvaranje za vaše mjere su postavljeni u komponenti "
"<emphasis>Mjere</emphasis>. Za više informacija o mjerama i njihovima "
"pretvaranjima pogledajte <link linkend=\"units-component\">Komponenta Mjere</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An entirely different message would result on clicking the "
"<guibutton>Details</guibutton> button had the unit in the above screenshot "
"been supplied with no preparation method specified."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno drugačija poruka bi bila prikazana pri kliku na taster "
"<guibutton>Detalji</guibutton> da za mjeru u gore navedenoj snimljenoj slici "
"ekrana nije naveden način pripreme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The message in the above graphic also indicates that an approximation will "
"be made for the ingredient <emphasis>butter</emphasis> because "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> cannot find weight information that is "
"specific to the preparation method <emphasis>melted</emphasis> when "
"associated with this ingredient."
msgstr ""
"Poruka na slici gore takođe ukazuje da će se napraviti aproksimacija za "
"sastojak <emphasis>maslac</emphasis> jer <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ne "
"može pronaći informaciju o težini koja je specifična za način pripreme "
"<emphasis>rastopljen</emphasis> kada je u vezi sa ovim sastojkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We can use the following table to assist in making a correction for apples."
msgstr ""
"Možemo koristiti sljedeću tabelu kao pomoć u pravljenju ispravke za jabuke."

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Measure"
msgstr "Mjera"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Diameter"
msgstr "Prečnik"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equivalent 1"
msgstr "Ekvivalent 1"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equivalent 2"
msgstr "Ekvivalent 2"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equivalent 3"
msgstr "Ekvivalent 3"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equivalent 4"
msgstr "Ekvivalent 4"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 large apple"
msgstr "1 velika jabuka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid "3 3/4\" (9.5 cm)"
msgstr "3 3/4\" (9.5 cm)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1298
#, no-c-format
msgid "2 cups, sliced or chopped"
msgstr "2 čaše, rezano ili sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1299
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 1/2 cups, finely chopped"
msgstr "1 1/2 čaša, sitno sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1299
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 1/4 cups, grated"
msgstr "1 1/4 čaša, naribano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1300
#, no-c-format
msgid "3/4 cups, sauce"
msgstr "3/4 čaše, sos"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1302
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 medium apple"
msgstr "1 srednja jabuka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1302
#, no-c-format
msgid "2 3/4\" (7 cm)"
msgstr "2 3/4\" (7 cm)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1302
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 1/3 cups, sliced or chopped"
msgstr "1 1/3 čaše, rezano ili sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1303
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 cup, finely chopped"
msgstr "1 čaša, sitno sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1303
#, no-c-format
msgid "3/4 cup, grated"
msgstr "3/4 čaše, naribano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1304
#, no-c-format
msgid "1/2 cup, sauce"
msgstr "1/2 čaše, sos"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 small apple"
msgstr "1 mala jabuka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid "2 1/4\" (5.7 cm)"
msgstr "2 1/4\" (5.7 cm)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid "3/4 cup, sliced or chopped"
msgstr "3/4 čaše, rezano ili sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1307
#, no-c-format
msgid "3/4 cup, finely chopped"
msgstr "3/4 čaše, sitno sjeckano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1307
#, no-c-format
msgid "1/2 cup, grated"
msgstr "1/2 čaše, naribano"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1308
#, no-c-format
msgid "1/3 cup, sauce"
msgstr "1/3 čaše, sos"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1310
#, no-c-format
msgid "1 pound apples"
msgstr "1 funta jabuka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1310 index.docbook:1312
#, no-c-format
msgid "&nbsp;"
msgstr "&nbsp;"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1310
#, no-c-format
msgid "2 large apples"
msgstr "2 velike jabuke"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1311
#, no-c-format
msgid "3 medium apples"
msgstr "3 srednje jabuke"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1311
#, no-c-format
msgid "4 small apples"
msgstr "4 male jabuke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Information for the compilation of the above table can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.usapple.org/consumers/appleguide/equivalents.cfm\"></ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Informacije za izradu gornje tabele se mogu naći na <ulink url=\"http://www."
"usapple.org/consumers/appleguide/equivalents.cfm\"></ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the above table and assuming that the size of the apples is "
"<emphasis>medium</emphasis>, you might add a weigh entry for medium apples "
"in your ingredient weight table. See <link linkend=\"ingredients-component"
"\">The Ingredients Component</link> for explicit instructions on doing this."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći tabelu iznad i pod pretpostavkom da je veličina jabuke "
"<emphasis>srednja</emphasis>, mogli biste dodati stavku o težini za srednje "
"jabuke u svoju tabelu za težinu sastojaka. Pogledajte <link linkend="
"\"ingredients-component\">Komponenta Sastojci</link> za određeno uputstvo "
"kako da to uradite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above table indicates that 1 pound of apples is equivalent to 3 medium "
"apples. However, the weight table in the <emphasis>Ingredients Component</"
"emphasis> requires that the weight be in <emphasis>grams</emphasis>. If we "
"know that 1 pound equals 454 grams, and that 3 medium apples weigh 454 "
"grams, then 1 apple will equal 151.3 grams. We will assume that this "
"conversion has been added correctly to your weight table. Also, if the "
"equivalent has been added to the weight table with no preparation method "
"specified, you will have to remove the preparation method <emphasis>sliced</"
"emphasis> in order to completely update the status indicator for "
"<emphasis>apples</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Gornja tabela pokazuje da je £ 1 ekvivalentno za 3 srednje jabuke. Međutim, "
"za stolnu težinu <emphasis>Sastojci komponente</emphasis> zahtijeva da "
"težina bude u <emphasis>gramima</emphasis>. Ako znamo da je 1 £ jednako 454 "
"grama, te 3 jabuke težine 454 grama, a zatim slijedi da jedna jabuka iznosi "
"151,3 grama. Mi ćemo pretpostaviti da je ova konverzija dodana u vašu težinu "
"stola. Također, ako je ekvivalent dodan u težini stola bez nevedene metode "
"pripreme, morat ćemo ukloniti metodu pripreme <emphasis>rezani</emphasis> "
"kako bi se u potpunosti ažuriralo stanje za  <emphasis>jabuke</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After adding the weight for <emphasis>apples</emphasis> in the "
"<emphasis>Ingredients Component</emphasis>, if you return to your recipe and "
"the <emphasis>LED</emphasis> status indicator hasn't changed, you can click "
"on it to cause an update."
msgstr ""
"Nakon dodavanja težine za <emphasis>jabuke</emphasis> u <emphasis>komponenti "
"Sastojci</emphasis>, ako se vratite na svoj recept i <emphasis>LED</"
"emphasis> pokazatelj stanja se nije promijenio, možete kliknuti na njega da "
"izazovete ažuriranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To assist you with your conversions, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> has a "
"nifty tool that can be found by selecting <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> and "
"<guimenuitem>Measurement Converter</guimenuitem>. This helper will be more "
"fully discussed in <link linkend=\"measure-converter\">Using the Measurement "
"Converter</link>."
msgstr ""
"Da vam pomogne sa vašim pretvaranjima, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ima "
"izvanredan alat koji se može naći odabirom <guimenu>Alati</guimenu> pa "
"<guimenuitem>Pretvarač mjera</guimenuitem>. O ovom pomagalu će se potpunije "
"raspravljati u<link linkend=\"measure-converter\">Upotreba pretvarača mjera</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After making the adjustment for apples, the <emphasis>LED</emphasis> status "
"indicator will turn yellow because nutrient information is complete, but an "
"approximation has been made for the ingredient <emphasis>butter</emphasis>. "
"The <guilabel>Property Status:</guilabel> of your recipe will show as "
"<emphasis>Complete, but approximations made</emphasis>. Here, you can choose "
"to do one of the following: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Nakon što napravite prilagodbu za jabuke, <emphasis>LED</emphasis> "
"pokazatelj stanje će požutjeti jer je informacija o hranljivim tvarima "
"potpuna, ali je napravljena aproksimacija za sastojak <emphasis>maslac</"
"emphasis>. <guilabel>Stanje osobine:</guilabel> vašeg recepta će biti "
"prikazano kao <emphasis>Potpuno, ali je napravljena aproksimacija</"
"emphasis>. Ovdje možete izabrati da uradite jedno od sljedećeg: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose to enter a weight for <emphasis>melted butter</emphasis> in your "
"weight table"
msgstr ""
"Izaberite da unesete težinu za <emphasis>rastopljeni maslac</emphasis> u "
"svoju tabelu težine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Accept the approximation, in which case, your status <emphasis>LED</"
"emphasis> will remain yellow"
msgstr ""
"Prihvatite procjenu, u kojem slučaju, vaš status <emphasis>LED</emphasis> će "
"ostati žut"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remove the preparation method from <emphasis>butter</emphasis>, if it will "
"not adversely affect the preparation of your recipe."
msgstr ""
"Uklonite način pripreme iz <emphasis>maslaca</emphasis>, ako to neće "
"nepovoljno utjecati na pripremu vašeg recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choosing 1 or 3 above will allow <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> to obtain "
"accurate weight information for the ingredient and your status indicator "
"<emphasis>LED</emphasis> will turn green and the <guilabel>Property Status:</"
"guilabel> will show as <emphasis>Complete</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Biranje 1 ili 3 gore će omogućiti <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> da dobije "
"precizne informacije o težini za sastojak i vaš <emphasis>LED</emphasis> "
"pokazatelj stanja će postati zelen i <guilabel>Stanje osobine:</guilabel> će "
"se pokazati kao <emphasis>Potpuno</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Help</guibutton> button will connect you to this section of "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Handbook."
msgstr ""
"Taster <guibutton>Pomoć</guibutton> će vas povezati sa ovim poglavljem "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> priručnika."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copying Recipes from Other Sources"
msgstr "Kopiranje recepata iz drugih izvora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do you need an easy method of getting recipe ingredients into "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>? You can do that with the <emphasis>Copy/"
"Paste</emphasis> functionality!"
msgstr ""
"Da li vam treba jednostavan način unosa sastojaka recepta u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>? Možete to uraditi pomoću <emphasis>Kopiraj/"
"Umetni</emphasis> funkcionalnosti!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Find the recipe that you wish to enter into <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. "
"Start the interface for entering a new recipe and enter the appropriate "
"parameters in the <guilabel>Recipe</guilabel> tab. Move to the "
"<guilabel>Ingredients</guilabel> tab. Copy the recipe ingredients from your "
"chosen source and initiate the Copy/Paste interface by clicking the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"edit-paste.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> which "
"appears as the last item in the group of icons to the right of the "
"ingredient list. The recipe ingredients will appear in the upper portion of "
"the <interface>Ingredient Parser</interface> window."
msgstr ""
"Pronađite recept koji želite da dodate u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. "
"Pokrenite interfejs za unos novog recepta i unesite odgovarajuće parametre u "
"kartici <guilabel>Recept</guilabel>. Idite na karticu <guilabel>Sastojci</"
"guilabel>.  Kopirajte recept sastojaka iz vašeg odabranog izvora i uradite "
"Copy/Paste interfejsa klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"edit-paste.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> koji se "
"pojavljuje kao posljednja stavka u grupi kona na desno od liste sastojaka. "
"Sastojak recepta će se pojaviti u godnjem dijelu prozora <interface>Parsera "
"sastojka</interface>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make any edits that you wish in this portion of the screen. For example, if "
"the recipe lists an ingredient as <emphasis>sugar</emphasis> and you know "
"that the corresponding item in your ingredient list is <emphasis>granulated "
"sugar</emphasis>, you may want to change this. For any ingredient or unit "
"that you do not alter in this portion of the screen, the ingredient and/or "
"unit will be added to your ingredient and/or units list if it does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Napravite bilo koju izmjenu koju želite u ovom dijelu ekrana. Na primjer, "
"ako recept navodi sastojak kao <emphasis>šećer</emphasis> a vi znate da je "
"odgovarajuća stavka u vašoj listi sastojaka <emphasis>sitni šećer</"
"emphasis>, možda ćete željeti da ovo promijenite. Za bilo koji sastojak ili "
"mjeru koje ne promijenite u ovom dijelu ekrana, sastojak i/ili mjera će se "
"dodati u vašu listu sastojaka i/ili mjera ako ne postoji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once your ingredients are formatted to your liking, click the "
"<guibutton>Parse Text</guibutton> button. The ingredient list will be "
"transferred to the lower portion of the window beneath the label "
"<guilabel>Ingredients as understood by &krecipes;:</guilabel>. From this "
"portion of the screen, you can set any <emphasis>Headers</emphasis> by "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Set Header</guibutton> button to the right."
msgstr ""
"Jednom kada su sastojci formatirani po vašoj želji, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Raščlani tekst</guibutton>. Lista sastojaka će se prenijeti u "
"donji dio prozora ispod oznake <guilabel>Sastojci kao što su shvaćeni od "
"&krecipes;:</guilabel>. Iz ovog dijela ekrana, možete postaviti bilo koji "
"<emphasis>naslov</emphasis> klikom na taster <guibutton>Postavi naslov</"
"guibutton> na desnoj strani."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button that appears in the top right-"
"hand corner of window to transfer your ingredients to your recipe. You can "
"also choose not to proceed with the addition of the ingredients by clicking "
"on the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button which will close the window."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite taster<guibutton>OK</guibutton> koji se pojavljuje u gornjem desnom "
"uglu prozora da prenesete svoje sastojke u svoj recept. Takođe možete "
"odabrati da ne nastavite sa dodavanjem sastojaka klikom na taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> što će zatvoriti prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the ingredients have been transferred into the ingredient list for your "
"new recipe, they can be moved or removed as describe in the section <link "
"linkend=\"ingredients-tab\">Entering Recipe Ingredients</link> above. In "
"addition the amount, unit or preparation methods can be edited, also as "
"described above."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što su sastojci preneseni u listu sastojaka za vaš novi recept, oni se "
"mogu premjestiti ili ukloniti kao što je opisano u poglavlju <link linkend="
"\"ingredients-tab\">Unos sastojaka recepta</link> iznad.  Osim toga "
"količina, mjera ili načini pripreme se mogu izmijeniti, takođe kao što je "
"opisano iznad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can now proceed to enter the recipe instructions as described below. The "
"method for preparing your recipe can be copied from the source that you are "
"using and pasted into the <guilabel>Instructions</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete nastaviti sa unosom uputstva za recept kao što je opisano ispod. "
"Način pripreme recepta se može kopirati iz izvora kojeg upotrebljavate i "
"umetnuti u karticu <guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the edited ingredients in the &krecipes; Parser "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana izmijenjenih sastojaka u &krecipes; parser "
"interfejsu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1438
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Completed Ingredient Parser"
msgstr "Parser završenog sastojka"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1447
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering the Recipe Instructions"
msgstr "Unošenje uputstva za recept"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter the recipe instructions, click on the <guilabel>Instructions</"
"guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"Da unesete uputstvo za recept, kliknite na karticu <guilabel>Uputstvo</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Entering the recipe instructions is easy &ndash; in the white space "
"provided, simply type in the steps necessary to complete the preparation of "
"the recipe."
msgstr ""
"Unošenje uputstva za recept je jednostavno &ndash; u predviđeni prazni "
"prostor jednostavno ukucajte korake potrebne za završavanje pripreme recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make absolutely sure that typing is done in the correct area, the prompt "
"<prompt>Write the recipe instructions here</prompt> is displayed! "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"face-smile.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>"
msgstr ""
"Da bi se bilo potpuno sigurno da se kucanje vrši u ispravnom području, "
"prompt <prompt>Napišite uputstvo za recept ovdje</prompt> je prikazan! "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"face-smile.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <emphasis>VERY COOL</emphasis> part of entering the recipe instructions is "
"the <emphasis>Auto Completion</emphasis> feature! This is a real-time and "
"effort saver if your instructions refer to many of the ingredients in your "
"ingredient list, and/or if your ingredient names are lengthy. This is how it "
"works &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>VEOMA KUL</emphasis> dio unošenja uputstva za recept  je funkcija "
"<emphasis>automatsko završavanje</emphasis>! Ovo štedi vrijeme i trud ako se "
"vaše uputstvo odnosi na mnoge od sastojaka u vašoj listi sastojaka, i/ili "
"ako su imena vaših sastojaka dugačka. Evo kako to radi &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <quote>Apple Crisp</quote> recipe shown in the screenshot, we have "
"the ingredient <quote>brown sugar</quote>. As you begin typing <quote>brown "
"sugar</quote> in your recipe instructions, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"will match typed characters with ingredients in your recipe ingredient list "
"and automatically complete the remaining characters."
msgstr ""
"U receptu <quote>Hrskave jabuke</quote> koji je prikazan na snimljenoj slici "
"ekrana, ima sastojak <quote>brown sugar</quote>. Nakon što počnete kucati "
"<quote>brown sugar</quote> u uputstvo za svoj recept, <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> će uporediti otkucane znakove sa sastojcima u listi sastojaka "
"vašeg recepta i automatski završiti preostale znakove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1474
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you type <quote>b</quote>, the characters <quote>brown "
"sugar</quote> are the ones that will be auto-completed and inserted into the "
"instructions. The auto-completed characters will appear highlighted and you "
"can choose to accept the suggested ingredient by pressing the &Enter; key."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, ako kucate <quote>b</quote>, znakovi <quote>brown sugar</quote> "
"su oni koji će se automatski završiti i umetnuti u uputstvo. Automatski "
"završeni znakovi će se pojaviti naglašeni i možete odabrati da prihvatite "
"predloženi sastojak pritiskom na tipku &Enter;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, suppose that in your instructions, you simply wanted to refer to "
"<quote>brown sugar</quote> as <emphasis>sugar</emphasis> and you enter the "
"character <quote>s</quote>. <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will search the "
"ingredients in your recipe and match the first ingredient beginning with "
"<quote>s</quote> that it finds, if there is one. If there is no ingredient "
"in your recipe ingredient list beginning with <quote>s</quote>, nothing will "
"happen &ndash; you will just continue typing the word <quote>sugar</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, pretpostavimo da u vašem uputstvu, jednostavno želite da se "
"<quote>smeđi šećer</quote> odnosi na kao <emphasis>šećer</emphasis> i vi "
"unesete slovo <quote>š</quote>. <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> će "
"pretražiti sastojke u vašem receptu i odgovarajući prvi sastojak koji "
"počinju sa <quote>š</quote> da pronaže, ako postoji. Ako nema sastojaka u "
"listi recepata koji počinju sa <quote>š</quote>, ništa se neće dogoditi "
"&ndash; samo ćete nastaviti tražiti upisivanjem riječi <quote>šećer</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If there is another ingredient beginning with <quote>s</quote> in your "
"recipe ingredient list, for instance, <emphasis>salt</emphasis>, the "
"remaining characters, <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> the <quote>alt</quote>, will be "
"auto-completed and highlighted. Simply press the <keycap>Delete</keycap> key "
"on the keyboard to remove the unwanted characters and continue typing. "
"Alternatively, you can just continue typing the entire word and your "
"instructions will remain as typed."
msgstr ""
"Ako postoji još jedan sastojak koji počinje sa <quote>s</quote> u vašem "
"receptu, listi sastojaka, na primjer, <emphasis>sol</emphasis>, preostali "
"karakteri, <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> na <quote>ol</quote>,će biti automatski "
"dovršeni i istaknuti. Jednostavno pritisnite tipku <keycap>Obriši</keycap> "
"na tastaturi da uklonite neželjene karaktere i nastavite kucanje. "
"Alternativno, možete samo nastavite sa unosom cijele riječi i vaše upute će "
"ostati kao otkucane."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1499
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the completed Instructions tab in the &krecipes; "
"recipe entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završene kartice Uputstvo u &krecipes; interfejsu "
"za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1508
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Recipe Entry &ndash; The Completed Instructions Tab"
msgstr "Unos novog recepta &ndash; Završena kartica Uputstvo"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1517
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Recipe Ratings"
msgstr "Dodavanje ocjena recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1518
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> allows you to rate your recipes! Ratings by "
"multiple people are allowed, so each of your recipe <quote>tasters</quote> "
"can provide their own input. Additionally, each rating can include multiple "
"rating parameters. The default parameters against which you can rate your "
"recipe are &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> vam omogućava da ocjenjujete svoje recepte! "
"Ocjene od strane više ljudi su dozvoljene, tako da svaki od vaših "
"<quote>degustatora</quote> može pružiti svoje vlastito mišljenje. Pored "
"toga, svaka ocjena može uključivati više parametara ocjenjivanja. Standardni "
"parametri po kojima možete da ocijenite svoje recepte su &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1525
#, no-c-format
msgid "Taste"
msgstr "Ukus"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1526
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1527
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ease of Preparation"
msgstr "Jednostavnost pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1528
#, no-c-format
msgid "Originality"
msgstr "Originalnost"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1529
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overall"
msgstr "Sveukupno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1532
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Initially, in the <guilabel>Ratings</guilabel> tab, there is only a blank "
"screen with the <guibutton>Add Rating...</guibutton> button at the bottom. "
"Clicking this button will start the interface for entering ratings."
msgstr ""
"Na početku, na kartici <guilabel>Ocjene</guilabel>, ima samo prazan ekran sa "
"tasterom <guibutton>Dodaj ocjenu...</guibutton> na dnu. Klik na ovaj taster "
"će pokrenuti interfejs za unos ocjena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1537
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Ratings</emphasis> interface is comprised of the following "
"elements &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Interfejs <emphasis>Ocjene</emphasis> se sastoji od sljedećih elemenata "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1541
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rater: &ndash; this is the name of the person providing their opinion of the "
"recipe"
msgstr ""
"Ocjenjivač: &ndash; ovo je ime osobe koja daje svoje mišljenje o receptu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To complete this element <userinput>enter the rater's name</userinput> in "
"the text box that appears beside the label <guilabel>Rater:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da završite ovaj element <userinput>unesite ime ocjenjivača</userinput> u "
"okvir za tekst koji se nalazi pored oznake <guilabel>Ocjenjivača:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1547
#, no-c-format
msgid "Criteria: &ndash; this is the criteria on which the recipe is rated"
msgstr "Kriteriji: &ndash; ovo su kriteriji po kojima se recept ocjenjuje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the criteria against which you want to rate the recipe from the drop-"
"down menu that appears beside the <guilabel>Criteria:</guilabel> label. Five "
"default choices exist for rating criteria, as listed above, but if you have "
"another against which you want to rate your recipe, it can be typed directly "
"into the text box and will automatically be added to your rating criteria "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite kriterije po kojima želite da ocijenite recept iz padajućeg menija "
"koji se prikazuje pored oznake <guilabel>Kriteriji:</guilabel>. Postoji pet "
"standardnih izbora za kriterije ocjenjivanja, kao što je navedeno iznad, ali "
"ako imate još kriterija po kojima želite da ocijenite svoj recept, možete ih "
"otkucati direktno u okvir za tekst i oni će automatski biti dodani u vašu "
"listu kriterija ocjenjivanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stars: &ndash; this is the number of stars that you wish to assign to the "
"particular criteria that you are rating on"
msgstr ""
"Zvjezdice: &ndash; ovo je broj zvjezdica koje želite dodijeliti određenom "
"kriteriju po kojem ocjenjujete"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Star ratings are completed by clicking on a star. Clicking on the left-hand "
"side of any star will provide a &#189; star rating. Clicking on the right-"
"hand side of the star will provide a full star rating."
msgstr ""
"Ocjenjivanje zvjezdicom se izvrši klikom na zvjezdicu. Klik na lijevu stranu "
"bilo koje zvjezdice će dati &#189; zvjezdice. Klik na desnu stranu zvjezdice "
"će dati punu zvjezdicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is unnecessary to click on each star individually. For instance, if you "
"are rating the recipe on the <emphasis>Taste</emphasis> criteria and you "
"want to assign this a 4&#189; star rating, click on the left hand side of "
"the 5th star."
msgstr ""
"Nije potrebno da kliknete na svaku zvijezdu pojedinačno. Na primjer, ako "
"ocjenjujete recept po kriteriju <emphasis>Ukus</emphasis> i želite "
"dodijeliti 4&#189; zvjezdice, kliknite na lijevu stranu 5. zvjezdice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have completed the star rating for the recipe, click the "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton> button to add the rating to the rating list. At "
"this point, you can continue to rate the recipe against other criteria in "
"the same manner."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste završili ocjenjivanje recepta sa zvjezdicama, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> da dodate ocjenu u listu ocjena. U ovom "
"trenutku, možete nastaviti da ocjenjujete recept po drugim kriterijima na "
"isti način."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1573
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From within the rating list, both the rating criteria and the star rating "
"can be edited by double clicking on either item. The rating criteria is "
"edited the same way any text edit is done. To edit the star rating, double "
"click the stars and then type the numerical value for the number of stars "
"that you wish to assign to the rating. Once you press the &Enter; key, the "
"rating will show the graphical stars."
msgstr ""
"Iz liste ocjena, i kriterij ocjenjivanja i ocjena zvjezdicom se mogu "
"izmijeniti dvoklikom na bilo koji od njih. Kriterij ocjenjivanja se mijenja "
"na isti način kao bilo koja izmjena teksta. Da izmijenite ocjenu zvjezdicom, "
"kliknite dvoklikom zvjezdice a zatim ukucajte brojčanu vrijednost za broj "
"zvjezdica koje želite dodijeliti ocjeni. Nakon što pritisnete tipku &Enter;, "
"ocjena će prikazati slikovnu zvjezdicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1580
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Should you change your mind and wish to remove any of the rating criteria, "
"select it in your rating list and click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Ako se predomislite i želite ukloniti bilo koji od kriterija ocjenjivanja, "
"izaberite ga u svojoj listi za ocjenjivanje i kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Izbriši</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Comments: &ndash; this is any added information that you wish to note for "
"the recipe, for example, an enhancement to improve the recipe, or a serving "
"suggestion such as <emphasis>Great served with ice cream</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Komentari: &ndash; ovo je bilo kakva dodatna informacija koju želite "
"naglasiti za recept, na primjer, dodatak za poboljšanje recepta, ili "
"prijedlog za serviranje kao što je <emphasis>Odlično servirano sa "
"sladoledom</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1590
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter a comment, simply position your cursor in the white space beneath "
"the <guilabel>Comments:</guilabel> label and begin typing."
msgstr ""
"Da unesete komentar, jednostavno postavite svoj kursor u prazan prostor "
"ispod oznake <guilabel>Komentari:</guilabel> i počnite kucati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1596
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with your ratings, click the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button to complete the addition. The <quote>smiley</quote> "
"graphic that appears to the left of the rating list is indicative of the "
"overall rating of the recipe, from poor to excellent. This graphic will not "
"appear in your recipe when it is viewed."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste zadovoljni sa vašim ocjenama, kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> da završite dodavanje. Slika <quote>smješka</quote> koja se "
"prikazuje lijevo od liste ocjena ukazuje na ukupnu ocjenu recepta, od loše "
"do odlične. Ovo slika se neće pojaviti u vašem receptu kada se on pregleda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1602
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any rating can be removed from the screen by clicking the <guibutton>Remove</"
"guibutton> button beneath the rating that you wish to remove. Additionally, "
"you can use the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>M</keycap></"
"keycombo> key combination. A rating can be edited by clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> button. When you choose to edit a rating, the "
"same interface that was used to originally enter the rating is opened. Each "
"rating has its own <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> and <guibutton>Edit...</"
"guibutton> buttons."
msgstr ""
"Bilo koji rejting se može ukloniti sa ekrana klikom na <guibutton>ukloni</"
"guibutton> ispod rejting koji želite ukloniti. Osim toga, možete koristit "
"kombinaciju <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo>. "
"Rejting se može uređivati klikom na tipku <guibutton>Izmjeni...</guibutton>. "
"Kada se odlučite za uređivanje rejtingam isti interfejs koji je korišten za "
"ulazak u prvobitni rejtinf je otvoren. Svaki rejting ima svoje tipke "
"<guibutton>Obriđi</guibutton> i <guibutton>Izmjeni...</guibutton>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the completed Ratings tab in the &krecipes; recipe "
"entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana završene kartice Ocjene u &krecipes; interfejsu "
"za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1623
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Recipe Entry &ndash; The Completed Ratings Tab"
msgstr "Unos novog recepta &ndash; Završena kartica Ocjene"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1632
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recipe Actions"
msgstr "Radnje recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1634
#, no-c-format
msgid "OK! Now that the recipe has been input, what needs to be done?"
msgstr "OK! Sada kad je recept unesen, šta treba da se uradi?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1636
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following options can be selected &mdash;"
msgstr "Sljedeće opcije se mogu izabrati &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1638
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Spell-check &ndash; this is accomplished by selecting <guilabel>Check "
"Spelling</guilabel> from the context menu of the input area in the "
"<guilabel>Instructions</guilabel> tab"
msgstr ""
"Pravopisna provjera &ndash; ovo se postiže odabirom <guilabel>Provjeri "
"pravopis</guilabel> iz kontekstnog menija područja za unos kartice "
"<guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1641
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Save &ndash; click on the <guibutton>Save recipe</guibutton> button that "
"appears on the bottom of the screen"
msgstr ""
"Snimi &ndash; kliknite na taster <guibutton>Snimi recept</guibutton> koji se "
"nalazi na dnu ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Save recipe</guibutton> button can be used to save the recipe "
"at any point during the input. As with any other application, when editing, "
"it is always a good idea to save frequently!"
msgstr ""
"Taster <guibutton>Snimi recept</guibutton> se može koristiti da snimite "
"recept u bilo kojem trenutku za vrijeme unosa. Kao sa bilo kojom drugom "
"aplikacijom, kada pravite promjene, uvijek je dobra ideja da snimate često!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1649
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show recipe &ndash; click on the <guibutton>Show recipe</guibutton> button "
"to view the recipe"
msgstr ""
"Prikaži recept &ndash; kliknite na taster <guibutton>Prikaži recept</"
"guibutton> da pogledate recept"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1652
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view a recipe, it must be saved. If the recipe has NOT been saved at the "
"time that the <guibutton>Show recipe</guibutton> button is clicked, the "
"following alert will appear &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Da pregledate recept, morate ga snimiti. Ako recept NIJE snimljen u trenutku "
"kada se klikne taster <guibutton>Prikaži recept</guibutton>, sljedeće "
"upozorenje će se pojaviti &mdash;"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1656
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to save the recipe before displaying it. Would you like to save it "
"now?"
msgstr "Treba da snimite recept prije prikaza. Želite li ga snimiti sada?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1659
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Yes</guibutton> button to save the recipe, or the "
"<guibutton>No</guibutton> button to close the dialog and return to the "
"recipe entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na taster <guibutton>Da</guibutton> da snimite recept, ili taster "
"<guibutton>Ne</guibutton> da zatvorite dijalog i da se vratite na interfejs "
"za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1663
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guibutton>Show recipe</guibutton> button is pressed, the recipe will "
"display. To return to the <interface>Edit Recipe</interface> interface in "
"the event that the recipe has not been completely entered, click on the "
"<guibutton>Recipe Name</guibutton> button that appears at the bottom of the "
"component list in the left-hand pane of the window. Alternatively, "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Recipe</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> can be chosen from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu, or "
"select the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> "
"key combination."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete tipku <guibutton>Prikazi recepte</guibutton>, recept će se "
"prikazati. Da biste se vratili na interfejs <interface>Izmjeni recepte</"
"interface> u slučaju da niste u potpunosti unijeli recept, klikom na tipku "
"<guibutton>Ime recepta</guibutton> koje se pojavljuje na dnu liste "
"komponenanata. Alternativno, <menuchoice><guimenu>Izmjeni</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Izmjeni recept</guimenuitem></menuchoice> može biti "
"izabrano iz menija <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, ili odabrano "
"kombinacijom tipki <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1674
#, no-c-format
msgid "Close &ndash; click the <guibutton>Close</guibutton> button"
msgstr "Zatvori &ndash; kliknite taster <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1677
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Again, if the recipe has not been saved an alert will appear stating &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Opet, ako recept nije snimljen upozorenje će se pojaviti navodeći &mdash;"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:1680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This recipe contains unsaved changes. Would you like to save it before "
"closing?"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj recept sadrži nesnimljene promjene. Da li biste željeli da ga snimite "
"prije zatvaranja?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The course of action can be selected by clicking the <guibutton>Yes</"
"guibutton> button to save, the <guibutton>No</guibutton> button to close the "
"recipe without saving, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close "
"the dialog and return to the recipe entry interface."
msgstr ""
"Tok djelovanja se može izabrati klikom na taster <guibutton>Da</guibutton> "
"da snimite, taster <guibutton>Ne</guibutton> da zatvorite recept bez "
"snimanja, ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zatvorite dijalog i "
"vratite se na interfejs za unos recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1689
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Resize &ndash; click the <guibutton>Resize recipe</guibutton> button to "
"resize the recipe"
msgstr ""
"Promijeni veličinu &ndash; kliknite taster <guibutton>Promijeni veličinu "
"recepta</guibutton> da promijenite veličinu recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1692
#, no-c-format
msgid "The recipe can be resized by either of two methods &mdash;"
msgstr "The recipe can be resized by either of two methods &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1696
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scale by yield &mdash;"
msgstr "Promjena omjera po prinosu &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To scale by yield, select the <emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> beside the "
"<guilabel>Scale by yield</guilabel> label. Below this and beside the "
"<guilabel>Current yield:</guilabel> label, the current yield of your recipe "
"is shown. Beside the <guilabel>New yield:</guilabel>, there is a text box in "
"which to <userinput>enter the new yield amount desired</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Da promijenite omjer po prinosu, izaberite <emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> "
"pored oznake <guilabel>Promijenite omjer po prinosu</guilabel>. Ispod ove i "
"pored oznake <guilabel>Trenutni prinos:</guilabel>, je prikazan trenutni "
"prinos vašeg recepta. Pored <guilabel>Novi prinos:</guilabel>, se nalazi "
"okvir za tekst u koji se <userinput>unosi nova željena količina prinosa</"
"userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1705
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have entered a range for your yield amount, <emphasis>Scale by yield</"
"emphasis> will not be available because <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"cannot determine which portion of the range it is scaling."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste unijeli opseg kao vašu količinu prinosa, <emphasis>Promijeni omjer "
"po prinosu</emphasis> neće biti dostupno jer <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"ne može odrediti za koji dio opsega se mijenja omjer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1710
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scale by factor &mdash;"
msgstr "Promjena omjera po faktoru &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1712
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To scale by factor, click the <emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> beside the "
"<guilabel>Scale by factor</guilabel> label. Enter <userinput>the desired "
"scaling factor</userinput> in the text box beside the <guilabel>Factor (i.e. "
"1/2 to half; 3 to triple):</guilabel> label."
msgstr ""
"Da promijenite omjer po faktoru, kliknite <emphasis>Radio Button</emphasis> "
"pored oznake <guilabel>Promijenite omjer po faktoru</guilabel>. Unesite "
"<userinput>željeni faktor za promjenu omjera</userinput> u okvir za tekst "
"pored oznake <guilabel>Faktor (tj. 1/2 za pola; 3 za tri puta):</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1719
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In either of these scenarios, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to "
"continue. Your recipe will be reproportioned appropriately. Alternatively, "
"click the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the window and "
"return to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"U bilo kojem od ovih scenarija, kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da "
"nastavite. Omjer vašeg recept će biti promijenjen na odgovarajući način. "
"Alternativno, kliknite taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zatvorite "
"prozor i da se vratite na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1729
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Saved Recipes"
msgstr "Izmjena snimljenih recepata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1732
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The feature for editing recipes can be accessed in a number of ways. With "
"the <emphasis>Find/Edit Recipes</emphasis> component selected,"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija za izmjenu recepata je dostupna na više načina. Kada je komponenta "
"<emphasis>Pronađi/Izmijeni recepte</emphasis> izabrana,"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1735
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the recipe to be edited from the recipe list in the main portion of "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window. Click on the <guibutton>Open "
"Recipe(s)</guibutton> button. From the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu, select "
"<guimenuitem>Edit Recipe</guimenuitem>, or the <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> key combination can be pressed."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite recept za izmjenu iz liste recepata u glavnom dijelu "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora. Kliknite taster <guibutton>Otvori "
"recept(e)</guibutton>. Iz menija <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu>, izaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Izmijeni recept</guimenuitem>, ili možete pritisnuti "
"kombinaciju tipki <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1742
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the recipe to be edited from the recipe list in the main portion of "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window. Click the <guibutton>Edit "
"Recipe</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite recept za izmjenu iz liste recepata u glavnom dijelu "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora. Kliknite taster <guibutton>Izmijeni "
"recept</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be sure that you have selected the recipe that you want to edit. If a recipe "
"is not selected, an alert box will appear displaying the message <quote>No "
"recipe selected!</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da ste izabrali recept kojeg želite da izmijenite. Ako recept "
"nije izabran, dijalog upozorenja će se pojaviti sa porukom <quote>Nijedan "
"recept nije izabran!</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Either way, the identical screen that appeared when entering a new recipe "
"displays. <emphasis>For a complete description of this screen, refer to the "
"section</emphasis> <link linkend=\"add-recipe\">Adding a New Recipe</link>."
msgstr ""
"U svakom slučaju biće prikazan ekran identičan onom pri unosu novog recepta. "
"<emphasis>Za potpun opis ovog ekrana, pogledajte poglavlje</emphasis> <link "
"linkend=\"add-recipe\">Dodavanje novog recepta</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1757
#, no-c-format
msgid "All aspects of the recipe can now be edited &mdash;"
msgstr "Svi aspekti recepta se sada mogu izmijeniti &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1760
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"the Recipe Name, Authors, Categories, Yield Amount, Yield Type, Preparation "
"Time and/or graphic from the <guilabel>Recipe</guilabel> tab"
msgstr ""
"ime recepta, autori, kategorije, količina prinosa, vrsta prinosa, vrijeme "
"pripreme i/ili slika iz kartice <guilabel>Recept</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"the Amount, Units, and/or Preparation method for each of the listed "
"ingredients in the <guilabel>Ingredients</guilabel> tab"
msgstr ""
"količina, mjere, i/ili način pripreme za svaki od navedenih sastojaka u "
"kartici <guilabel>Sastojci</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1766
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also in this tab, an ingredient can be added by clicking on the "
"<guibutton>New Ingredient</guibutton> button that appears on the top, right-"
"hand side of the ingredient list, or deleted by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button"
msgstr ""
"Takođe u ovoj kartici, sastojak se može dodati klikom na taster "
"<guibutton>Novi sastojak</guibutton> koji se nalazi na vrhu, desno od liste "
"sastojaka, ili izbrisati klikom na taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1772
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"the preparation directions from the <guilabel>Instructions</guilabel> tab"
msgstr "uputstvo za pripremu iz kartice <guilabel>Uputstvo</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1776
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with entering a new recipe, the buttons <guibutton>Save Recipe</"
"guibutton>, <guibutton>Show Recipe</guibutton>, <guibutton>Close</guibutton> "
"and <guibutton>Resize Recipe</guibutton> are available from each of the tabs"
msgstr ""
"Kao pri unosu novog recepta, tasteri <guibutton>Snimi recept</guibutton>, "
"<guibutton>Prikaži recept</guibutton>, <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> i "
"<guibutton>Promijeni veličinu recepta</guibutton> su dostupni iz svake od "
"kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1781
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While editing the recipe, if the <guibutton>Show Recipe</guibutton> button "
"is selected, the <interface>Unsaved changes - krecipes</interface> dialog "
"box appears stating <emphasis>This recipe has changes that will not be "
"displayed unless the recipe is saved. Would you like to save it now?</"
"emphasis>. The <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>, <guibutton>No</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> buttons are available for selection."
msgstr ""
"Pri izmjeni recepta, ako je izabran taster <guibutton>Prikaži recept</"
"guibutton>, okvir dijaloga <interface>Nesnimljene promjene - krecipes</"
"interface> navodeći da <emphasis>Ovaj recept ima promjene koje neće biti "
"prikazane osim ako je recept snimljen. Želite li ga snimiti sada?</"
"emphasis>. Tasteri <guibutton>Da</guibutton>, <guibutton>Ne</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> su dostupni za izbor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1788
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The important detail to note is that in order to continue editing the "
"recipe, the <interface>Edit Recipe</interface> interface must be accessed. "
"This can be done in a variety of ways &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Bitan detalj kojeg treba naglasiti je da biste nastavili sa izmjenom "
"recepta, mora se pristupiti interfejsu <interface>Izmijeni recept</"
"interface>. Ovo se može uraditi na razne načine &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1793
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> and then, <guimenuitem>Edit Recipe</"
"guimenuitem> from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu"
msgstr ""
"Izaberite <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu> i onda, <guimenuitem>Izmijeni recept</"
"guimenuitem> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1796
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> key "
"combination"
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite kombinaciju tipki <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</"
"keycap></keycombo>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1799
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Recipe Name</guibutton> button that appears at the "
"bottom of the component list in the left-hand pane of the window &ndash; "
"this button appears once the recipe to be edited has been loaded and a "
"change has been initiated"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite taster <guibutton>Ime recepta</guibutton> koji se nalazi na dnu "
"liste komponenti u lijevom oknu prozora &ndash; ovaj taster se pojavljuje "
"nakon što je recept koji treba da se izmijeni učitan i promjena je pokrenuta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1805
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With the <emphasis>Find/Edit Recipes</emphasis> component selected and the "
"list of recipes showing on the right-hand side of the screen, an entire "
"recipe may be deleted by selecting it from the list and clicking the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Kada je komponenta <emphasis>Pronađi/Izmijeni recepte</emphasis> izabrana i "
"lista recepata se prikazuje na desnoj strani ekrana, čitav recept se može "
"izbrisati odabirom iz liste i klikom na taster <guibutton>Izbriši</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1815
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Page Setup</title>"
msgstr "<title>Podešavanje stranice</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1817
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access Page Setup, select <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenuitem>Page Setup...</guimenuitem> from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> menu bar."
msgstr ""
"Da pristupite podešavanju stranice, izaberite <guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> "
"i <guimenuitem>Podešavanje stranice...</guimenuitem> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;"
"</emphasis> trake menija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1824
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the Page Setup dialog"
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana dijaloga Podešavanje stranice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1832
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Page Setup</para>"
msgstr "<para>Podešavanje stranice</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1838
#, no-c-format
msgid "An Overview of Page Setup"
msgstr "Pregled podešavanja stranice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1840
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <interface>Page Setup</interface> window, the toolbar displays the "
"icons for <guiicon>Open</guiicon>, <guiicon>Save</guiicon>, <guiicon>Save "
"As</guiicon> and <guiicon>Revert</guiicon> and a drop down box "
"<guilabel>Show Items</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"U prozoru <interface>Podešavanje stranice</interface>, alatna traka "
"prikazuje ikone za <guiicon>Otvori</guiicon>, <guiicon>Snimi</guiicon>, "
"<guiicon>Snimi kao</guiicon> i <guiicon>Vrati prethodno</guiicon> i padajući "
"okvir za tekst <guilabel>Prikaži stavke</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1848
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With regard to <guiicon>Revert</guiicon>, a word of caution is in order. "
"Clicking on <guiicon>Revert</guiicon> after changes have been made in the "
"Page Setup window, will reload the currently active layout file, erasing all "
"changes <emphasis>unless they have been saved</emphasis>. This represents "
"the prime function for <guiicon>Revert</guiicon>. Should you wish to revert "
"to your previous settings while still in <interface>Page Setup</interface>, "
"clicking <guiicon>Revert</guiicon> will allow you to do this provided that "
"you have not saved any changes."
msgstr ""
"Što se tiče <guiicon>Vrati</guiicon>, upozorenje je uredu. Klikom na "
"<guiicon>Vrati</guiicon> nakon što su se napravile promjene u prozoru Page "
"Setup, će ponovo učitati trenutno aktivan raspored datoteka, brisajući sve "
"promjene <emphasis>osim ukoliko su sačuvane</emphasis>. Ovo predstavlja "
"glavnu funkciju <guiicon>Vrati</guiicon>. Ukoliko želite da vratite na svoje "
"prethodne postavke dok ste jos u <interface>Page Setup</interface>, klikom "
"na <guiicon>Vrati</guiicon> će vam to omogućiti pod uvjetom da niste "
"sačuvali nikakve promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1858
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beneath the toolbar, the label <guilabel>Usage: Select a template along the "
"left, and right-click any element to edit the look of that element.</"
"guilabel> clearly states the <interface>Page Setup</interface> method of "
"use. All attribute changes are dynamic and do not necessitate reloading "
"while in <interface>Page Setup</interface>. See the section <link linkend="
"\"change-attributes\">Changing Attributes</link> for details on changing the "
"appearance of your recipe elements."
msgstr ""
"Ispod alatne trake, oznaka <guilabel>Upotreba: Izaberite obrazac duž lijeve "
"strane, i desnim klikom na bilo koji element za uređivanje izgleda tog "
"elementat.</guilabel> Jasno naveden <interface>Page Setup</interface> metod "
"korištenja. Svi atributi promjene su dinamički i ne zahtjevaju pretvaranje "
"dok je u <interface>Page Setup</interface>. Vidi poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"change-attributes\">Mijenjanje atributa</link> za detalje o promijeni "
"izgleda vašeg recepta elemenata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1870
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <interface>Page Setup</interface> window first appears, you will "
"probably need to resize it in order to view all the recipe elements. When "
"the window is resized, all recipe elements will be scaled fit within the "
"confines of the window."
msgstr ""
"Kada se prozor <interface>Podešavanje stranice</interface> tek pojavi, "
"vjerovatno ćete trebati da promijenite veličinu da biste vidjeli sve "
"elemente recepta. Kada se veličina prozora promijeni, razmjera svih "
"elemenata recepta će biti promijenjena da stanu u granice prozora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1881
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Items to Display"
msgstr "Odabir stavki za prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1884
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The drop down box on the toolbar allows access to a list of items that are "
"available for display in the recipe. These include &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Padajući okvir za tekst na alatnoj traci omogućava pristup listi stavki koje "
"su dostupne za prikaz u receptu. One uključuju &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Authors</guimenuitem> &ndash; The authors or contributors of "
"the recipe"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Autori</guimenuitem> &ndash; Autori ili saradnici recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1892
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Categories</guimenuitem> &ndash; The category to which the "
"recipe belongs"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Kategorije</guimenuitem> &ndash; Kategorija kojoj recept pripada"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1894
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Ingredients</guimenuitem> &ndash; The list of recipe ingredients"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Sastojci</guimenuitem> &ndash; Lista sastojaka recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1896
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Instructions</guimenuitem> &ndash; The steps for preparing the "
"recipe"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Uputstvo</guimenuitem> &ndash; Koraci za pripremu recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1898
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Photo</guimenuitem> &ndash; To display a photo in the recipe"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Slika</guimenuitem> &ndash; Za prikaz slike u receptu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1900
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> &ndash; The list of nutrients in the "
"recipe"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Osobine</guimenuitem> &ndash; List hranljivih tvari u receptu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1902
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Preparation Time</guimenuitem> &ndash; The time for preparation"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem> Vrijeme pripreme</guimenuitem> &ndash; Vrijeme za pripremu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1904
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Ratings</guimenuitem> &ndash; The ratings given to the recipe"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Ocjene</guimenuitem> &ndash; Ocjene date za recept"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1906
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Title</guimenuitem> &ndash; The title of the recipe"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Naslov</guimenuitem> &ndash; Naslov recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1908
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Yield</guimenuitem> &ndash; The yield amount expected from the "
"recipe"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Prinos</guimenuitem> &ndash; Očekivana količina prinosa od "
"recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1912
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, all items are displayed. To prevent display in the recipe, "
"deselect the item by clicking on the check box beside it."
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu, sve stavke su prikazane. Da biste spriječili prikaz u receptu, "
"poništite izbor stavke klikom na potvrdni okvir pored nje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1917
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All sections chosen to display in the recipe will also print. It may be "
"desirable to have a section display, but not print. In this case, you can "
"define a new print layout. See the section <link linkend=\"print-setup"
"\">Print Setup</link> for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Svi dijelovi izabrani za prikaz u receptu će se takođe odštampati. Može biti "
"poželjno da se dio prikazuje, ali ne štampa. U ovom slučaju, možete "
"definisati novi raspored za štampanje. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"print-setup\">Podešavanje štampanja</link> for instructions."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1926
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing Attributes"
msgstr "Promjena osobina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1928
#, no-c-format
msgid "Characteristics of each section can be changed individually."
msgstr "Osobine svakog dijela se mogu promijeniti pojedinačno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1930
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Right-click on any section in the Page Setup window. A menu will display "
"with the title of the section appearing at the top. From this menu, you can "
"&mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite desnim klikom na bilo koji dio u prozoru Podešavanje stranice. Meni "
"će se prikazati sa naslovom dijela na vrhu. Iz ovog menija, možete &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1936
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the <guimenuitem>Background color...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "Promijeniti <guimenuitem>Boju pozadine...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1938
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the <guimenuitem>Text color...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "Promijeniti <guimenuitem>Boju teksta...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1940
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the <guimenuitem>Font...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "Promijeniti <guimenuitem>Font...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1941
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose whether or not to display the section by selecting or deselecting the "
"check box beside <guimenuitem>Show</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"Izabrati da li da prikažete dio ili ne izborom ili poništavanjem izbora u "
"potvrdnom okviru pored <guimenuitem>Prikaži</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1944
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change the <guimenu>Alignment</guimenu> &ndash; This menu item has a sub-"
"menu that allows you to select the alignment"
msgstr ""
"Promijeniti <guimenu>Poravnanje</guimenu> &ndash; Ova stavka menija ima pod-"
"meni koji vam omogućava da izaberete poravnanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1946
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Define a <guimenuitem>Border...</guimenuitem> that will appear around the "
"selected section"
msgstr ""
"Odrediti <guimenuitem>Granica...</guimenuitem> koji će se pojaviti oko "
"izabranog dijela"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1948
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <quote>Requested Border</quote> configuration window appears, there "
"are sections that allow the definition of various elements under the "
"appropriate headings. For example &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kada se pojavi prozor za konfiguraciju <quote>Zahtijevana granica</quote>, "
"postoje dijelovi koji omogućavaju određivanje različitih elemenata pod "
"odgovarajućim naslovima. Na primjer &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1953
#, no-c-format
msgid "Under the heading <quote>Style</quote>, a border style can be selected"
msgstr "Pod naslovom <quote>Stil</quote>, stil granice se može izabrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1955
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the heading <quote>Color</quote>, a color can be selected from the "
"color spectrum and this can be fine-tuned, using the color slider"
msgstr ""
"Pod naslovom <quote>Boja</quote>, boja se može izabrati iz spektra boja i "
"ovo se može fino podesiti, upotrebom klizača za boju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1958
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the heading <quote>Width</quote> the width of the border, in pixels, "
"can be selected. <emphasis>For a border such as <quote>Groove</quote>, or "
"<quote>Ridge</quote> a minimum pixel size of 4 to 6 has been found to work "
"best.</emphasis> The border size can be selected using a spinbox or "
"selecting a numeric value from a list"
msgstr ""
"Pod naslovom <quote>Širina</quote> širina granice, u pikselima, se može "
"izabrati. <emphasis>Za granicu kao što je <quote>Žlijeb</quote> ili "
"<quote>Greben</quote> utvrđeno je da najviše odgovara minimalna veličina "
"piksela od 4 do 6.</emphasis> Veličina granice se može izabrati upotrebom "
"spinboxa ili izborom brojčane vrijednosti iz liste"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1965
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, at the bottom is a section that allows the preview of the border as "
"it will appear in the recipe."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, na dnu je dio koji omogućava pregled granice kao što će se pojaviti "
"u receptu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1969
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the number of <guimenuitem>Columns...</guimenuitem> that will be "
"used to display your list items, such as <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> "
"and <emphasis>Properties</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Navedite broj <guimenuitem>Kolone...</guimenuitem> koje će se koristiti za "
"prikaz vaše liste stavki, kao što su <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis> i "
"<emphasis>Osobine</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1973
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <guimenuitem>Columns...</guimenuitem> menu item is selected, a "
"dialog box will appear where you can set the number of columns for display "
"using a spinbox or typing the number directly into the text box that appears "
"beneath the label <guilabel>Select the number of columns to use:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Kada se izabere stavka menija <guimenuitem>Kolone...</guimenuitem>, okvir za "
"dijalog će se pojaviti, gdje možete podesiti broj kolona za prikaz upotrebom "
"spinboxa ili kucanjem broja direktno u okvir za tekst koji se pojavljuje "
"ispod oznake <guilabel>Izaberite broj kolona za upotrebu:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1986
#, no-c-format
msgid "Print Setup"
msgstr "Podešavanje štampanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1988
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> allows you to define different looks for "
"viewing and printing your recipes. For instance, you might be happy with a "
"unified look for viewing your recipes, but want to color co-ordinate all "
"elements when the recipe is printed."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> vam omogućava da definišete različite "
"izglede za pregledanje i štampanje vaših recepata. Na primjer, možda ćete "
"biti sretni sa usklađenim izgledom za pregledanje vaših recepata, ali želite "
"da uskladite boje svih elemenata kada se recept štampa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1993
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are printing a full page recipe, items selected for printing and the "
"attributes of your various recipe elements are set in the same manner as "
"they were in <link linkend=\"krecipes-page-setup\">Page Setup</link>. The "
"trick for having a separate definition for printing is to ensure that you "
"have saved your settings with a new file name."
msgstr ""
"Ako štampate punu stranicu recepta, stavke koje su izabrane za štampanje i "
"osobine vaših raznih elemenata recepta su postavljeni na isti način kao što "
"su bili u <link linkend=\"krecipes-page-setup\">Podešavanje stranice</link>. "
"Trik da imate odvojenu definiciju za štampanje je da osigurate da ste "
"snimili svoje postavke pod novim imenom datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2000
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printing Your Recipe"
msgstr "Štampanje vašeg recepta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2002
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you select <guimenu>File</guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem> "
"from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar, the <interface>Print "
"Preview</interface> screen appears, as depicted in the following screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Kada izaberete <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Štampaj</"
"guimenuitem> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> trake menija, pojavi se "
"ekran <interface>Pregled štampanja</interface>, kao što je prikazano na "
"sljedećoj snimljenoj slici ekrana."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2009
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the Print Preview screen."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana za Pregled štampanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2017
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Print Preview Screen"
msgstr "Ekran za pregled štampanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2022
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the screenshot, you will see that there are various buttons to tune the "
"preview, if you're happy with the result click the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"document-print.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> button, "
"otherwise just close the preview window to cancel the print."
msgstr ""
"Sa snimljene slike ekrana, vidjećete da postoje različiti tasteri za "
"podešavanje pregleda, ako ste zadovoljni sa rezultatom kliknite taster "
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"document-"
"print.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon>, "
"inače samo zatvorite prozor pregleda da otkažete štampanje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2038
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing and Exporting Recipes"
msgstr "Importovanje i eksportovanje recepata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2039
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> allows the import of recipes from a file or "
"from a database. Recipes can also be exported to other formats."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> omogućava importovanje recepata iz datoteke "
"ili iz baze podataka. Recepti se mogu takođe eksportovati u druge formate."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2043
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from a File"
msgstr "Importovanje iz datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2045
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> allows the import of recipes from the "
"following formats &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> omogućava importovanje recepata iz sljedećih "
"formata &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2047
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; files of this format will have "
"extensions of .kre or .kreml"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati "
"ekstenziju .kre ili .kreml"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2049
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"MasterCook &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .mx2 and "
"originate from MasterCook 5 or 6"
msgstr ""
"MasterCook &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .mx2 i potiču "
"iz MasterCook 5 ili 6"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2051
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"MasterCook Export &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .mxp "
"or .txt and originate from MasterCook 4"
msgstr ""
"MasterCook eksport &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .mxp "
"ili .txt i potiču iz MasterCook 4"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2053
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Meal-Master &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .mmf or .txt"
msgstr ""
"Meal-Master &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .mmf ili .txt"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2055
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<quote>Now You're Cooking</quote> Generic Export &ndash; files of this "
"format will have extensions of .txt"
msgstr ""
"<quote>Now You're Cooking</quote> opšti eksport &ndash; datoteke ovog "
"formata će imati ekstenziju .txt"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2057
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"RecipeML &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .xml or ."
"recipeml"
msgstr ""
"RecipeML &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .xml ili .recipeml"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2059
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rezkonv &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .rk or .txt"
msgstr "Rezkonv &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .rk ili .txt"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2064
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To import a recipe from a file of one of the above formats, select "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar. "
"From the available choices, select <guimenuitem>Import from File ...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"Da importujete recept iz datoteke jednog od gore navedenih formata, "
"izaberite <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"trake menija. Od dostupnih opcija, izaberite <guimenuitem>Importuj iz "
"datoteke ...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2069
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window will appear that allows the navigation to the file that you wish to "
"import. Navigation can be done using the <quote>point and click</quote> "
"method, or the location of the file may be entered directly into the box "
"labeled <guilabel>Location:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Pojavit će se prozor koji omogućava navigaciju do datoteke koju želite da "
"importujete. Navigacija se može uraditi pomoću metode <quote>pokaži i "
"klikni</quote>, ili se lokacija datoteke može direktno upisati u okvir sa "
"oznakom <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2074
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> box is used to select the format of the "
"recipe being imported from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Okvir <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> se koristi za odabir formata recepta koji "
"se importuje iz padajućeg menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2077 index.docbook:2488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To position the cursor for entry into the <guilabel>Location:</guilabel> "
"box, the key combination <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>L</keycap></"
"keycombo> can be used. To position the cursor for entry into the "
"<guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> box, the key combination <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> can be used."
msgstr ""
"Da postavite pokazivač za unos u okvir <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel>, može "
"se upotrijebiti kombinacija tipki <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>L</"
"keycap></keycombo>. Da postavite pokazivač za unos u okvir <guilabel>Filter:"
"</guilabel>, može se upotrijebiti kombinacija tipki <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Alt;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2085
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have navigated to the location of the recipe file that you want to "
"import and have selected the correct format, all the recipes saved in the "
"selected format will appear in the file list. If import of only one recipe "
"is desired, select the file that you wish to import and its name will appear "
"in the <guilabel>Location:</guilabel> box. Press the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button to proceed with the import, or the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button to close the file selection window and return to the "
"previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste naveli na lokaciju recepta datoteke koju želite uvestii "
"izabrali ste ispravan format, svi recepti sačuvane u odabranom formatu će se "
"pojaviti u listi datoteka. Ako želite uvesti samo jedan recept, odaberite "
"datoteku koju želite uvesti i ime će se pojaviti u oznaci <guilabel>Lokacija:"
"</guilabel>. Pritisnite tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da biste nastaviti "
"sa uvozom, ili  tipku <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da biste biste zatvorili "
"prozor za izbor datoteke i povratak na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2094
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have selected the <quote>Ask which recipes to import</quote> tickbox "
"in the <quote>Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, Import/Export</"
"quote> interface, when you click on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button, "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> <interface>Import Recipes</interface> "
"window will appear from which you can select the recipes that you want to "
"import. For instructions on how to select this choice see the section <link "
"linkend=\"import-export-preference\">Choosing Import/Export Preferences</"
"link>. If this selection is not made, your recipes will be imported silently "
"with no prompt."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste odabrali <quote>Traži koje recepte za uvoz</quote> u checkboxu "
"<quote>Konfiguracija <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, uvezi/izvezi</quote> "
"interfejs, kada kliknete na tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, na "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> <interface>Uvezi recepte</interface> pojavit "
"će se prozor u kojem možete odabrati recepte koje želite uvesti. Za upute o "
"tome kako da izaberete ovaj izbor pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"import-export-preference\">Izbor opcija za uvoz/izbor</link>. Ako ovaj "
"izbor nije napravljen, vaš recepti će se uvoziti tiho bez ikakvog odziva."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the Import Recipes screen."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana Importovanje recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Import Recipes Window &ndash; this window will appear when you are "
"importing from a file OR from a Database."
msgstr ""
"Prozor Importovanje recepata &ndash; ovaj prozor će se pojaviti kada "
"importujete iz datoteke ILI iz baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the heading <guilabel>Recipes</guilabel>, drop-down lists will appear "
"&mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Pod naslovom <guilabel>Recepti</guilabel> će se pojaviti padajuće liste "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All &ndash; This list will be expanded by default and is selected by default "
"whether one recipe or multiple recipes are being imported (the tickbox to "
"the left of the label will contain a check mark). In brackets, to the right "
"of the label, the number of recipes being imported will appear."
msgstr ""
"Sve &ndash; Ova lista će biti proširena po defaultu i po defaultu je "
"izabrana bez obzira da li se importuje jedan ili više recepte (potvrdni "
"okvir lijevo od oznake će sadržavati kvakicu). U zagradama, desno od oznake, "
"broj recepata koji se importuju će se pojaviti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the <guilabel>All</guilabel> label, all the remaining "
"<emphasis>Categories</emphasis> will be listed and the tickbox to the left "
"of each category label will contain a check mark indicating that the "
"category is selected. These categories will be collapsed by default and in "
"brackets to the right of the category label, the number of recipes in the "
"category will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Ispod oznake <guilabel>Sve</guilabel>, sve preostale <emphasis>kategorije</"
"emphasis> će biti navedene i potvrdni okvir lijevo od svake oznake "
"kategorije će sadržavati kvakicu što ukazuje da je kategorija izabrana. Ove "
"kategorije će biti sužene po defaultu i u zagradama desno od oznake "
"kategorije će biti prikazan broj recepata u kategoriji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each category can be expanded to reveal the list of recipes in the category "
"by clicking on the <guiicon>+</guiicon> sign that appears to the left of the "
"tickbox. Again, by default, recipes within each category are selected as "
"indicated by the checkmark in the tickbox to the left of the category name. "
"Any recipes that do not have a category attached to them will appear under "
"the <guilabel>Uncategorized</guilabel> group. To deselect any recipes that "
"you do not wish to import, simply clear the tickbox beside the recipe name "
"by clicking on it."
msgstr ""
"Svaka kategorija se može proširiti popis recepata u kategoriji, klikom na "
"<guiicon>+</guiicon> znak koji se pojavljuje sa lijeve strane checkboxa. "
"opet, po defaultu, recepti u svakoj od kategorija su odabrani kao što je "
"navedene kvakicom checkboxa lijevo od imena kategorije. Svaki recept koji "
"nema kategoriju pojavit će se pod kategorijom <guilabel>Nekategorisana</"
"guilabel> grupa. Da poništite recept, koje ne želite uvoziti, jednostavno "
"očistiti checkbox pored imena recept klikom na njeg."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the selection(s) you have made, click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to proceed with the import, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to prevent the import and close the "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste zadovoljni izborom koji ste napravili, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da nastavite sa importovanjem, ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da spriječite importovanje i zatvorite prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It should be noted that the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button can be "
"pressed after the import starts. In this situation, any recipes that have "
"been imported prior to pressing the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button "
"will remain in the database &ndash; <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> does not "
"<quote>rollback</quote> completed imports on cancellation of the import "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Treba napomenuti da se taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> može pritisnuti "
"nakon što počne importovanje. U ovom slučaju, bilo koji recept koji je "
"importovan prije pritiska na taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> će ostati "
"u bazi podataka &ndash; <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ne <quote>vraća "
"natrag</quote> importovane recepte pri otkazivanju procesa importovanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any recipes that have been placed in the <guilabel>Uncategorized</guilabel> "
"group can be individually edited to place them in the appropriate existing "
"category. You may also define a new category in which to place them. See the "
"section <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Editing Saved Recipes</link> and <link "
"linkend=\"categories-component\">The Categories Component</link> for "
"instruction on how to do this. Once you have edited your recipes to "
"categorize them and the <guilabel>Uncategorized</guilabel> group is empty, "
"it will automatically be removed from the category list."
msgstr ""
"Svaki recept koji je stavljen u <guilabel>Nekategorisanu</guilabel> grupu "
"može biti pojedinacno urediti i staviti ih u odgovaracuje postojeće "
"datoteke. Također možete definirati novu kategoriju u koju ćete ih staviti. "
"Vidi sekciju <link linkend=\"edit-recipe\">Izmjene snimljenih recepata</"
"link> i <link linkend=\"categories-component\">Kategodije komponenata</link> "
"za upute kako se to radi. Kada ste uredili svoj recept i "
"<guilabel>Nekategorisana</guilabel> grupa je prazna, recept će automatski "
"biti uklonjen iz liste kategorije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the recipe(s) are categorized, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will put "
"the recipe(s) into the appropriate category or create a new category if the "
"appropriate one does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Ako je (su) recept(i) kategorisan(i), <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> će "
"staviti recept(e) u odgovarajuću kategoriju ili će napraviti novu kategoriju "
"ako odgovarajuća kategorija ne postoji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Regardless of whether the recipe being imported is uncategorized or "
"categorized, it may still be appropriate to edit the recipe to define "
"<quote>Preparation Time</quote>, or otherwise fine-tune the recipe."
msgstr ""
"Bez obzira da li je recept koji se importuje nekategorisan ili kategorisan, "
"možda će i dalje biti prikladno da izmijenite recept da definišete "
"<quote>vrijeme pripreme</quote>, ili na drugi način fino podesite recept."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The manner in which the recipe imports into <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"is <emphasis>DEPENDENT ON THE WAY IT HAS BEEN INPUT INTO THE ORIGINAL "
"PROGRAM!</emphasis> If the recipe has been input into the original program "
"in a sloppy manner, it will not import neatly into <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis>!"
msgstr ""
"Način na koji se recept importuje u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> je "
"<emphasis>ZAVISAN OD NAČINA NA KOJI JE ON UNESEN U ORIGINALNI PROGRAM!</"
"emphasis> Ako je recept unesen u originalni program na nemaran način, neće "
"se importovati uredno u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from a Database"
msgstr "Importovanje iz baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To import a recipe from an existing database, select <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar. From the available "
"choices, select <guimenuitem>Import from Database ...</guimenuitem> The "
"<interface>Database Import</interface> window will appear. Under the heading "
"<emphasis>Database</emphasis>, you can make one of three selections. Your "
"selection can be made by clicking the radio button beside <link linkend="
"\"import-sqlite\">SQLite</link>, <link linkend=\"import-mysql\">MySQL</"
"link>, or <link linkend=\"import-postgresql\">PostgreSQL</link>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uvezli recept iz postojeće baze, odaberite <guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu> u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> meni traci. Iz dostupnih izbora, "
"odaberite <guimenuitem>Uvezi iz baze podataka ...</guimenuitem> u "
"<interface>Uvoz baze podataka</interface> prozor koji će se pojaviti. Pod "
"naslovom <emphasis>Baza podataka</emphasis>, možete napraviti jednu od tri "
"selekcije. Vaš odabir možete izvršiti klikom na tipku pored<link linkend="
"\"import-sqlite\">SQLite</link>, <link linkend=\"import-mysql\">MySQL</"
"link>, ili <link linkend=\"import-postgresql\">PostgreSQL</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from SQLite"
msgstr "Importovanje iz SQLite baze podataka"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the import dialog when importing from an SQLite "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana dijaloga za importovanje pri importovanju iz "
"SQLite baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2210
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from an SQLite Database"
msgstr "Importovanje iz SQLite baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose SQLite, beneath the heading <guilabel>Database file:</"
"guilabel>, there is a text box and beside this, the <guiicon>Open File "
"Dialog</guiicon> icon which, when clicked, will <action>open the file dialog "
"window</action>. This window is used to navigate to the location of the "
"database that you want to import. Once you have located the appropriate "
"database file, select it from the file list. The name will appear in the "
"<guilabel>Location:</guilabel> box. Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"button to proceed or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the "
"file dialog window and return to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete SQLite, ispod naslova <guilabel>Datoteka baze podataka:</"
"guilabel>, postoji polje za tekst i pored toga, <guiicon>Otvori dijalog "
"datoteke</guiicon> koja kada se klikne, otvorit će <action>prozor dijalog za "
"datoteku</action>. Ovaj prozor se koristi za navigaciju na lokaciju baze "
"podataka koju želite uvesti. Nakon što ste našli gdje se nalazi odgovarajuća "
"datoteka baze podataka, odaberite ga s popisa na lokaciji baze podataka koju "
"želite uvesti. Ime će se pojaviti na <guilabel>Lokaciji:</guilabel>. "
"Kliknite na tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton> za nastavak ili "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da biste zatvorili dijalošku prozor datoteke i "
"povratak na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button is pressed, the file dialog window "
"will close. You will be returned to the <interface> Database Import</"
"interface> window and you should see the name of the database file with its "
"<quote>path</quote> showing in the text box. Click the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button to proceed with the import, or the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button to discontinue the import."
msgstr ""
"Kada se pritisne taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, prozor dijaloga datoteke "
"će se zatvoriti. Vratit ćete se na prozor <interface> Importovanje baze "
"podataka</interface> i trebali biste vidjeti ime datoteke baze podataka sa "
"njenom <quote>stazom</quote> u okviru za tekst. Kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da nastavite sa importovanjem, ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da prekinete importovanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this point, the import becomes <link linkend=\"common-import\">common</"
"link> for whatever database you are importing."
msgstr ""
"U ovom trenutku, importovanje postaje <link linkend=\"common-import"
"\">zajedničko</link> za bilo koju bazu podataka koju importujete."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from MySQL"
msgstr "Importovanje iz MySQL baze podataka"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the import dialog when importing from a MySQL "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana dijaloga za importovanje pri importovanju iz "
"MySQL baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Importing from a MySQL Database (The same interface would appear if the "
"PostgreSQL radio button was selected.)"
msgstr ""
"Importovanje iz MySQL baze podataka (isti interfejs bi se pojavio kada bi "
"PostgreSQL radio button bio izabran)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the MySQL radio button is selected in the <interface>Database Import</"
"interface> window, you will be required to enter the following parameters in "
"the text box beside the appropriate label &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Ako je MySQL radio button izabran u prozoru <interface>Importovanje baze "
"podataka</interface>, trebat ćete da unesete sljedeće parametre u okvir za "
"tekst pored odgovarajuće oznake &mdash;"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2265 index.docbook:2289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server:"
msgstr "Server:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2266 index.docbook:2290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Username:"
msgstr "Ime korisnika:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2267 index.docbook:2291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Lozinka:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2268 index.docbook:2292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Port:"
msgstr "Port:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2269 index.docbook:2293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Database name:"
msgstr "Ime baze podataka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2274 index.docbook:2298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once this information has been supplied, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"button to proceed with the import steps that are <link linkend=\"common-"
"import\">common</link> to all. At this point, you may also click the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the import and return to the "
"previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Kada su ove informacije isporučene, kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> da nastavite sa koracima importovanja koji su <link linkend="
"\"common-import\">zajednički</link> za sve. U ovom trenutku, možete takođe "
"kliknuti taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da otkažete importovanje i da "
"se vratite na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing from PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Importovanje iz PostgreSQL baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the PostgreSQL radio button is selected in the <interface>Database "
"Import</interface> window, you will be required to enter the following "
"parameters in the text box beside the appropriate label &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Ako je PostgreSQL radio button izabran u prozoru <interface>Importovanje "
"baze podataka</interface>, trebat ćete da unesete sljedeće parametre u okvir "
"za tekst pored odgovarajuće oznake &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For both MySQL and PostgreSQL, it will be fine to leave the <guilabel>Port:</"
"guilabel> as <emphasis>Default</emphasis>, in most cases. However, if you "
"know that you connect to your database via a specific port number, "
"especially in the situation where you might be connecting remotely, it can "
"be set by either entering the port number in the text box beside the "
"<guilabel>Port:</guilabel> label, or using the spinbox beside the text box "
"to increment the port to the desired number."
msgstr ""
"Za oba MySQL i PostgreSQL, će biti uredu da napuste <guilabel>Port:</"
"guilabel> kao <emphasis>Default</emphasis>, u većini slučajeva. Međitim ako "
"znate da se povežete na vaše baze podataka preko određenog broja porta, "
"pogotovo ako ste u situaciji gdje je povezivanje na daljinu to se može "
"postaviti bilo unošenjem broja porta u polje pored oznake <guilabel>Port:</"
"guilabel>l, ili pomoću spinboxa pored tekst inkrementiranje porta do "
"željenog broja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steps Common to All Database Imports"
msgstr "Koraci zajednički za importovanje iz svih baza podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Similar to importing recipes from a file, if you have selected the "
"<quote>Ask which recipes to import</quote> tickbox in the <quote>Configure "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, Import/Export</quote> interface, when you "
"click on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button, the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> <interface>Import Recipes</interface> window will appear from "
"which you can select the recipes that you want to import. For instructions "
"on how to select this choice see the section <link linkend=\"import-export-"
"preference\">Choosing Import/Export Preferences</link>. If this selection is "
"not made, your recipes will be imported silently with no prompt."
msgstr ""
"Sličan je uvoz iz datoteke, ako ste odabrali<quote>Traći recepte za uvoz</"
"quote> u <quote>Konfiguracija <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, uvoz/izvoz</"
"quote> interfejsa, kada kliknete na tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> <interface>Uvezi recepte</interface> pojavit "
"će se prozor u kojem možete odabrati recepte koje želite uvesti. Za upute o "
"tome kako da izaberete ovu radnju pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"import-export-preference\">Odabir opcija uvezi/izvezi</link>. Ako je ovaj "
"izbor nije napravljen, vaš recepti će se uvoziti tiho bez ikakvog odziva."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Again the <guilabel>All</guilabel> label will show and beneath this, the "
"list of all categories being imported. Also like importing from a file, the "
"list items will have tick boxes on the left from which whole categories and/"
"or recipes can be deselected by clicking on the box to remove the check "
"mark. The total number of recipes will show to the right of the <quote>All</"
"quote> list item and the number of recipes in each category will display to "
"the right of the category item."
msgstr ""
"Opet <guilabel>Sve</guilabel> oznake će se prikazati ispod ove, popis svih "
"kategorija koje se uvoze. Također kao uvoz iz datoteke, ukupan broj recepata "
"će biti prikazan desno od liste <quote>Svih</quote> recepata i broj recepata "
"u svakoj kategoriji će se prikazati desno od stavke kategoriju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to proceed with importing the "
"database, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to stop the import. If "
"you choose to proceed, the categories and recipes that are in the database "
"file being imported will appear in your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"recipe list."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da nastavite sa importovanjem baze "
"podataka, ili <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zaustavite importovanje. Ako "
"izaberete da nastavite, kategorije i recepti koji su u datoteci baze "
"podataka koja se importuje će se pojaviti u vašoj <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> listi recepata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting Recipes to Other Formats"
msgstr "Eksportovanje recepata u druge formate"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> can export your recipes to the following "
"formats &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> može eksportovati vaše recepte u sljedeće "
"formate &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compressed &krecipes; format &ndash; files of this format will have "
"extensions of .kre"
msgstr ""
"Kompresovani &krecipes; format &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati "
"ekstenziju .kre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This export format will result in a smaller filesize and as a result disk "
"space is saved. The smaller filesize also makes sending over the Internet "
"easier. This format also provides a mean of backup in addition to the backup "
"functionality in <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. See the section <link "
"linkend=\"backup-db\">Backing up Your &krecipes; Database</link> for further "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj format za eksportovanje dovešće do manje veličine datoteke i time se "
"čuva prostor na disku. Manje veličine datoteke takođe olakšava slanje preko "
"interneta. Ovaj format takođe pruža sredstvo za rezervnu kopiju pored "
"funkcionalnosti pravljenja rezervne kopije u <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis>. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"backup-db\">Pravljenje "
"rezervne kopije vaše &krecipes; baze podataka</link> za dodatne informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2361
#, no-c-format
msgid "&krecipes; &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .kreml"
msgstr "&krecipes; &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .kreml"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using this format exports your recipe in a readable format that makes it "
"easier to edit the recipe &XML;."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba ovog formata eksportuje vaše recepte u čitljivom formatu koji "
"olakšava izmjenu &XML;-a recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When exporting in either &krecipes; and &krecipes; Compressed format, all "
"information is guaranteed to be preserved. Other formats may support only "
"certain information. If your recipes contain, for example, <quote>borders</"
"quote> around certain elements, and this is not supported by the export "
"format that you have specified, that information is lost without any warning."
msgstr ""
"Kada se eksportuje u &krecipes; i &krecipes; kompresovani format, sve "
"informacije će biti sigurno sačuvane. Drugi formati mogu podržavati samo "
"određene informacije. Ako vaš recept sadrži, na primjer, <quote>granice</"
"quote> oko određenih elemenata i ovo nije podržano od navedenog formata za "
"eksportovanje, ta informacija je izgubljena bez ikakvog upozorenja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2373
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plain Text &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .txt"
msgstr "Obični tekst &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .txt"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using this format exports your recipe information <emphasis>without the "
"photo</emphasis> into plain text format. The idea here is not to be able to "
"import back into <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, nor import into any other "
"recipe format. The purpose is to be a handy tool for such tasks as email."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći ovaj format eksportuje informacije vašeg recepta <emphasis>bez "
"slike</emphasis> u format običnog teksta. Ideja nije ni mogućnost "
"importovanja nazad u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ni importovanje u bilo "
"koji drugi format recepta. Svrha je da bude zgodan alat za zadatke kao što "
"je e-mail."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2381
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web Book &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .html"
msgstr "Web knjiga &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .html"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option allows you to export multiple recipes, for instance, a category. "
"The cool part about exporting as a Web Book is that you will be allowed to "
"navigate to specific recipes via links that appear under the category name "
"at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija vam omogućava da eksportujete više recepata, na primjer, "
"kategoriju. Kul dio eksportovanja u web knjigu je da će vam biti omogućeno "
"da se krećete do određenih recepata putem veza koje se pojavljuju pod imenom "
"kategorije na vrhu stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to use this feature to export recipes from a single category. "
"However, you can randomly select recipes from multiple categories to be "
"exported in this format. To do this, select the first recipe by clicking on "
"it and then, hold the &Ctrl; key and select the next and subsequent recipes. "
"If recipes are selected randomly, the export will create a page named "
"<emphasis>index.html</emphasis> in the location that you specify. This file "
"will have links to the various categories of recipes that you have exported."
msgstr ""
"Možda želite da koristite ovu mogućnost za izvoz receptata iz jedne "
"kategorije. Međutim, možete odabrati nasumične recepate iz više kategorija "
"koje ćete izvoziti u ovom formatu. Da biste to učinili, odaberite prvi "
"recept i klikom na njega držite tipku &Ctrl; i odaberite sljedeće naknadne "
"recepte. Ako su odabrani recepti sličajno, izvoz će kreirati stranicu pod "
"nazivom <emphasis>index.html</emphasis> na lokaciji gdje ste vi odredili. "
"Ova datoteka će imati veze sa raznim kategorijama recepata koje ste izvezli."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For instance, suppose you have selected to export random recipes from "
"<emphasis>Appetizers</emphasis>, <emphasis>Main Dishes</emphasis>, and "
"<emphasis>Desserts</emphasis>. The index.html file would show links for "
"<emphasis>Appetizers</emphasis>, <emphasis>Main Dishes</emphasis>, and "
"<emphasis>Desserts</emphasis>. Clicking any one of those links will open the "
"page for that category and you will then be able to navigate through the "
"recipes within the category by clicking on the recipe name link that appears "
"under the category name at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, pretpostavimo da ste izabrali izvoziti slučajnim receptima iz "
"<emphasis>Predjela</emphasis>, <emphasis>Glavna jela</emphasis>, i "
"<emphasis>Dezerti</emphasis>. U datoteku index.html će prikazati likove za "
"<emphasis>Predjela</emphasis>, <emphasis>Glavna jela</emphasis>, i "
"<emphasis>Dezerte</emphasis>. Klikom bilo koje od tih veza će otvoriti "
"stranicu za tu kategoriju, a vi ćete onda moći za prolaz kroz recepte u "
"kategoriji klikom na naziv recepta link koji se pojavljuje pod imenom "
"kategorije na vrhu stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2407
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once exported in Web Book format, you are unable to import these recipes "
"back into <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Nakon eksportovanja u format web knjige, niste u mogućnosti da importujete "
"ove recepata natrag u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2412
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web page &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .html"
msgstr "Web stranica &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .html"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might choose to export in this format in order to create a web page that "
"contains your recipes. Similar to exporting as a <emphasis>Web Book</"
"emphasis>, you can export recipes from a single category, entire categories "
"or randomly selected recipes from any number of categories. The difference "
"is that all recipes exported in Web page format will appear on a single web "
"page with no navigational ability other than scrolling through the page "
"using the scrollbar."
msgstr ""
"Možda odaberete za izvoz u ovom formatu, kako biste kreirali web stranicu "
"koja sadrži vaše recepte. Slično kao izvoz<emphasis>Web Book</emphasis>, "
"možete izvoziti recepte iz jedne kategorije, cijele kategorije ili slučajno "
"odabranih recepata iz bilo koje kategorije.  Razlika je u tome da su svi "
"recepti koji se izvezu u Web stranice formatu će se pojaviti na jednoj web "
"stranici bez navigacijske sposobnosti osim prelistavanja stranice koristeći "
"klizač."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While exporting in Web page format has its purpose, you will obviously note "
"the benefits of exporting as a Web Book if you are exporting many recipes."
msgstr ""
"Iako eksportovanje u format web stranice ima svoju svrhu, očigledno ćete "
"primijetiti koristi eksportovanja u format web knjige ako eksportujete mnogo "
"recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, it should be noted that once exported in Web page format, you are "
"unable to import these recipes back into <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, treba napomenuti da jednom kada se eksportuje u format web "
"stranice, niste u mogućnosti da importujete ove recepata natrag u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Exporting recipes in either <emphasis>Web page</emphasis> or <emphasis>Web "
"Book</emphasis> format will retain all visual settings &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</"
"abbrev> those set in <emphasis>Page Setup</emphasis>, including the graphic."
msgstr ""
"Eksportovanje recepata i u format <emphasis>web stranice</emphasis> i u "
"format <emphasis>web knjige</emphasis> će zadržati sva vizualna podešavanja "
"&ndash; <abbrev>tj.</abbrev> ona postavljena u <emphasis>Podešavanje "
"stranice</emphasis>, uključujući sliku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2437
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Meal-Master &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .mmf and "
"you might want to export in this format to be able to import into the Meal-"
"Master program to share will other Meal-Master users"
msgstr ""
"Meal-Master &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .mmf i možda "
"biste željeli da eksportujete u ovaj format da biste mogli da importujete u "
"Meal-Master program da dijelite sa drugim Meal-Master korisnicima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the most widely-used recipe format. However, you should note that if "
"your choose to export in this format, certain <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> recipe information will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je najviše upotrebljavan format recepata. Međutim, trebali biste imati "
"na umu da ako izaberete da eksportujete u ovaj format, određene "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> informacije recepta će biti izgubljene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2446
#, no-c-format
msgid "RecipeML &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .xml"
msgstr "RecipeML &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .xml"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a standard recipe &XML; format, although not yet widely used by most "
"recipe software. However, you may wish to use this format to have recipes "
"recognized by programs that use it."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je standardni &XML; format recepata, iako još uvijek nije u upotrebi u "
"većini softvera za recepte. Međutim, možda ćete željeti da upotrebljavate "
"ovaj format da bi recepti bili prepoznati u programima koji ga "
"upotrebljavaju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rezkonv &ndash; files of this format will have extensions of .rk"
msgstr "Rezkonv &ndash; datoteke ovog formata će imati ekstenziju .rk"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the format for Rezkonv Suite, a popular German recipe program. When "
"recipes are exported in this format, the human-readable and section names "
"(Title, Yield, etc.) will be in German."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je format za Rezkonv Suite, popularni njemački program za recepte. Kada "
"se recepti eksportuju u ovom formatu, čitljiva i imena dijelova (Naslov, "
"Prinos, itd.) će biti na njemačkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To export a single recipe to one of the above formats, first select the "
"recipe that you wish to export. Then, select <guimenu>File</guimenu> from "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar. From the available choices, "
"select <guimenuitem>Export ...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"Da eksportujete jedan recept u jedan od gore navedenih formata, prvo "
"izaberite recept koji želite eksportovati. Onda izaberite <guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> trake menija. Iz dostupnih "
"opcija izaberite <guimenuitem>Eksportuj ...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2467
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window will appear that allows you to navigate to location where you wish "
"to save your exported recipe. The location will default to your home folder, "
"but another existing folder can be chosen, or you can create a new folder. "
"The name of the recipe will appear in the box labeled <guilabel>Location:</"
"guilabel> and this will default to the name that was given to the recipe in "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database. However, this name can be "
"changed to another at your discretion."
msgstr ""
"Prozor će se pojaviti koji vam omogućuje da dođemo na mjesto gdje želite da "
"sačuvate izvezeni recept. Lokacija će biti default home folder, ali još "
"postojeći folder mogu biti izabrani, ili možete kreiratinovi folder. Ime "
"recepta će se pojaviti u oznaci <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel> i to će se "
"vratiti na default ime koje je dato receptu u <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> bazi podataka.  Međutim, to ime se može promijeniti u drugu u svom "
"nahođenju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> box is used to select the format that you "
"wish to use for the exported recipe from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Okvir <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> se koristi za izbor formata kojeg želite "
"koristiti za eksportovani recept iz padajućeg menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2480
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will also note that at the bottom of this window, there is a tickbox "
"that allows you to select or deselect to <guilabel>Automatically select "
"filename extension</guilabel>. The extension of the chosen export format "
"will appear beside the phrase. If you choose to keep the tickbox selected, "
"this extension will automatically be attached to the filename of your "
"exported recipe."
msgstr ""
"Takođe ćete primijetiti da na dnu ovog prozora ima potvrdni okvir koji vam "
"omogućava da izaberite ili poništite izbor da <guilabel>Automatski izaberi "
"ekstenziju datoteke</guilabel>. Ekstenzija odabranog formata za "
"eksportovanje će se pojaviti pored izraza. Ako izaberete da zadržite kvakicu "
"u potvrdnom okviru, ova ekstenzija će  automatski biti dodana na ime "
"datoteke vašeg eksportovanog recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the name of the exported recipe appears in the <guilabel>Location:</"
"guilabel> box and you have chosen the format you wish to use for your "
"exported recipe, click the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button to proceed "
"with the export, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to halt the "
"export process and return to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Kada se ime eksportovanog recepta pojavi u okviru <guilabel>Lokacija:</"
"guilabel> i odabrali ste format kojeg želite koristiti za vaš eksportovani "
"recept, kliknite taster <guibutton>Snimi</guibutton> da nastavite sa "
"eksportom, ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zaustavite proces "
"eksportovanja i vratite se na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2503
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button is clicked, the recipe will save "
"in the chosen format and you will be able to open it with the program that "
"accepts that file format &ndash; for example, if you have chosen to export "
"your recipe in <quote>Meal-Master</quote> format, you will be able to open "
"it in any program that accepts .mmf format files. You will also notice that "
"the export process has created a folder in which the graphics related to "
"your exported recipe are stored."
msgstr ""
"Kada kliknete na tipku <guibutton>Snimi</guibutton>, recept će se spasiti u "
"odabranom formatu, a vi ćete biti u mogućnosti da otvorite sa programom koji "
"prihvata za format datoteke &ndash; na primjer, ako ste izabrali da izvezete "
"svoj recept u <quote>Meal-Master</quote> formatu, moći ćete da ga otvorite u "
"bilo koji program koji prihvaća datoteke u .mmf formatu. Također ćete "
"primijetiti da je proces izvoza stvorio u folder u kojem se čuvaju grafika "
"koje se odnose na vaš izvozi recept."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may also export categories of recipes or your whole database in this "
"same manner. However, if you want to export your entire database, you must "
"ensure that no recipe or category is selected in your recipe list."
msgstr ""
"Možete takođe eksportovati kategorije recepata ili vašu cijelu bazu podataka "
"na isti način. Međutim, ako želite eksportovati vašu cijelu bazu podataka, "
"morate osigurati da nijedan recept ili kategorije nisu izabrani u vašoj "
"listi recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2515
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whether you are exporting a single recipe, a category of recipes or your "
"entire database, if no recipe or category of recipes is selected, an alert "
"box will appear containing the message <quote>No recipes are currently "
"selected. Would you like to export all recipes in the current view?</quote> "
"Click the <guibutton>Yes</guibutton> button (or use the <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Y</keycap></keycombo>) to proceed with the export of "
"all recipes. You can also cancel the process in order to select recipes for "
"export by clicking the <guibutton>No</guibutton> button (or use the "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> key "
"combination)."
msgstr ""
"Bez obzira da li se izvozi jedan recept, kategorija recepata ili cijela baza "
"podataka, ako je odabrana kategorija bez recepata, pojavit će se poruka "
"<quote>Trenutno nema odabranih recepata. Želite li izvesti sve recepte u "
"trenutnom prikazu?</quote> Kliknite tipku <guibutton>Yes</guibutton> (ili "
"koristite <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Y</keycap></keycombo>) da "
"nastavite izvor svih recepata. Također možete otkazati preces kako bi "
"izabrali recepte za izvoz klikom na tipku <guibutton>No</guibutton> (ili "
"koristite <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"kombinaciju tipku)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you recall, when <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> starts, by default the "
"<emphasis>Find/Edit Recipes</emphasis> component is active and if you have "
"recipes and categories, they appear in the right pane of the window. At this "
"point nothing is selected, so you could choose to export your entire "
"database. However, if there is something selected and you want to export, "
"simply click on the white area of the category/recipe list. The highlight "
"will disappear from the choice and you can now proceed to export your entire "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Ako se sjećate, kada <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> počinje, po defaultu je "
"<emphasis>Pronađi/Izmjeni recepte</emphasis> komponenta je aktivna i ako "
"imate recepte u kategorijama, one se pojavljuju u denom okviru prozora. U "
"ovom trenutku ništa nije izabrano, tako da možete odabrati i izvoziti cijelu "
"bazu podataka. Međutim, ako postoji nešto odabrano i želite izvoziti, "
"jednostavno kliknite na bijelom području liste kategorije/recept. Vrhunac će "
"nestati sa izbora i sada možete nastaviti izvoziti cijelu bazu podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2539
#, no-c-format
msgid "Backing Up and Restoring Your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Database"
msgstr ""
"Pravljenje rezervne kopije i vraćanje vaše <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2541
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> it is an easy task to Backup and "
"Restore your database. The Backup tool is extremely important so that you "
"never lose your recipe database in the event of a hard drive failure. It is "
"wise to ensure that you have a backup copy of your database in a location "
"other than your hard drive. The Backup functionality is also useful when you "
"simply want to revert to a previous version of your recipe database."
msgstr ""
"Sa <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> je to lak zadatak za Backup i Restore "
"svoju bazu podataka. Backup alat je izizetno važan, tako danikada ne "
"izgubite recept iz baze podataka u slučaju kvara na hard disku. To je "
"pametno kako bi se osiguralo da imate kopiju vaše baze podataka u drugim "
"mjestima nego samo na hard disku. Backup funkcionalnost je također korisna "
"kada jednostavno želite da se vratite na prethodnu verziju vašeg recept baze "
"podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2549
#, no-c-format
msgid "Backing Up Your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Database"
msgstr ""
"Pravljenje rezervne kopije vaše <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To backup your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database file, select "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Backup...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar. However, you might want to "
"consider creating a keyboard shortcut (see the section <link linkend="
"\"configure-shortcuts\">Creating Shortcuts</link> for more information), or "
"adding an icon to your toolbar (see the section <link linkend=\"configure-"
"toolbars\">Customizing the Toolbar</link> for instruction on how to do "
"this), since this is an invaluable tool and you will find yourself utilizing "
"it often."
msgstr ""
"Za vaš backup <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> datoteke baze podataka, "
"odaberite <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Backup...</guimenuitem> "
"i meni trake <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. Međutim, možda želite uzeti u "
"obzir stvaranej prečice na tastaturi (pogledaj poglavlje <link linkend="
"\"configure-shortcuts\">Kreiranje prečaca</link> za više informacija), ili "
"dodajte ikonu na alatnu traku (pogledaj poglavlje <link linkend=\"configure-"
"toolbars\">Prilagođivanje alatne trake</link> za viđe informacija kako to "
"učiniti), jer je to dragocjen alat i vrlo često ćete ga koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have selected the menu item, shortcut or icon to backup your "
"database, the <emphasis><interface>Save Backup As... -&krecipes;</"
"interface></emphasis> window will appear where you can navigate to the "
"location where you want to store your backup file and provide a name for it. "
"By default, this interface opens to your home folder. You can navigate to "
"another location and then, type the name that you wish to utilize for your "
"backup in the text box beside the label <guilabel>Location:</guilabel>. To "
"position the cursor in the <guilabel>Location:</guilabel> text box, either "
"click in the box or use the keyboard shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Alt;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>. If you have previously backed up your "
"database, you can also select it from the drop-down menu beside the "
"<guilabel>Location:</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste odabrali stavku izbornika, prečice ili ikonu za backup vaše baze "
"podataka<emphasis><interface>Snimi Backup kao... -&krecipes;</interface></"
"emphasis> prozor će prikazati gdje možete se kretati na lokaciju gdje želite "
"pohraniti svoje backup datoteku i dati joj ime. Po defaultu, taj interfejd "
"se otvara vaš home folder. Možete se kretati na drugoj lokaciji, a zatim "
"upišite ime koje želite da koristite za svoj backup u okviru za tekst pored "
"oznake <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel>. Postavike pokazivač "
"<guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel> okvir za tekst, zatim kliknite na nju ili "
"koristit tastaturu <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>L</keycap></"
"keycombo>. IAko ste prethodno napravili kopiju baze podataka, možete ga "
"odaberite iz padajućeg izbornika pored <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel> okvira "
"za tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> text box shows the type of file that you "
"are creating. In the situation where you are backing up your "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database file, there is only one type of "
"file available &ndash; a &krecipes; Backup File (*.krecbk), and that shows "
"as the default selection."
msgstr ""
"Okvir za tekst <guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> prikazuje vrstu datoteke koju "
"pravite. U slučaju u koje pravite rezervnu kopiju vaše <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> datoteke baze podataka, dostupna je samo jedna vrsta datoteke "
"&ndash; a &krecipes; Datoteka rezervne kopije (*.krecbk), i ona se prikazuje "
"kao standardni izbor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2580
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final item in this window is a tick box beside the label "
"<guilabel>Automatically select filename extension (.krecbk)</guilabel>. With "
"this option active, <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> there is an x in the tick box, you "
"can provide a filename, but do not have to supply an extension. The "
"extension .krecbk will be attached to your filename automatically. However, "
"you do not have to use the extension .krecdb. Simply clear the tick box and "
"then, when you supply the filename for your backup, include the extension "
"that you choose. For example, you might choose to name your database backup "
"file <emphasis>myrecipes.krback</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Konačna stavka u ovom prozoru je potvrdni okvir pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Automatski odabrati ekstenziju datoteke (.krecbk)</guilabel>. Sa "
"ovom akcijom aktivna, <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> postoji okvir. Ekstenzija ."
"krecbk će automatski priključene datoteke. Međutim, ne morate korisitit "
"ekstenziju .krecdb. Jednostavno očistiti potvrdni okvir, a onda, kad ste mu "
"dali naziv datoteke za vaš backup, uključuju ekstenzije koje ste izabrali. "
"Na primjer, možda ćete odabrati da ime vaše baze podataka backup datoteke "
"<emphasis>mojirecepti.krback</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have chosen the name for your backup and the location where you "
"want to store it, click the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button to complete "
"the backup process, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the "
"interface and return to the main <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste izabrali ime za svoju rezervnu kopiju i lokaciju gdje je želite "
"sačuvati, kliknite taster <guibutton>Snimi</guibutton> da završite proces "
"pravljenja rezervne kopije, ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da "
"zatvorite interfejs i vratite se na glavni <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"prozor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2598
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restoring Your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Database"
msgstr "Vraćanje vaše <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> baze podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2600
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To restore your <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database file, select "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Restore...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu bar. As previously mentioned, you might "
"want to consider creating a keyboard shortcut (see the section <link linkend="
"\"configure-shortcuts\">Creating Shortcuts</link> for more information), or "
"adding an icon to your toolbar (see the section <link linkend=\"configure-"
"toolbars\">Customizing the Toolbar</link> for instruction on how to do this)."
msgstr ""
"Da biste vratili <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> datoteku baze podataka, "
"idaberite <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Vrati...</guimenuitem> "
"iz meni trake <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. Kao što je već spomenuto, "
"možda želite uzeti u obzir stvaranej prečica na tastaturi (pogledaj "
"poglavlje <link linkend=\"configure-shortcuts\">Kreiranje prečaca</link> za "
"više informacija), ili dodajte ikonu na alatnu traku (vidi poglavlje <link "
"linkend=\"configure-toolbars\">Prolagođivanje alatne trake</link> za "
"objađnjenje kako se to radi)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2609
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have selected the menu item, shortcut or icon to restore your "
"database, the <emphasis><interface>Restore Backup &ndash; &krecipes;</"
"interface></emphasis> window will appear where you can navigate to the "
"location where you saved your backup. Once you have located the file and "
"selected it, its name will appear in the text box beside the label "
"<guilabel>Location:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste izabrali stavku menija, kraticu ili ikonu da vratite svoju bazu "
"podataka, pojavit će se prozor <emphasis><interface>Vrati rezervnu kopiju "
"&ndash; &krecipes;</interface></emphasis> gdje se možete kretati do lokacije "
"na kojoj ste snimili svoju rezervnu kopiju. Kada se pronašli i izabrali "
"datoteku, njeno ime će se pojaviti u okviru za tekst pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2616
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, the <emphasis><interface>Restore Backup &ndash; &krecipes;</"
"interface></emphasis> window opens to your home folder. An alternative to "
"navigating to the location of your backup file and selecting it would be to "
"type its name, including the path, directly into the <guilabel>Location:</"
"guilabel> text box. To position the cursor in the <guilabel>Location:</"
"guilabel> text box, either click in the box or use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>. If you have "
"previously backed up your database, you can also select it from the drop-"
"down menu beside the <guilabel>Location:</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu, <emphasis><interface>Vrati backup &ndash; &krecipes;</"
"interface></emphasis> otvara se prozor u vas home folder. Alternativa "
"navigaciji na lokaciju vaše backup datoteke i odabirom bilo bi ime, "
"uključujući putanju, direktno u <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel> okvir za "
"tekst. Postavite pokazivač na <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel> okvir za tekst, "
"klikom na okvir ili korištenjem prečaca sa tastature <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Alt;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo>. IAko ste prethodno napravili kopiju "
"baze podataka, možete ga odaberite iz padajućeg izbornika pored okvira za "
"tekst <guilabel>Lokacija:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with the backup function, the text box beside the <guilabel>Filter:</"
"guilabel> label shows the type of file as <emphasis>&krecipes; Backup File "
"(*.krecbk)</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Kao kod funkcije pravljenja rezervne kopije, okvir za tekst pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> prikazuje vrstu datoteke kao "
"<emphasis>&krecipes; Datoteka rezervne kopije (*.krecbk)</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have selected your backup file, click the <guibutton>Open</"
"guibutton> button to initiate the restore or the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button to close the window and return to the main "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> interface."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste izabrali svoju datoteku rezervne kopije, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Otvori</guibutton> da pokrene vraćanje ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zatvorite prozor i da se vratite na glavni "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> interfejs."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2637
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you chose to proceed with the restore, the <emphasis>Warning &ndash; "
"&krecipes;</emphasis> window will appear, as shown in the following "
"screenshot:"
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberte da nastavite sa vraćanjem, prozor <emphasis>Upozorenje &ndash; "
"&krecipes;</emphasis> će se pojaviti, kao što je prikazano na sljedećoj "
"snimljenoj slici ekrana:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2643
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the warning that appears when restoring the "
"&krecipes; database."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana upozorenja koje se pojavi kada vraćate &krecipes; "
"bazu podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2652
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restoring Your Database &ndash; Erase Warning"
msgstr "Vraćanje vaše baze podataka &ndash; Upozorenje brisanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2658
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select the tick box beside the label <guilabel>Do not ask again</"
"guilabel> to prevent this message from showing in the future. However, if "
"you choose to do this, your backup file will be restored silently and you "
"will not be able to change your mind."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati potvrdni okvir pored oznake <guilabel>Ne pitaj ponovo</"
"guilabel> da se ova poruka ne bi pojavljivala u budućnosti. Međutim, ako "
"izaberete da to uradite, vaša datoteka rezervne kopije će biti tiho vraćena "
"i nećete se moći predomisliti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2663
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to continue to show the warning, click the "
"<guibutton>Continue</guibutton> button to proceed with restoring your "
"database file, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to stop the "
"restore process and return to the main <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberete da nastavite prikazivati upozorenje, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Nastavi</guibutton> da nastavite sa vraćanje vaše datoteke baze "
"podataka, ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zaustavite proces "
"vraćanja i da se vratite na glavni <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2668
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to continue with the restore, a progress dialog window will "
"appear. The number of recipes in your database determines the length of time "
"that this window will show. Finally, a dialog box will appear containing the "
"message <quote>Restore Successful</quote>. Click the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button to clear the window. Your restore is now complete!"
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberete da nastavite sa vraćanjem, dijalog napretka će se pojaviti. "
"Broj recepata u vašoj bazi podataka određuje koliko dugo će ovaj prozor biti "
"prikazan. Konačno, pojavit će se okvir za dijalog koji sadrži poruku "
"<quote>Vraćanje uspješno</quote>. Kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"da očistite prozor. Vaše vraćanje je sada završeno!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2678
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other &krecipes; Components"
msgstr "Druge &krecipes; komponente"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2681
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Shopping List"
msgstr "Lista za kupovinu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Shopping List</emphasis> component appears when the "
"<guibutton>Shopping List</guibutton> button is clicked in the left pane of "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window."
msgstr ""
"Komponenta <emphasis>Lista za kupovinu</emphasis> se pojavi kada se klikne "
"taster <guibutton>Lista za kupovinu</guibutton> u lijevom oknu "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2689
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Shopping List component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Lista za kupovinu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2698
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Shopping List Component"
msgstr "Komponenta Lista za kupovinu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2703
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When selected, the component title appears at the top in the right pane of "
"the window."
msgstr ""
"Kada je izabrana, naslov komponente se pojavi na vrhu desnog okna prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2706
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below this is a text box to <userinput>enter the specific name of a recipe</"
"userinput> to search for. Recipes can also be chosen by selecting them from "
"the list. Either way, the selected recipe must by transferred to the right-"
"hand side of the screen under the heading <guilabel>Shopping List</guilabel> "
"by clicking on the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"go-next.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></"
"guiicon> button between the two portions of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ispod ovoga je okvir za tekst za <userinput>unos određenog imena recepta</"
"userinput> za pretraživanje. Recepti se takođe mogu odabrati iz liste. U "
"bilo kojem slučaju, izabrani recept se mora prenijeti u desni dio ekrana pod "
"naslovom <guilabel>Lista za kupovinu</guilabel> klikom na taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-next.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> između dva "
"dijela ekrana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the desired recipes have been transferred to the shopping list side of "
"the screen, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Kada su željeni recepti prebačeni na stranu ekrana za listu za kupovinu, "
"kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Recipe names can also be transferred out of the shopping list side of the "
"screen by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button."
msgstr ""
"Imena recepata mogu takođe biti prebačena sa strane ekrana za listu za "
"kupovinu klikom na taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The entire list of recipes that has been selected for producing the shopping "
"list can be cleared by clicking the <guibutton>Clear</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Cijela lista recepata koja je izabrana za pravljenje liste za kupovinu se "
"može očistiti klikom na taster <guibutton>Očisti</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2731
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button is clicked, a window will appear "
"that lists all ingredients contained in the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"database on the left and the ingredients required for the selected recipe(s) "
"on the right. Above each of these is a <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> text box "
"to <userinput>enter the name of an ingredient</userinput> to search for "
"within each of the lists."
msgstr ""
"Kada se klikne taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, pojavit će se prozor koji "
"navodi sve sastojke sadržane u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> bazi podataka "
"na lijevoj i sastojci potrebni za izabrani (izabrane) recept(e) na desnoj "
"strani. Iznad svakog od ovih je okvir za tekst <guilabel>Pretraži:</"
"guilabel> za <userinput>unos imena sastojka</userinput> za pretraživanje "
"unutar svake od listi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2739
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredients can be transferred to and from either side by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> or "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-next.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button that "
"appears between the lists, as needed."
msgstr ""
"Sastojci se mogu prenijeti u i iz bilo koje strane klikom na taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ili "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-next.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> koji se "
"pojavljuje između listi, po potrebi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2746
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the recipe ingredient list on the right, the <quote>Amount</quote> and "
"the <quote>Unit</quote> of each ingredient can be edited by double-clicking "
"on the appropriate value. For example, if the recipe requires 4 eggs and a "
"purchase of eggs is required to make the recipe, it is unlikely that you "
"would buy 4 eggs. In this case, the eggs ingredient could be selected, the "
"<quote>Amount</quote> changed to 1 and the <quote>Unit</quote> changed to "
"doz. or dozen."
msgstr ""
"U listi sastojaka recepta na desnoj strani, <quote>količina</quote> i "
"<quote>mjera</quote> svakog sastojka se mogu izmijeniti dvoklikom na "
"odgovarajuću vrijednost. Na primjer, ako za recept treba 4 jajeta i kupovina "
"jaja je potrebna da se napravi recept, malo je vjerovatno da biste kupili 4 "
"jajeta. U ovom slučaju, sastojak jaja bi mogao biti izabran, "
"<quote>količina</quote> promijenjena na 1 i <quote>mjera</quote> "
"promijenjena na t. ili tuce."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When all desired changes have been made to the ingredients for the recipe(s) "
"selected, click the <guibutton>Done</guibutton> button and the "
"<interface>Shopping List</interface> will display."
msgstr ""
"Kada su sve željene promjene napravljene na sastojcima za izabrani "
"(izabrane) recept(e), kliknite taster <guibutton>Gotovo</guibutton> i "
"<interface>Lista za kupovinu</interface> će se prikazati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2758
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <interface>Shopping List</interface> window, click the "
"<guibutton>Print</guibutton> button to print the shopping list, or click the "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton> button to close the window."
msgstr ""
"Iz prozora <interface>Lista za kupovinu</interface>, kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Štampaj</guibutton> da odštampate listu za kupovinu, ili kliknite "
"taster <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> da zatvorite prozor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2765
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Diet Helper"
msgstr "Pomoćnik za dijetu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2767
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of the <emphasis>Diet Helper</emphasis> component is to help "
"plan menus for days, or weeks, at a time. Because of the ability to select "
"nutrient values in this component, you are also able to plan your meals to "
"adhere to nutrient limits. This makes either restricting or enhancing your "
"diet much easier and more efficient."
msgstr ""
"Svrha komponente <emphasis>Pomoćnik za dijetu</emphasis> je da pomogne u "
"planiranju menija za dane, ili sedmice, u jednom trenutku. Zbog mogućnosti "
"izbora hranljivih vrijednosti u ovoj komponenti, takođe možete planirati "
"svoje obroke da se pridržavate ograničenja hranljivih tvari. Ovo čini i "
"ograničavanje i poboljšavanje vaše dijete mnogo lakšim i uspješnijim."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2775
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Diet Helper component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana komponente &krecipes; Pomoćnik za dijetu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2784
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Diet Helper Component"
msgstr "Komponenta Pomoćnik za dijetu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Diet Helper</emphasis> component is accessed by clicking on "
"the <guibutton>Diet Helper</guibutton> button in the left pane of the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window. As with other <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> components, the user interface appears in the right pane under the "
"heading <emphasis>Diet Helper</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Komponenti <emphasis>Pomoćnik za dijetu</emphasis> se pristupa klikom na "
"taster <guibutton>Pomoćnik za dijetu</guibutton> u lijevom oknu "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora. Kao kod ostalih <emphasis>&krecipes;"
"</emphasis> komponenti, korisnički interfejs se pojavi u desnom oknu ispod "
"naslova <emphasis>Pomoćnik za dijetu</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2795
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start setting up your menus, the first thing your have to do is select "
"the number of days that you are planning for and the number of meals per day."
msgstr ""
"Da biste započeli podešavanje vaših menija, prva stvar koju morate uraditi "
"je da izaberete broj dana koje planirate i broj obroka po danu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2799
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the rectangular area under the heading <guilabel>Number of Days</"
"guilabel>, the number of days is set at <quote>- 1 -</quote>. To increase "
"this value, click and hold the &LMB; and move the slider to the right. The "
"value will increment up to <quote>- 6 -</quote> and then, change to <quote>- "
"1 week -</quote>. After the number of days changes to <quote>- 1 week -</"
"quote>, increases are in increments of 1 week to a maximum of 4 weeks."
msgstr ""
"U pravougaonom području ispod naslova <guilabel>Broj dana</guilabel>, broj "
"dana je postavljen na <quote>- 1 -</quote>. Da povećate ovu vrijednost, "
"kliknite i držite &LMB; i pomjerajte klizač desno. Vrijednost će se "
"povećavati do <quote>- 6 -</quote> i onda promijeniti u <quote>- 1 sedmica -"
"</quote>. Nakon što se broj dana promijeni u <quote>- 1 sedmica -</quote>, "
"povećanja su u pomacima od 1 sedmice do maksimalno 4 sedmice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2807
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Similarly, in the rectangular area under the heading <guilabel>Meals per "
"Day</guilabel>, the number of meals displays as <quote>- 1 -</quote>. This "
"value is incremented by clicking and holding the &LMB; and moving the slider "
"to the right until the desired number of meals is displayed, up to a maximum "
"of 10. When the slider is adjusted, a tab will appear for each of the meals."
msgstr ""
"Slično, u pravougaonom području ispod naslova <guilabel>Broj obroka po danu</"
"guilabel>, broj obroka se prikazuje kao <quote>- 1 -</quote>. Ova vrijednost "
"se povećava klikom i držanjem &LMB; i pomjeranjem klizača udesno dok se ne "
"prikaže željeni broj obroka, do maksimalno 10. Kada se podešava klizač, "
"pojavit će se kartica za svaki od obroka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2814
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next step is to specify the number of dishes per meal. This is done by "
"using the spinbox beside the <guilabel>No. of dishes:</guilabel> label to "
"adjust the number."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak je da odredite broj jela po obroku. Ovo se uradi upotrebom "
"spinboxa pored oznake <guilabel>Br. jela:</guilabel> za podešavanje broja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beside the <guilabel>No. of dishes:</guilabel> are the <guibutton>Previous "
"Dish</guibutton> and <guibutton>Next Dish</guibutton> buttons that are used "
"to navigate back and forth between dishes as you specify the type of recipe "
"for each. As you utilize these buttons to move back and forth between "
"dishes, you will note that in the <emphasis>Dish Characteristics</emphasis> "
"area of the screen, the dish label changes as follows &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Pored <guilabel>Br. jela:</guilabel> su tasteri <guibutton>Prethodno jelo</"
"guibutton> i <guibutton>Naredno jelo</guibutton> koji se koriste za kretanje "
"nazad i naprijed između jela dok navodite vrstu recepta za svako. Dok "
"koristite ove tastere za kretanje nazad i naprijed između jela, "
"primijetićete da se u <emphasis>Osobine jela</emphasis> području ekrana "
"mijenja oznaka jela na sljedeći način &mdash;"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2826
#, no-c-format
msgid "1st Course"
msgstr "Predjelo"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2828
#, no-c-format
msgid "2nd Course"
msgstr "Glavno jelo"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2830
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dessert"
msgstr "Desert"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2833
#, no-c-format
msgid "And for subsequent meals &mdash;"
msgstr "A za kasnije obroke &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2835
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Dish 4</guilabel>, <guilabel>Dish 5</guilabel>, etc."
msgstr "<guilabel>Jelo 4</guilabel>, <guilabel>Jelo 5</guilabel>, itd."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2840
#, no-c-format
msgid "Planning Menus"
msgstr "Planiranje menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2841
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <emphasis>Dish Characteristics</emphasis> area of the screen and "
"beside the dish label, there is a tick box to <guilabel>Enable Category "
"Filtering</guilabel>. Clicking this box <action>enables the feature</"
"action>. It is important that you choose to do this because you may "
"otherwise end up having <emphasis>Cheesecake</emphasis>, or some other "
"unreasonable dish for breakfast!"
msgstr ""
"U području ekrana <emphasis>Osobine jela</emphasis> i pored oznake jela, se "
"nalazi potvrdni okvir za <guilabel>Omogući filtriranje po kategoriji</"
"guilabel>. Klik na ovaj okvir <action>omogućava funkciju</action>. Bitno je "
"da izaberete da ovo uradite jer biste mogli završiti da imate "
"<emphasis>kolač od sira</emphasis>, ili neko drugo bezmisleno jelo za "
"doručak!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2848
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With <quote>category filtering</quote> turned on, you can select the "
"category to be used for the dish as specified by the dish label located "
"beside the category selection box. For instance, the dish label might show "
"<guilabel>1st Course</guilabel>. If you are selecting courses for your "
"dinner meal, you might then select the category <emphasis>Salads</emphasis> "
"from the category list. A scrollbar exists to the right that allows moving "
"up and down within the list."
msgstr ""
"Sa uključenom <quote>kategorijom filtriranja</quote>,možete odabrati "
"kategoriju koja će se korisiti za jelo kao što je navedeno od strane jela "
"oznake koja se nalazi pored izbora kategorije. Na primjer,oznaka jela može "
"pokazati <guilabel>1. kurs</guilabel>. Ako odabirom kuseva za večeru, možda "
"zatim odaberite kategoriju <emphasis>Salate</emphasis> sa čoste kategorije. "
"Scrollbar postoji na desnoj strani koji omogućava kretanje gore-dole u listi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2856
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Continuing with the example of selecting dishes for your dinner meal, you "
"would then click the <guibutton>Next Dish</guibutton> button. When you do "
"this, you will note that the dish label changes to <guilabel>2nd Course</"
"guilabel> and that again, you must turn <emphasis>category filtering</"
"emphasis> on. Now, you can proceed with the selection of the category for "
"your next dish, for example, <emphasis>Pasta</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Nastavljajući na primjeru odabira jela za večeru obrok, zatim bi kliknuli na "
"tipku <guibutton>Sljeceće jelo</guibutton>. Kada to radite, vi ćete "
"napomenuti da su primjene jela sa osnakom <guilabel>2. kursa</guilabel> i "
"zatim ponovo morate uključiti <emphasis>Filtriranje kategorija</emphasis>. "
"Sada, možete nastaviti s izborom kategoriji za vaše sljedeće jelo, na "
"primjer, na primjer, <emphasis>Pasta</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2863
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Continue selecting the types of dishes for your meals in this same manner. "
"When you have completed selecting the types of dishes, at this point, you "
"can click the <guibutton>Create the diet</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite birati vrste jela za svoje obroke na isti način. Kada ste završili "
"sa izborom vrste jela, at this point, možete kliknuti taster "
"<guibutton>Napravi dijetu</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2867
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this point, you are planning a menu only and not taking any dietary and "
"nutrient constraints into consideration. To plan menus and consider nutrient "
"consumption, see the section <link linkend=\"plan-menu-diet\">Planning Diet-"
"Conscious Menus</link>."
msgstr ""
"U ovom trenutku, planirate samo meni i ne uzimate u obzir bilo koja "
"dijetalna i ograničenja hranljivih tvari. Da planirate menija i uzmete u "
"obzir potrošnju hranljivih tvari, pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"plan-"
"menu-diet\">Planiranje dijetalnih menija</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2872 index.docbook:2956
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you click the <guibutton>Create the diet</guibutton> button, the "
"<interface>Diet</interface> window appears which displays your menus for the "
"number of days that you have selected. In this window, you can click the "
"<guibutton>Create Shopping List</guibutton> button to create the shopping "
"list for your menus. You can also choose to <action>print the menu</action> "
"by clicking the <guibutton>Print</guibutton> button. Clicking the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button closes the <interface>Diet</interface> "
"window and returns you to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Kada kliknete na tipku <guibutton>kreiraj ishranu</guibutton>, u "
"<interface>Ishrana</interface> pojavljuje se prozor koji prikazuje izbore za "
"broj dana koje ste odabrali. U ovom prozoru možete kliknuti na tipku "
"<guibutton>Kreiraj listu za kupovinu</guibutton> za kreiranje liste za "
"kupovinu. Također možete odabrati da <action>isprintaj meni</action> klikom "
"na <guibutton>Printaj</guibutton> button. Klikom na tipku <guibutton>Otkaži</"
"guibutton> zatvara <interface>Ishrana</interface> prozor i vraća se na "
"prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2884
#, no-c-format
msgid "Planning Diet-Conscious Menus"
msgstr "Planiranje dijetalnih menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2886
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the steps listed in the section <link linkend=\"menu-plan-only"
"\">Planning Menus</link> also apply here. This section will discuss the "
"incorporation of nutrient values into your menus."
msgstr ""
"Svi koraci navedeni u poglavlju <link linkend=\"menu-plan-only\">Planiranje "
"menija</link> važe i ovdje. U ovom poglavlju će raspravljati o uključivanju "
"hranljivih vrijednosti u vaše menije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before you can include nutrients in your menu plan, you must ensure the "
"following &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Prije nego što možete uključiti hranljive tvari u vaš plan menija, morate "
"osigurati sljedeće &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2893
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Nutrients or <emphasis>properties</emphasis> must be loaded for the "
"ingredients. See the section <link linkend=\"ingredient-properties"
"\">Properties in Ingredients</link> for further instructions. If an "
"ingredient does not contain nutrient values, it will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Hranljive tvari ili <emphasis>osobine</emphasis> se moraju učitati za "
"sastojke. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"ingredient-properties"
"\">Osobine u sastojcima</link> za dodatno uputstvo. Ako sastojak ne sadrži "
"hranljive vrijednosti, biće zanemaren."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2898
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Units of measure must be associated with the ingredients. Since most "
"nutrients are measured in <emphasis>g/g</emphasis> or <emphasis>mg/g</"
"emphasis>, ensure that <emphasis>g</emphasis> is one of the units associated "
"with each ingredient. See the section <link linkend=\"ingredient-units"
"\">Units in Ingredients</link> for additional information."
msgstr ""
"Jedinice mjere se moraju povezati sa sastojcima. Pošto se većina hranljivih "
"tvari mjeri u <emphasis>g/g</emphasis> ili <emphasis>mg/g</emphasis>, "
"osigurajte da je <emphasis>g</emphasis> jedna od mjera koja je u vezi sa "
"svakim od sastojaka. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"ingredient-units"
"\">Mjere u sastojcima</link> za dodatne informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2904
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The equivalencies between the units of measure must be completed in the "
"<emphasis>Units</emphasis> component within the <guilabel>Mass Conversions</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Volume Conversions</guilabel> tabs. See the section "
"<link linkend=\"set-equivalents\">Completing Your Conversion Tables</link> "
"for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Jednakosti između jedinica mjere se moraju završiti u komponenti "
"<emphasis>Mjere</emphasis> unutar kartica <guilabel>Pretvaranja mase</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Pretvaranja zapremine</guilabel>. Pogledajte poglavlje "
"<link linkend=\"set-equivalents\">Završavanje vaše tabele za pretvaranje</"
"link> za uputstvo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2912
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have ensured that all necessary details have been provided for your "
"ingredients, you are ready to consider nutrients in your menu plan. Of "
"course, attending to these details should be done prior to the start of "
"creating your menu/diet, since the consideration of nutrient values is a "
"continuation of planning a basic menu."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste osigurali da su ponuđeni svi potrebni detalji za vaše sastojke, "
"spremni ste da uzmete u obzir hranljive tvari u planiranju svog menija. "
"Naravno, treba povesti brigu o ovim detaljima prije početka pravljenja vašeg "
"menija/dijete, jer je uzimanje u obzir hranljivih vrijednost nastavak "
"planiranja osnovnog menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2918
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the portion of the screen that lists the nutrients, under the heading "
"<guilabel>Enabled</guilabel>, select the nutrient that you want to consider "
"by clicking on the tick box that appears to the left of the nutrient name. "
"Note that you do not have to select <emphasis>every</emphasis> ingredient, "
"only those that you wish to take into consideration. A scrollbar exists to "
"the right that allows moving up and down within the list."
msgstr ""
"U dijelu ekrana koja sadrži hranjive tvari, pod naslovom "
"<guilabel>Omogućeno</guilabel>, oodaberite hranu koje želite uzeti u obzir "
"klikom na potvrdni okvir koji se pojavljuje na lijevo od imena hrane. Imajte "
"na umu da ne morate za odabir <emphasis>svakog</emphasis> sastojka, samo "
"onaj koje želite uzeti u obzir. A traka za pomijeranje postoji na desnoj "
"strani koja omogućava kretanje gore-dole u listi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2925
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the right of the nutrient name, columns labeled <guilabel>Min. Value</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Max. Value</guilabel> exist. These are used to set "
"the minimum and maximum values of nutrients so that when the search for "
"appropriate recipes is done, only recipes that have a particular nutrient "
"falling into the specified range will be considered for your menu/diet."
msgstr ""
"Desno od imena hrane, postoji kolona sa oznakom <guilabel>Min. vrijednost</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Max. vrijednost</guilabel>.  One se koriste za "
"postavljanje minimalne i maksimalne vrijednosti hranjivih tvari, tako da "
"kada je potraga za odgovarajućim receptima se vrši samo po receptima koje "
"imaju posebnu hranljivu vrijednost u određenom opsegu će se smatrati za vaš "
"meni/ishranu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2932
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To set the ranges for a nutrient that you want to take into consideration, "
"select it (it will be highlighted). Under the headings for <guilabel>Min. "
"Value</guilabel> and <guilabel>Max. Value</guilabel>, the <quote>0</quote> "
"that was under each heading prior to selecting the nutrient will change to "
"<quote>0.00</quote>. A spinbox will show beside each of these values that "
"you can utilize to set the value that you want. Alternatively, you can click "
"on the value, position the cursor to where you want to type using the "
"directional arrows and type a value, or you can double-click on the value to "
"highlight it and type over the entire value that exists. These steps must be "
"completed in each course category for each nutrient that you want to "
"consider."
msgstr ""
"Za postavljanje opsega za nutrijentima koji želite uzeti u obzir, izaberite "
"to (bit će istaknuta). Pod naslovima za <guilabel>Min. Valute</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Max. Valute</guilabel>,  <quote>0</quote> koja je u svakom naslovu "
"prije izbora nutrijenata će se promijeniti u<quote>0.00</quote>. A spinbox "
"će pokazati pored svakog od ovih vrijednosti koje možete koristiti za "
"postavljanje vrijednosti koje želite. Alternativno, možete kliknuti na "
"vrijednosti, postavite kursor na u koji želite da unesete koristeći strelice "
"i unesite vrijednost, ili možete dvaput kliknuti na vrijednosti da označite "
"i upišite preko cijele vrijednosti koji postoji. Ovi koraci moraju biti "
"završeni u svakoj kategoriji, naravno za svaku nutrijenata koje želite uzeti "
"u obzir."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2944
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It should be noted that you may omit providing a minimum value for a "
"nutrient, in which case the minimum value would remain as <quote>0</quote>. "
"However, if you provide a minimum value, you must provide a maximum because, "
"obviously, a maximum cannot be less than a minimum."
msgstr ""
"Treba napomenuti da možete izostaviti minimalnu khranljivu vrijednost, u "
"kojem slučaju minimalna vrijednost će ostati kao <quote>0</quote>. Međutim, "
"ako vam pružiti minimalnu vrijednost, morate pružiti maksimum, jer očito, "
"maksimalno ne može biti manja od minimalne."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2949
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At any point in the process of planning a menu/diet, you can click the "
"<guibutton>Clear</guibutton> button to clear all entries and begin again."
msgstr ""
"U svakom trenutku u procesu planiranja menija/dijete, možete kliknuti taster "
"<guibutton>Očisti</guibutton> da očistite sve stavke i počnete ponovo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2953
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have completed entering all the nutrient information, click the "
"<guibutton>Create the diet</guibutton> button to create your menu/diet."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste završili sa unosom svih informacija o hranljivim tvarima, "
"kliknite taster <guibutton>Napravite dijetu</guibutton> da napravite svoj "
"meni/dijetu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2970
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ingredient Matcher"
msgstr "Uparivač sastojaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2972
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of the <emphasis>Ingredient Matcher</emphasis> component is to "
"find recipes that you are able to make (or almost make) with ingredients "
"that you have on hand. To access the <emphasis>Ingredient Matcher</emphasis> "
"component, click on the <guibutton>Ingredient Matcher</guibutton> button "
"that is visible in the left frame of the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Svrha komponente <emphasis>Uparivač sastojaka</emphasis> je da pronađete "
"recepte koje (skoro da) možete da napravite sa sastojcima koje imate pri "
"ruci. Da pristupite komponenti <emphasis>Uparivač sastojaka</emphasis>, "
"kliknite na taster <guibutton>Uparivač sastojaka</guibutton> koji je vidljiv "
"u lijevom okviru <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2979
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the component starts, typical of all <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"components, the name will appear at the top of the window in the right "
"frame. Beneath this, beside the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> label, there is "
"a text box to <userinput> enter the recipe ingredient</userinput> that you "
"want to search for."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što se komponenta pokrene, tipično za sve <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> komponente, ime će se pojaviti na vrhu prozora u desnom okviru. "
"Ispod ovoga, pored oznake <guilabel>Pretraži:</guilabel>, nalazi se okvir za "
"tekst za <userinput>unos sastojka recepta</userinput> kojeg želite tražiti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:2987
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Ingredient Matcher component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Uparivač sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2996
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ingredient Matcher Component"
msgstr "Komponenta Uparivač sastojaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3001
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> box, under the heading "
"<guilabel>Ingredient</guilabel> there is a list of all the ingredients that "
"are in the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database, both ones provided by "
"default and those that you have entered by either adding them in the "
"<emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component or by entering them in a recipe, "
"which automatically adds the ingredient to the database. Elsewhere in this "
"document, further information is provided on the use of the <link linkend="
"\"ingredients-component\">Ingredients Component</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ispod okvira <guilabel>Search:</guilabel>, pod naslovom <guilabel>Sastojak</"
"guilabel> nalazi se lista svih sastojakakoji su u bazi podataka "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, oboje pod uslovom po standardu i one koje "
"ste unijeli bilo dodavanjem u komponentu <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> "
"ili  unošenjem u recept, koji automatski dodaje sastojak u bazu podataka. Na "
"drugom mjestu u ovom dokumentu, dodatne informacije se nalaze na korištenje "
"<link linkend=\"ingredients-component\">Komponenta sastojci</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3011
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step to finding a recipe for which you have the ingredients on "
"hand is to search for one or more ingredients. This can be done by entering "
"an ingredient name in the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> box above the "
"ingredient list or, by just scrolling through the list using the scrollbar "
"that is on the right of it and selecting ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak u pronalaženju recept za koje imate sastojke pri ruci je u "
"potrazi za jedan ili više sastojaka. To se može postići unosom sastojka u "
"<guilabel>Search:</guilabel> okvir iznad listu sastojaka ili, za samo "
"prelistavanja liste koristeći klizač koji se nalazi na desno od njega i "
"odabira sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3017
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is likely that the ingredients that you want to select will "
"<emphasis>not</emphasis> be adjacent to each other, but this is not a "
"problem. Simply click on the first ingredient that you want to use and then, "
"hold down the &Ctrl; key and click on the next ingredient. This will work "
"even if you are using the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> box to look for "
"ingredients. Just remember that after finding and selecting the first "
"ingredient and then, using the search box to locate the next (and any "
"subsequent) ingredient, you must hold down the &Ctrl; key before clicking on "
"the ingredient name. <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> dictates that at least "
"one of the selected ingredients be in each of the recipes listed in the "
"search results."
msgstr ""
"To je vjerojatno da sastojke koje želite da izaberete<emphasis>not</"
"emphasis> bice jedan pored drugog, ali ovo nije problem. Jednostavno "
"kliknite na prvi sastojak koji zelite na koristite i onda,držite pritisnuti "
"kljuc &Ctrl;  i kliknite  na naredni sastojak. Ovo ce raditi iako koristie "
"<guilabel>Pretrazivac:</guilabel> okvir za pregledanje sastojaka. Zapamtite "
"da nakon pronadjenog i izabranog sastojka, i onda koristenje okvira za "
"pretragu za pronalazak sljedeceg sastojka (and any subsequent), morate "
"držiti pritisnuti kljuc &Ctrl; prije klika na ime od sastojka. "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> uslovljava da ce barem jedan od odabranih "
"sastojaka bitiu svakom od recepata navedenih u rezultatima pretrage."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3028
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next step, is to transfer the selected ingredients to the list box that "
"appears to the right of your ingredient list. This is done by clicking on "
"the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-next.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> that appears "
"between the two lists. Ingredients can be transferred one at a time, or in "
"multiples as previously described. Your ingredients will be listed under the "
"heading <guilabel>Ingredient (required?)</guilabel>. If you would like to "
"search for recipes that contain a specific ingredient, you can select the "
"check box beside the ingredient name to indicate that it is a required "
"ingredient for any recipes returned in your search. Conversely, ingredients "
"can be transferred out of the right-hand list box by clicking on the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeci korak je, da prenese birane namirnice u okvir s popisom koji se "
"pojavljuje na desnoj strani vašeg listu sastojaka. Ovo se radi klikom na  "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-next.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>koji se "
"pojavljuje izmedju dvije liste. Sastojci se mogu prenijeti jedan po jedan, "
"ili u provedbi kako je prethodno opisano. Vasi sastojci ce biti "
"izlistani<guilabel>Ingredient (required?)</guilabel>. Ako biste željeli "
"potražiti recepte koji sadrže određeni sastojak,možete odabrati kućicu pored "
"sastojka koja ukazuje da je neophodan sastojak za bilo koji recept vratiti "
"se u svoju pretragu. Nasuprot tome, sastojci se mogu prenijeti iz desne "
"strane s popisom klikom na "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"go-previous.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> taster."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3042
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have transferred the ingredients to the listbox on the right, you "
"can enter an <guilabel>Amount Available</guilabel> in the column beneath "
"this heading. This is done by double-clicking on the space beside the "
"ingredient for which you want to enter an available amount. The "
"<interface>Enter amount - &krecipes;</interface> dialog box will appear in "
"which you can <userinput>enter an amount</userinput> in the text box below "
"the <guilabel>Amount</guilabel> label. Next, you can select the unit of "
"measure for the ingredient from the drop-down menu that appears beside the "
"<guilabel>Amount</guilabel> text box. Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"button to accept the amount entered, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
"button to close the dialog box. Of course, you don't have to enter an amount "
"if you know that you have enough of the ingredient for any recipe that might "
"be returned in your search."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste sastojke prenijeli na listbox na desno,mozete unijeti u "
"<guilabel>Amount Available</guilabel> kolonu ispod ovog naslova. To se radi "
"dvostrukim klikom na prostoru pored sastojak za koji želite da unesete "
"raspoloživi iznos.Okvir za dijalog <interface>Enter amount - &krecipes;</"
"interface>  će se pojaviti u kojem možete<userinput>unijeti iznos</"
"userinput> u okvir za teskt ispod <guilabel>Amount</guilabel> oznake. Zatim, "
"možete odabrati jedinica mjere za sastojak iz padajućeg menija koji se "
"pojavljuje pored okvira za tekst <guilabel>Amount</guilabel>. Kliknite na "
"taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> za prihvatanje unosa iznosa, ili "
"<guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> taster da zatovrite okvir za dijalog. "
"Naravno, ne morate unositi iznos ako znate koliko je potrebno sastojaka za "
"bilo koji recept prilikom pretrazivanja recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3056
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your right-hand ingredient list is fairly lengthy and you are looking for "
"an ingredient for which you <emphasis>might</emphasis> want to enter an "
"<guilabel>Amount Available</guilabel>, a <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> box "
"appears above this list as well. When you enter a search term in this box, "
"it will search only the ingredients that are in the right-hand list box."
msgstr ""
"Ako je vaš popis sastojaka desna ruka je prilično dug i tražite sastojak za "
"koju<emphasis>might</emphasis> zelite da unesete <guilabel>Amount Available</"
"guilabel>, a <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> okvir se pojavljuje iznad ove "
"liste. Kada unesete pojam za pretragu u ovoj kutiji, to će tražiti samo "
"sastojke koji se nalaze u desnom popisom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3063
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before the recipes containing the selected ingredients will display, you "
"must select the number of missing ingredients permitted in your recipes. "
"This is accomplished by using the spinbox beside the label <guilabel>Missing "
"ingredients allowed:</guilabel>. There will always be certain ingredients "
"that you have on hand, for example, <emphasis>salt</emphasis> or "
"<emphasis>sugar</emphasis>. One of the purposes of allowing missing "
"ingredients is to compensate for those ingredients that are normally in your "
"cupboard. It is for this reason that you might want to set the "
"<guilabel>Missing ingredients allowed:</guilabel> to a reasonably high "
"number. Or, if the number of missing ingredients shows as <emphasis>0</"
"emphasis>, you can click on the text box beside the <guilabel>Missing "
"ingredients allowed:</guilabel> label to activate it and then, press the "
"<keycap>&#8595;</keycap> directional arrow which will cause <emphasis>Any</"
"emphasis> to appear in the text box, indicating that any number of missing "
"ingredients are permitted."
msgstr ""
"Prije nego odaberete recepte koji sadrže sastojke na ekranu će se prikazati, "
"morate odabrati broja nedostajućih sastojaka dozvoljenih u vašem receptu. "
"Ovo se postiže pomoću spinbox pored oznake <guilabel>Sastojci koji su "
"dozvoljeni za nedostajanje:</guilabel>. Uvijek će bice određenih sastojaka "
"koji imate pri ruci,na primjer, <emphasis>so</emphasis> ili <emphasis>šećer</"
"emphasis>.Jedan od ciljeva jeste da omogućava nedostaje sastojaka i kao "
"nadoknada za one sastojke koji su normalno u vašem ormaru. To je razlog "
"zasto zelite da postavite <guilabel>Nedosatjuci sastojci koji su dozvoljeni:"
"</guilabel> u normalnim granicama dozvole. Ili,ako se broj nestalih "
"sastojaka prikazuje kao <emphasis>0</emphasis>, mozete kliknuti na okvir za "
"tekst ispod <guilabel>Nedosatjuci sastojci koji su dozvoljeni:</guilabel> "
"oznake da je aktivirate i onda pritisnite <keycap>&#8595;</keycap> strelicu "
"smjera koja će dovesti do <emphasis>Any</emphasis> pojave okvir aza tekst, "
"ukazujuci na to da bilo koji broj nedostajucih sastojaka su dozvoljeni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3079
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting the missing ingredients too high will result in a longer list of "
"recipes. Setting the missing ingredients too low will result in either no "
"recipes being found, or cause the search to exclude recipes that you might "
"also be able to make had you allowed for slightly more missing ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje nedostajućih sastojaka previsoku što će rezultirati duži popis "
"recepata. Postavljanje nedostajućih sastojaka je preniska što će rezultirati "
"ili ne receptima se naći, ili uzrokovati pretrage da se isključe receptima, "
"koje vam također mogu biti u mogućnosti da vas je dozvoljeno za nešto više "
"nedostaju sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3085
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Find matching recipes</guibutton> button to display the "
"search results in the area beneath the phrase <emphasis>Possible recipes "
"with the specified ingredients</emphasis>. The recipe title will appear "
"under the heading <guilabel>Title</guilabel>. The recipe id will appear "
"under the heading <guilabel>Id</guilabel> and the missing ingredients will "
"display under the heading <guilabel>Missing ingredients</guilabel>. The "
"width of the columns that apply to each of these headings can be adjusted "
"for viewing purposes. When your recipes are listed, they are grouped "
"according to the number of missing ingredients and for each group, prior to "
"listing the recipes, the number of missing ingredients is specified."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na taster <guibutton>Pronađi odgovarajuce recepti</guibutton> za "
"prikaz slike rezultata u oblasti pod izrazom <emphasis>Mogući recepti sa "
"navedenim sastojcima</emphasis>. Naslov recept će se pojaviti pod naslovom "
"<guilabel>Naslov</guilabel>. Naslov recept će se pojaviti pod naslovom "
"<guilabel>Id</guilabel> i neodstajuci sastojcice s eprikazati ispod "
"<guilabel>Sastojci koji nedostaju</guilabel>. Širina kolone koja se odnosi "
"na svaki od ovih proizvoda može se podesiti u svrhu gledanja. Kada je vas "
"recept prikazan, grupišu se prema broju nedostajucih sastojaka i za svaku "
"grupu, prije liste recepata , broj nestalih sastojaka je naveden."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3097
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your search does not provide recipes that are of interest, you can adjust "
"the number of missing ingredients and click the <guibutton>Find matching "
"recipes</guibutton> button to display new results based on the ingredients "
"selected. Alternatively, you can press the <guibutton>Clear recipe list</"
"guibutton> button to clear the recipe list to perform a whole new search "
"with different ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Ako vaš pretrage ne daju receptima koji su od interesa, možete podesiti broj "
"nestalih sastojaka i kliknite na taster <guibutton>Find matching recipes</"
"guibutton> za prikaz novih rezultata na temelju sastojaka odabranih. "
"Alternativno, možete pritisnuti tastert <guibutton>Clear recipe list</"
"guibutton> za brisanje liste recepta za obavljanje potpuno nove pretrage s "
"različitim sastojcima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> makes it easy for you to find a recipe that "
"you can make with ingredients on hand. However, if you do have to run to the "
"store, once you decide on the recipe that you want to make, you can use the "
"<link linkend=\"shopping-list\">The Shopping List</link> to make your "
"shopping list."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> olakšava vam da pronađete recept koji možete "
"napraviti sa sastojcima koje imate pri ruci. Međutim, ako ne moraju "
"pokrenuti u radnju, kada se odlučite na recept koji želite da, možete "
"koristiti <link linkend=\"shopping-list\">Listu za kupovinu</link> kako bi "
"vaš popis za kupovinu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3113
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Data Button"
msgstr "Taster Podaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Data</guibutton> button performs one simple function &ndash; "
"when clicked, it gives access to additional components."
msgstr ""
"Taster <guibutton>Podaci</guibutton> obavlja jednu jednostavnu funkciju "
"&ndash; kada se klikne, daje pristup dodatnim komponentama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the additional components are revealed, click the <guibutton>Up</"
"guibutton> button to return to the previous list."
msgstr ""
"Kada se dodatne komponente otkriju, kliknite taster <guibutton>Gore</"
"guibutton> za povratak na prethodnu listu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The Ingredients Component</title>"
msgstr "<title>Komponenta Sastojci</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component is accessed by first, "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Data</guibutton> button to reveal the additional "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> components, and then, clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Ingredients</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Komponenti <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis> se pristupa prvo klikom na taster "
"<guibutton>Podaci</guibutton> za otkrivanje dodatnih <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> komponenti, pa onda klikom na tasterom <guibutton>Sastojci</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component opens, the component "
"title will be seen at the top. Below the heading <guilabel>Ingredient list</"
"guilabel>, there is a list of ingredients contained in the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> database is shown. This list includes "
"ingredients that have be provided as defaults in the program and also, "
"ingredients that you have added."
msgstr ""
"Kada <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>  komponenta otvara, naslov komponenta će "
"se vidjeti na vrhu. Ispod naslova <guilabel>Lista sastojaka</guilabel>, "
"postoji popis sastojaka sadržanih u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"prikazani u bazi podatka. Ova lista uključuje sastojke koji se daje kao "
"zadane u programu i, sastojke koji ste dodali."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beside the heading is a text box to <userinput>enter an ingredient</"
"userinput> to search for in the ingredient list."
msgstr ""
"Pored naslova je okvir za tekst za <userinput>unos sastojka</userinput> za "
"traženje u listi sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the right of this component is a <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></"
"imageobject> </inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button, for adding ingredients "
"to the list, and a <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"list-remove.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button, for removing ingredients. See the "
"section on <link linkend=\"working-ingredients\">Working with Ingredients</"
"link> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Desno od ove komponente <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"list-add.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button, dodavajuci sastojke na listu, i tipka "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> za "
"uklanjanje sastojaka. Vidi poglavlje o <link linkend=\"working-ingredients"
"\">Rad sa sastojcima</link> za više detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the list there is a button labeled <guilabel>Property Information</"
"guilabel> to edit the property information for the selected ingredient."
msgstr ""
"Ispod liste se nalazi taster sa oznakom <guilabel>Informacije osobine</"
"guilabel> za izmjenu informacija osobine izabranog sastojka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Ingredients component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Sastojci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Ingredients Component</para>"
msgstr "<para>Komponenta Sastojci</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing the ingredient properties"
msgstr "Izmjena osobina sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select an ingredient from the list and you click the "
"<guilabel>Property Information</guilabel> a new dialog to edit the "
"properties of the selected ingredient will be shown. A label with the text "
"<guilabel>Property information for ...</guilabel> will be displayed on top, "
"below this text there are 3 lists:"
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberete sastojak sa liste i kliknete na <guilabel>Svojstvene "
"informacije</guilabel> anovi dijalog za uređivanje svojstava odabranih "
"sastojaka će biti prikazan. A oznaka sa tekstom <guilabel>Svojstvene "
"informacije za ...</guilabel> će biti prikazan na vrhu, ispod ovog teksta se "
"nalaze 3 liste:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"USDA ingredient list: Below the <guilabel>Property information for...</"
"guilabel> label, the list of ingredients in the USDA database is shown. "
"Beside the <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> label there is a text box to search "
"in the USDA Database. Below to the list there is a <guibutton>Load</"
"guibutton> button to load the data for the given ingredient from the USDA "
"database to your personal database."
msgstr ""
"USDA lista sastojaka: ispod oznake <guilabel>Svojstvene informacije za...</"
"guilabel>, prikazan je popis sastojaka u USDA bazi podataka. Pored oznake "
"<guilabel>Pretraživanje:</guilabel> postoji okvir za tekst za pretraživanje "
"u USDA baze podataka. Dolje na liste nalazi se tipka <guibutton>Učitaj</"
"guibutton> za učitavanje podataka za dati sastojak iz USDA baze podataka na "
"svoj lični baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredient properties list: This list contains the nutrient values of each "
"ingredient."
msgstr ""
"Lista osobina sastojka: Ova lista sadrži vrijednosti hranljivih tvari svakog "
"sastojka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this list, the name of the nutrient is shown under the heading "
"<guilabel>Property</guilabel>, the amount of the nutrient present in the "
"ingredient is shown under the heading <guilabel>Amount</guilabel> and the "
"measurement value for the nutrient is shown under the heading "
"<guilabel>Units</guilabel>. For example, if the ingredient <emphasis>orange "
"juice</emphasis> has been selected, one of the nutrients displayed will be "
"<emphasis>Vitamin C</emphasis>. Under the <guilabel>Units</guilabel> "
"heading, <emphasis>mg/g</emphasis> will display, which means that there are "
"the number of milligrams shown under the amount (in this case, 0.5) per gram "
"of the ingredient."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj listi, ime hranjivih tvari je prikazan pod naslovom "
"<guilabel>Property</guilabel>, iznos nutrijenata prisutnih u sastojak je "
"prikazan pod naslovom <guilabel>količina</guilabel> i vrijednost mjerenja za "
"nutrijentima je prikazan pod naslovom <guilabel>Jedinice</guilabel>. Na "
"primjer, iako sastojak <emphasis>sok od narandze</emphasis> je selektovan, "
"jedan od hraljivih tvari se izlista <emphasis>Vitamin C</emphasis>. Pod "
"naslovom<guilabel>Jedinice</guilabel> , <emphasis>mg/g</emphasis> će se "
"prikazati, što znači da su broj miligrama prikazani ispod iznosa (u ovom "
"slučaju, 0.5) po gramu od sastojaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Above this list there is an <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button, for adding "
"ingredient properties to the list, and a <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>, "
"button for removing properties, see the section on <link linkend="
"\"ingredient-properties\">Properties in Ingredients</link> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Iznad ove liste nalazi se tipka <guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton>, za dodavanje "
"svojstva sastojka na listu, a tipka <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton>, za "
"uklanjanje svojstva, pogledajte poglavlje o <link linkend=\"ingredient-"
"properties\">Svojstva sastojaka</link> za više detalja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredient weights lists: Below the <guilabel>Load</guilabel> button and "
"beside the ingredient properties list is the ingredient weights list. This "
"list, in combination with your unit conversions, is what helps provide "
"accurate nutrient information for your recipes. See the section, <link "
"linkend=\"set-equivalents\">Completing Your Conversion Tables</link> for "
"help with doing your unit conversions."
msgstr ""
"Sastojci liste težine: ispod tipke <guilabel>Učitaj</guilabel> i pored liste "
"sastojaka popis svojstava sastojaka težine. Ova lista, u kombinaciji sa "
"svojim konverzije jedinici, je ono što pomaže pružiti precizne informacije o "
"hrnjivosti za recepte. Pogledaj poglavlje, <link linkend=\"set-equivalents"
"\">Završetak vaše tabele konverzije</link> za pomoć sa radnjama konverzije "
"jedinica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this list, under the heading <guilabel>Weight</guilabel>, the weight of "
"the ingredient is shown. Under the heading <guilabel>Per Amount</guilabel>, "
"the unit to which the weight applies is shown. Using the orange juice "
"example, the ingredient weight table shows that the weight of orange juice "
"is 248 grams per cup of orange juice, or 31 grams per fluid ounce of orange "
"juice."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj listi, pod naslovom <guilabel>Weight</guilabel>, težina sastojka je "
"prikazan. pod naslovom <guilabel>Per Amount</guilabel>, je prikazan jedinice "
"na koje se odnosi na težinu. Koristeći primjer sok naranče, sastojak težina "
"tabela pokazuje da težina soka od naranče je 248 grama po šalicu sok od "
"naranče, ili 31 grama po tečnosti soka od naranče."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with the ingredient properties list, above the ingredient weights list, "
"an <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button is available for adding ingredient "
"weights and a <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> button is available for removing "
"ingredient weights. See the section <link linkend=\"ingredient-weights"
"\">Working with Ingredient Weights</link> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Kao i kod popisa  svojstava sastojaka, iznad liste težine sastojaka, "
"<guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> taster je dostupan za dodavanje težine "
"hranjivih tvari i <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> dugme je dostupno za "
"uklanjanje težine sastojaka  Vidite poglavlje <link linkend=\"ingredient-"
"weights\">Rad s težinama sastojaka</link> za vise informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For those ingredients provided by default in the program, the USDA data has "
"been loaded and this is what provides the nutrient values (or "
"<quote>Properties</quote>) for each ingredient. The associated weights have "
"also been loaded. However, if you have added an ingredient to the list, in "
"order to display the nutrient value and the weight information for the "
"ingredient, the USDA data must be loaded by clicking on the <guibutton> "
"Load</guibutton> button that appears below the USDA ingredient list."
msgstr ""
"Za one sastojke koje su podrazumijevano u programu, podaci USDA je učitan i "
"to je ono što daje vrijednosti hranjivih tvari(ili <quote>Svojstva</quote>) "
"za svaki sastojak. Pridružene težine su također učitane. Međutim, ako ste "
"dodali sastojak na listu, kako bi se prikazali vrijednost nutrijenata i "
"informacije težine za sastojak, USDA baza podataka mora biti učitana klikom "
"na taster <guibutton> Load</guibutton> koje se nalazi ispod USDA liste "
"sastojaka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the dialog to edit the ingredient properties."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana dijaloga za izmjenu osobina sastojka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3259
#, no-c-format
msgid "The dialog to edit the ingredient properties."
msgstr "Dijalog za izmjenu osobina sastojka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3267
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ingredient Headers"
msgstr "Zaglavlja sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component is accessed, you will "
"also notice a <guilabel>Headers</guilabel> tab. If this tab is accessed, the "
"headers that apply to your recipes may be added, removed or renamed."
msgstr ""
"Kada <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis> komponenta se pristupa, takožer ćete "
"primjetiti karticu <guilabel>zaglavlje</guilabel>. Ako se pristupa ovoj "
"kartici, može se dodati zaglavlja koja se odnose na vaše receptime, ukloniti "
"ili preimenovati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Similar to other <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> components, there is a text "
"box beside a <guilabel>Search:</guilabel> label where you can enter the name "
"of the header for which you want to search, should your list be long enough "
"that this would be the best method to access a particular header."
msgstr ""
"Slično kao <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> komponente, postoj tekst pored "
"oznake <guilabel>Pretraživanje:</guilabel> možete unijeti naziv zaglavlja za "
"koje želite da tražite, treba napraviti svoju listu biti dovoljno dugu da bi "
"to bio najbolji način za pristup određenoj mreži protivnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the right side of the <emphasis>Headers</emphasis> window, there is a "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button, which "
"when clicked, will bring up a dialog box which will permit the entry of a "
"new header. To add the header, simply type in the name that you desire in "
"the text box that appears beneath the <guilabel>Header</guilabel> label. "
"Click the <guibutton> OK</guibutton> button to proceed with the addition or, "
"the <guibutton> Cancel</guibutton> button to clear the dialog box and return "
"to the main header interface."
msgstr ""
"Na desnoj strani prozora <emphasis>Headers</emphasis>, nalazi se taster "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> , koji kada "
"kliknete, prikazaće dijaloški okvir koji omogućiti ulazak novog zaglavlja. "
"Za dodavanje zaglavnlja, jednostavno ukucajte ime koje želite da se pojavi u "
"okvir za tekst koji je ispod oznake <guilabel>Header</guilabel>. Kliknite "
"taster <guibutton> OK</guibutton> da nastavi sa dodavanjem ili, taster "
"<guibutton> Otkazi</guibutton> da ocistie okvir za dijalog i  vratite se na "
"a glavno zaglavlje interfejsa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a header, select it in the header list and click the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button. If this "
"header is utilized in any of your recipes, a dialog box will appear stating "
"<quote>Warning: The following will have to be removed also, since currently "
"they use the element you have chosen to be removed.</quote>. To remove the "
"header, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. The header will be "
"removed from the list. Note, however, that in your recipe(s) that contain "
"the particular header that you have chosen to remove, only the header will "
"be absent. The ingredients that were part of the removed header will still "
"be intact. To cancel the removal of the header, click the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button. The dialog box will disappear and you will be returned to "
"your header list. Of course, if the header does not exist in any of your "
"recipes, it will be removed with no prompt."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uklonili zaglavlje, izaberite u zaglavlju listu i kliknite taster "
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> Ako se "
"ovo zaglavlje koristi u bilo kojem od vaše recepte, dijalog će se pojaviti "
"navodeći <quote>Upozorenje: Sljedeći će se morati ukloniti , budući da "
"trenutno koriste element koji ste izabrali da se ukloni.</quote>. Da "
"uklonite zaglavlje,kliknite na taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> . Zaglavlje "
"ce se pomjeriti iz liste. Napomena, međutim, u vašem recept u(ima)) koje "
"sadrže posebno zaglavlje koje ste izabrali da uklonite, samo zaglavlje će "
"biti odsutno.Sastojci koji su bili dijelom uklonjeni zaglavlje će i dalje "
"biti netaknuto. Da biste otkazali uklanjanje zaglavlja, kliknite na taster "
"<guibutton>Otkazi</guibutton>. Okvir za dijalog će nestati, a vi ćete se "
"vratiti u svoju listu zaglavlja. Naravno,ako zaglavlje ne postoji u bilo "
"kojem vasem receptu, to će biti uklonjeno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To rename a header, simply select the header that you want to edit. With the "
"header selected, right clicking will result in the appearance of a menu from "
"which you can select <emphasis>Rename</emphasis>. A box will outline the "
"selected header and a cursor will appear at the beginning of the header "
"name. Using the arrow keys, position the cursor at the point where you wish "
"to make your edit, or if you wish to completely rename the header, simply "
"type the new name. Pressing the &Enter; key will complete the renaming "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Da preiimeujete zaglavlje, jednosatavno selektujte zaglavlje koje zelite da "
"izmijenite. Sa izabranim zaglavljem, desnim klikom biće rezultirati u meniju "
"iz kojeg možete izabrati<emphasis>Rename</emphasis>.A kutija će naglašavati "
"odabrana zaglavlja i kursor će se pojaviti na početku imena zaglavlja. "
"Pomoću tipki sa strelicama, postavite kursor na mjestu gdje želite vasu "
"izmjenu , ili ako želite da u potpunosti preimenovati zaglavlja, jednostavno "
"upišite novo ime. Pritisnite kljuc &Enter; koji će završiti proces "
"preimenovanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a header is selected and the menu is access by right-clicking, in "
"addition to a menu item for <guimenuitem>Rename</guimenuitem>, there are "
"menu items for <guimenuitem>Create</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Delete</"
"guimenuitem>. This alternative method can be used to add and remove headers "
"and will react in the same manner as outlined above. Additionally, each of "
"the menu items has a key or key combination that can be used to carry out "
"the desired action while in the <guilabel>Headers</guilabel> tab. These are: "
"&mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Kada je zaglavlje izabrano i pristup meniju desnim klikom, pored stavke "
"izbornika za <guimenuitem>Perimenovanje</guimenuitem>, nalaze se stavke "
"izbornika za <guimenuitem>Kreiranje</guimenuitem> i<guimenuitem>Brisanje</"
"guimenuitem>. Ova alternativna metoda može biti korištena za dodavanje i "
"preimenovanje zaglavlja i reagovaće na isti nacin kao sto je gore navedeno. "
"Pored toga, svaki od stavki izbornika ima taster ili tastersku kombinaciju "
"koja se može koristiti za obavljanje željene akcije, dok je u kartici "
"<guilabel>Zaglavlje</guilabel> . Ovo su: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> to "
"create a header"
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> za "
"pravljenje zaglavlja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3324
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keycap>Del</keycap> to delete a header"
msgstr "<keycap>Del</keycap> za brisanje zaglavlja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> to rename a "
"header"
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> za promjenu "
"imena zaglavlja"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Ingredients"
msgstr "Rad sa sastojcima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ingredients may be added, removed or edited in the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component."
msgstr ""
"Sastojci se mogu dodavati, uklanjati ili mijenjati u <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> komponenti <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3338
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding:"
msgstr "Dodavanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add an ingredient to the list, click on the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" format="
"\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button that appears "
"beside the ingredient list. A window will be presented where <userinput>the "
"name of the new ingredient</userinput> can be typed in the text box beneath "
"the heading <guilabel>New Ingredient</guilabel>. Once the name has been "
"added, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to complete the addition "
"and close the window. The ingredient will now appear in the ingredient list. "
"If you do not wish to add the ingredient to the list, click the <guibutton> "
"Cancel</guibutton> button to close the window and return to the previous "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Za dodavanje sastojaka, kliknite na taster <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-add.png\" format="
"\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>  koji se pojavljuje "
"pored liste sastojaka. Prozor će biti predstavljena gdje <userinput>ime "
"novog sastojka</userinput> moze biti upisano u okvir za tekst zaglavlja "
"<guilabel>New Ingredient</guilabel>. Ime da bi bilo dodato jednom, kliknite "
"na taster<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da završi i zatvari prozora. Sastojci ce "
"se sada pojaviti u listi sastojaka. Ako ne zelite da dodate sastojke u "
"listu, kliknite na taster <guibutton> Cancel</guibutton>da zatovrite prozor "
"i vratite se na prethoni ekran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing:"
msgstr "Uklanjanje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove an ingredient from the list, click on the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> button that "
"appears beside the ingredient list. The ingredient will be removed "
"<emphasis>provided there are no recipes using that ingredient</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uklonili sastojak s popisa, kliknite na tipku "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"list-remove.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> koji se "
"pojaljuje pored liste sastojaka. Sastojak će biti uklonjen <emphasis>koji ne "
"postoje recepti koji koriste taj sastojak</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If recipes exist that use the ingredient, a window will display with the "
"prompt <emphasis>The following elements will have to be removed also, since "
"currently they use the element you have chosen to be removed.</emphasis> "
"Below the prompt, under the heading <guilabel>Recipes</guilabel>, a list of "
"recipes that use that ingredient will display. Click the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button to proceed with the removal of the ingredient AND recipe"
"(s), or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> to close the window and return to "
"the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Ako postoje recepti koji koriste sastojak, prozor će se prikazati s porukom "
"<emphasis>Sljedeći elementi će morati biti uklonjeni , budući da trenutno "
"koriste element ste izabrali da se ukloni.</emphasis> Ispod poruke, pod "
"naslovom <guilabel>Recepti</guilabel>, je lista recepata koja koristi taj "
"sastojak će biti prikazana. Kliknite na taster <guibutton>U redu</"
"guibutton>da nastavite sa uklanjanjem sastojaka I recepata, ili  "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da zatvorite prozor i vratite se na prethodni "
"ekran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing:"
msgstr "Izmjena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An ingredient may be edited by selecting the ingredient in the list and "
"double-clicking on it. The ingredient will remain highlighted, but if either "
"the <keycap>&#8593;</keycap> or <keycap>&#8595;</keycap> directional arrows "
"is pressed, the cursor can be positioned to the point you wish to edit. If "
"you wish to rename the entire ingredient, for example from <quote>butter</"
"quote> to <quote>BUTTER</quote>, simply push <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> with the ingredient highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Sastojak se može uređivati odabirom sastojak na listi i dvostrukim klikom na "
"njega. Sastojak će ostati označen, ali ako <keycap>&#8593;</keycap> or "
"<keycap>&#8595;</keycap>  usmjeravanje strelice pritisnu, kursor može biti "
"postavljen na stvar koju želite urediti. Ako zelite preimenovati sastojak, "
"na primjer iz <quote>maslac</quote> u <quote>MASLAC</quote>, jednostavno "
"pritisnite <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> sa "
"označenim sastojkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to rename an ingredient and another ingredient exists with the "
"name chosen, an alert box will appear with the prompt <emphasis>This "
"ingredient already exists. Continuing will merge these two ingredients into "
"one. Are you sure?</emphasis> Click the <guibutton>Continue</guibutton> "
"button to proceed with renaming the ingredient, or the <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> button to abort."
msgstr ""
"Ako se odlučite da preimenovati sastojak ili drugi sastojak postoji sa "
"izabranim imenom, upozorenje će se pojaviti saporukom <emphasis>Ovaj "
"sastojak već postoji. Nastavak će se spojiti ova dva sastojka u jedan. Jeste "
"li sigurni?</emphasis> Klikom na tipku <guibutton>Nastavi</guibutton> da "
"nastavi preimenovanje sastojka, ili tipku <guibutton>Odustani</guibutton> za "
"prekid."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have two ingredients, one named <quote>cinnamon</quote> and the other "
"named <quote>Cinnamon</quote> and you would like all recipes to show the "
"ingredient as <quote>Cinnamon</quote>, first check which of the ingredients "
"lists the properties &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> the nutrient values. If "
"the nutrient values show for the ingredient <quote>cinnamon</quote>, "
"renaming <quote>cinnamon</quote> to <quote>Cinnamon</quote> will result in a "
"loss of the properties for that ingredient and they will have to be reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate dva sastojka, jedan se zove <quote>cimet</quote>a drugi "
"<quote>Cimet</quote> i zelite da se prikazu svi recepti sa <quote>Cimet</"
"quote>, prvo provjerite koji se od sastojaka nabraja svojstva&ndash; "
"<abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> valutu hranjivih tvari. Ako valutu hranjivih tvari "
"pokazete za sastojke<quote>cimet</quote>, preimenovanje<quote>cimet</quote>u "
"<quote>Cimet</quote> će rezultirati gubitkom svojstava sastojak za to i oni "
"će morati da se učitavaju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, if you rename <quote>Cinnamon</quote> to <quote>cinnamon</quote> "
"and then after the two ingredients have been merged, the single ingredient "
"<quote>cinnamon</quote> to <quote>Cinnamon</quote>, your nutrient values "
"will be retained."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, ako preimenujete  <quote>Cimet</quote> u <quote>cimet</quote> i "
"zatim nakon što su spojili dva sastojka u jedan sastojak <quote>cimet</"
"quote> na <quote>Cimet</quote>, vaša hranljiva vrijednost će biti zadržana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3402
#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternatively:"
msgstr "Alternativno:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An alternative method to either add, remove, or edit an ingredient is to "
"first, select the ingredient and then, right-click to display a menu from "
"which you can select <guimenuitem>Create</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Delete</"
"guimenuitem>, or <guimenuitem>Rename</guimenuitem>. Each choice performs as "
"explained in the previous sections."
msgstr ""
"Alternativna metoda za dodavanje, uklanjanje ili uređivanje sastojaka je da "
"prvo, odaberite sastojak, a zatim, desni klik da biste prikazali izbornik iz "
"kojeg možete odabrati  <guimenuitem>Kreiraj</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Obriši</guimenuitem>, ili <guimenuitem>preimenuj</guimenuitem>. "
"Svaki izbor nastupa kao što je objašnjeno u prethodnim dijelovima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For quick functionality, the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</"
"keycap></keycombo> key combination can be used to <emphasis>Create</"
"emphasis> a new ingredient. To <emphasis>Delete</emphasis> an ingredient, "
"press the <keycap>Del</keycap> key on the keyboard &ndash; a prompt will be "
"received if the ingredient is used by a recipe. The key combination "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> can be used "
"to <emphasis>Rename</emphasis> an ingredient."
msgstr ""
"Za bržu funkcionalnost, na kombinaciji tipki <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>  možete koristiti za "
"<emphasis>Kreiranje</emphasis> novih sastojaka. Za <emphasis>Brisanje</"
"emphasis> sastojaka ptitisnite <keycap>Del</keycap> tipku na tastaturi "
"&ndash; brzo će biti primljena ako sastojak koristi recept. Kombinacija "
"tipki <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> se može "
"koristiti za <emphasis>Preimenovanje</emphasis> sastojka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3421
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units in Ingredients"
msgstr "Mjere u sastojcima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section describes how to work with the units of measure, or "
"<emphasis>Units</emphasis>, that apply to specific ingredients in the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component. "
"For details on working with ingredients globally, see the section <link "
"linkend=\"units-component\">The Units Component</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje opisuje rad sa jedinicama mjere, ili <emphasis>Mjere</"
"emphasis>, koje se odnose na određene sastojke u <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> komponenti <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>. Za detalje o globalnom "
"radu sa sastojcima, pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"units-component"
"\">Komponenta Mjere</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3428
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Within the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component, select an ingredient. "
"In the <interface>Unit list</interface> portion of the screen, the units of "
"measure that are associated with that ingredient will display."
msgstr ""
"Unutar komponente <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>, izaberite sastojak. U "
"dijelu ekrana <interface>Lista mjera</interface> će se prikazati jedinice "
"mjere koje su u vezi sa tim sastojkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Units can be added by clicking on the <guibutton>+</guibutton> button that "
"appears to the right of the <emphasis>Unit list</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Mjere se mogu dodati klikom na taster <guibutton>+</guibutton> koji se "
"nalazi desno od <emphasis>Liste mjera</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, one of the pre-loaded ingredients in the ingredients list is "
"<quote>apple juice</quote>. By default, the units associated with this "
"ingredient are <quote>gram</quote> and <quote>milligram</quote>. If apple "
"juice is a required ingredient in a recipe, it is more likely that it will "
"be measured by cup, or portion thereof. Therefore, it may be desired that "
"<quote>cup</quote> be added to the <emphasis>Unit list</emphasis>. To do "
"this, click on the <guibutton>+</guibutton> button that is beside the "
"<emphasis>Unit list</emphasis>. The <interface>Choose Unit</interface> "
"window will appear, from which you can select <emphasis>cup</emphasis>, for "
"example, from the list. Then, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to "
"add the unit, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the "
"window and return to the previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, jedan od unapred učitanih sastojaka na listi sastojaka<quote>sok "
"od jabuke</quote>.Po defaultu, jedinice su povezane s ovim "
"sastojkom<quote>gram</quote> i <quote>milligram</quote>. Ako je sok od "
"jabuke neophodan sastojak u receptu, to je više vjerojatno da će se mjeriti "
"u kupu, ili dio istoga. Stoga, može se željeni da <quote>kup</quote> bude "
"dodat u <emphasis>lista Jedinica</emphasis>. Da uradite ovo, kliknite na "
"taster <guibutton>+</guibutton> koji je pored <emphasis>Unit lista Jedinica</"
"emphasis>. Prozor <interface>Choose Unit</interface> ce se pojaviti, iz "
"kojeg mozete izabrati <emphasis>kup</emphasis>, na primjer, iz liste. Onda, "
"kliknite na taster<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da dodate jedinicu, ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkazi</guibutton> da zatovrite prozor i vratite se na prethodni "
"ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3448
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Units can be removed by clicking on the <guibutton>-</guibutton> button that "
"appears to the right of the <emphasis>Unit list</emphasis>. In a manner "
"similar to that described in the <emphasis>Working with Ingredients</"
"emphasis> section under the heading <link linkend=\"remove-ingredients"
"\">Removing:</link>, if an attempt is made to remove a unit that is "
"associated with an ingredient used by a recipe in the database, a prompt "
"will be displayed that permits confirmation of removal of the unit AND the "
"recipe that is associated with the ingredient unit, or that will allow the "
"cancellation of the action."
msgstr ""
"Jedinice mogu biti izmijenjene klikom na taster <guibutton>-</guibutton> "
"koji se pojavljuje desno od <emphasis>Lista Jedinica</emphasis>. Na slican "
"nacin onog sto je opisano <emphasis>Rad sa Sastojcima</emphasis> poglavljem "
"ispod zaglavlja <link linkend=\"remove-ingredients\">Removing:</link>,ako je "
"pokušaj napravljen za uklanjanje jedinice koja je povezana sa sastojkom "
"recepta koji se koristi u bazi podataka, biće  prikazana kao ona koja "
"dozvoljava potvrdu uklanjanja jedinice i recept koji je povezan sa sastojkom "
"jedinice, odnosno da dozvoli otkazivanje akcije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3460
#, no-c-format
msgid "Properties in Ingredients"
msgstr "Osobine u sastojcima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As previously stated, for those ingredients that are provided by default in "
"the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program, the <emphasis>Properties</"
"emphasis> or nutrient values have been pre-loaded with the USDA values."
msgstr ""
"Kao što je ranije navedeno, za one sastojke koji su ponuđeni po defaultu u "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> programu, <emphasis>osobine</emphasis> ili "
"hranljive vrijednosti su unaprijed učitane sa USDA vrijednostima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3467
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, if a property has been added in the <emphasis>Properties</emphasis> "
"component, a second step must be completed in the <emphasis>Ingredients</"
"emphasis> component to add the <emphasis>Property</emphasis> and its "
"associated value to the list."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, ako je osobina dodana u komponenti <emphasis>Osobine</emphasis>, "
"drugi korak se mora završiti u komponenti <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis> da "
"dodate <emphasis>osobinu</emphasis> i njenu povezanu vrijednost u listu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3473
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Ingredient Properties"
msgstr "Dodavanje osobina sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3475
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step to adding a new property for an ingredient is to ensure that "
"the appropriate unit is listed in the <emphasis>Unit list</emphasis> in the "
"top right-hand corner of the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component. If "
"the unit is not listed &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> the unit specified when "
"the property was added, for instance <quote>gram</quote>, it must be added "
"in the manner described in the section <link linkend=\"ingredient-units"
"\">Units in Ingredients</link>."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak ka dodavanjem nove osobine za sastojak potrebno je osigurati da "
"odgovarajuće jedinica navedena u <emphasis>Listi jedinica</emphasis> u "
"gornjem desnom uglu komponente <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis>. Ukoliko se "
"jedinica ne nalazi u listi &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> jedinici je dato "
"jedinstveno svojstveno ime, na primjer <quote>gram</quote>, mora se dodati "
"način opisan u poglevlju <link linkend=\"ingredient-units\">Jedinice u "
"sastojcima</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assuming that the appropriate unit is listed in the <emphasis>Unit list</"
"emphasis>, to add the new property to the <emphasis>Ingredient Properties</"
"emphasis> list, select an ingredient in the <emphasis>Ingredient</emphasis> "
"list then, click the <guibutton>+</guibutton> button that appears to the "
"right of the properties list."
msgstr ""
"Pod pretpostavkom da je odgovarajuća mjera navedena u <emphasis>listi mjera</"
"emphasis>, da dodate novu osobinu u listu <emphasis>osobina sastojka</"
"emphasis>, izaberite sastojak u listi <emphasis>sastojaka</emphasis> onda, "
"kliknite na taster <guibutton>+</guibutton> koji se pojavljuje desno od "
"liste osobina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Choose Property</quote> box will appear, from which you can "
"select the property to be added for the ingredient. A drop-down menu shows "
"below the property list, from which the unit associated with the property "
"must be selected. Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to proceed, or "
"the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the addition of the "
"property and close the window."
msgstr ""
"Pojavit će se okvir <quote>Izaberi osobinu</quote>, iz kojeg možete izabrati "
"osobinu za dodavanje sastojku. Padajući meni se prikazuje ispod liste "
"osobina, iz kojeg se mjera koja je u vezi sa osobinom mora izabrati. "
"Kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da nastavite, ili taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da otkažete dodavanje osobine i zatvorite "
"prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to proceed with the addition, the property will be added to "
"the <emphasis>Ingredient Properties</emphasis> list. However, you will note "
"that it has a <quote>0</quote> value. This value must by supplied by you. To "
"add the value, click on the property and increment the value using the spin-"
"box that appears, or manually type the value. Once the value is entered, "
"click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button that appears beside the spin-box."
msgstr ""
"Ako se odlučite da nastavite sa dodatkom, imovina će biti dodana u listu "
"<emphasis>Svojstva sastojaka</emphasis> . Međutim, imajte na umu da ćete ga "
"ima u vrijesnosti <quote>0</quote>. Ova vrijednost mora od koje ste nam "
"dostavili. Da biste dodali vrijednost, kliknite na imovinu i povećava "
"vrijednost pomoću spin-box koji se pojavljuje, ili ručno upišite vrijednost. "
"Kada se vrijednost je ušao, kliknite na tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton> koja "
"se pojavljuje pored spin-box."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3504
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the USDA data does not show for the ingredient for which the new property "
"has been added, it can be loaded either before adding the new property or "
"after. If the USDA data is added after adding the new property, the new "
"property will still show in the list."
msgstr ""
"Ako se USDA podaci ne prikazuju za sastojak za koji je dodana nova osobina, "
"mogu se učitati ili prije ili poslije dodavanja nove osobine. Ako su USDA "
"podaci dodani nakon dodavanja nove osobine, nova osobina će se i dalje "
"prikazati u listi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The new property must be added to <emphasis>EACH</emphasis> ingredient "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Nova osobina se mora dodati <emphasis>SVAKOM</emphasis> sastojku ponaosob."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3514
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Ingredient Properties"
msgstr "Uklanjanje osobina sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a property from the <emphasis>Ingredient Properties</emphasis> "
"list, simply select the property to be removed and click the <guibutton>-</"
"guibutton> that appears to the right of the list. The property will be "
"removed without a prompt. However, this will remove the property within the "
"<emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component <emphasis>ONLY</emphasis>. The "
"property will be retained in the list in the <emphasis>Properties</emphasis> "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Da se otklone osobine u <emphasis>Osobine sastojaka</emphasis> listi, "
"selektujte osobine da bude pomjerene i kliknite tako da <guibutton>-</"
"guibutton> se pojavi desno od popisa. Osobina će biti uklonjena brzo. "
"Međutim, ovo ce otkloniti osobine u <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> "
"komponenti <emphasis>SAMO</emphasis>. Osobina će se zadržati na listi u "
"<emphasis>Properties</emphasis> komponenti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3529
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Ingredient Weights"
msgstr "Rad sa težinama sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with the <guilabel>Ingredient Properties</guilabel>, for those "
"ingredients that were provided by default with the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> program, the <guilabel>Ingredient Weights</guilabel> will have "
"been loaded. However, if the ingredient weights have not been loaded "
"<emphasis>or, you wish to add an additional weight</emphasis> to one of your "
"ingredients, you can do so."
msgstr ""
"Kao i <guilabel>Osobine sastojka</guilabel>, za one sastojke koji su "
"ponuđeni po defaultu sa <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> programom, "
"<guilabel>Težine sastojka</guilabel> će biti učitane. Međutim, ako težine "
"sastojka nisu učitane <emphasis>ili, želite da dodate dodatnu težinu</"
"emphasis> za jedan od svojih sastojaka, možete to uraditi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3538
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Weights to your Ingredients"
msgstr "Dodavanje težina za vaše sastojke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3540
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a weight for your ingredient, you must first select it. Then, click "
"the <guibutton>+</guibutton> button that appears beside the "
"<guilabel>Ingredient Weight</guilabel> list. A dialog box will appear in "
"which you can enter the parameters for the <guilabel>New Ingredient Weight</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate težinu za svoj sastojak, prvo ga morate izabrati. Onda, kliknite "
"taster <guibutton>+</guibutton> koji se pojavljuje pored liste "
"<guilabel>Težina sastojka</guilabel>. Pojavit će se okvir za dijalog u kojem "
"možete da unesete parametre za <guilabel>Nova težina sastojka</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, in the text box beside the label <guilabel>Weight:</guilabel>, you "
"can enter the weight that you want for the ingredient. Remember the table "
"for apples in the <link linkend=\"property-status\">Looking After Nutrients</"
"link> section? By utilizing this table, it was calculated that 1 medium "
"apple weighed 151.3 grams. Following through with this example, 151.3 is the "
"value that would be entered in the <guilabel>Weight:</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"Prvo, u okviru za tekst pored oznake <guilabel>Težina:</guilabel>, možete "
"unijeti težinu koju želite za sastojak. Sjećate li se tabele za jabuke u "
"poglavlju <link linkend=\"property-status\">Briga o hranljivim tvarima</"
"link> section? Upotrebom ove table, proračunato je da 1 srednja jabuka teži "
"151.3 grama. Nastavljajući sa ovim primjerom, 151.3 je vrijednost koja bi se "
"unijela u okvir za tekst <guilabel>Težina:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, the weight measure must be selected from the drop-down menu. So, using "
"the apple example, we would select <emphasis>gram</emphasis> from this list. "
"Since properties, or nutrient values, are usually specified as a <quote>per "
"gram</quote> value, it is a good idea to set your weight measure to grams."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, mjera težine se mora izabrati iz padajućeg menija. Onda, upotrebom "
"primjera sa jabukom, izabrali bismo <emphasis>gram</emphasis> iz liste. "
"Pošto su osobine, ili hranljive vrijednosti, obično navedene kao vrijednosti "
"<quote>po gramu</quote>, dobra je ideja da postavite svoju mjeru težine na "
"grame."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the text box beside the <guilabel>Per Amount:</guilabel> label, you would "
"enter whatever amount the weight applies to. In the apple example, we would "
"enter 1. Then, from the drop-down menu beside this text box, the unit of "
"measure would be selected, in this case <emphasis>medium</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"U okvir za tekst pored oznake <guilabel>Po količini:</guilabel>, unijeli "
"biste bilo koju količinu za koju težina važi. U primjeru sa jabukom, unijeli "
"bismo 1. Onda, iz padajućeg menija pored ovog okvira za tekst, jedinica "
"mjere bi se izabrala, u ovom slučaju <emphasis>srednja</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3565
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To quickly find the unit of measure, or any value from a drop-down list, "
"press the key on the keyboard that corresponds to the first letter of the "
"item being selected. For <emphasis>medium</emphasis>, press the <keycap>M</"
"keycap> key as many times as required until <emphasis>medium</emphasis> is "
"selected. Repeated pressing of the <keycap>M</keycap> key will cycle through "
"all choices that begin with the letter m."
msgstr ""
"Da biste brzo pronašli jedinice mjere, ili bilo koju vrijednost iz padajuće "
"liste, pritisnite tipku na tastaturi koji odgovara prvo slovo stavku koja je "
"odabrana. Za <emphasis>medium</emphasis>, pritisnite <keycap>M</keycap>tipku "
"onoliko puta koliko je potrebno sa se ne pređe <emphasis>medium</emphasis>. "
"Ponovnim pritiskom na <keycap> M </keycap> tipka ciklusa kroz sve izbore "
"koji počinju sa slovom m."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3573
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, from the drop-down menu that by default shows <guilabel>-No "
"Preparation-</guilabel>, any preparation method associated with the "
"ingredient would be selected. In our example, there is no preparation "
"method, since we are dealing with whole apples."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, iz padajućeg menija koji po default prikazuje <guilabel>-Nema "
"pripreme-</guilabel>, bilo koji način pripreme u vezi sa sastojkom bi bio "
"izabran. U našem primjeru, nema načina pripreme, jer radimo sa cijelim "
"jabukama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3578
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to complete the entry of "
"your ingredient weight, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to abort "
"the addition and close the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Sada, kliknite taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da završite unos svoje "
"težine sastojka, ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da prekinete "
"dodavanje i zatvorite okvir za dijalog."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3585
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Ingredient Weights"
msgstr "Uklanjanje težina sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Conceivably, there should be no reason why you would want to remove an "
"ingredient weight. If any change is necessary, all parts of the weight can "
"be edited. See the section <link linkend=\"edit-weight\">Editing Ingredient "
"Weights</link> for assistance with this function."
msgstr ""
"Razumljivo, ne bi trebalo biti razloga zbog kojeg biste željeli da uklonite "
"težinu sastojka. Ako je bilo kakva promjena potrebna, svi dijelovi težine se "
"mogu izmijeniti. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"edit-weight\">Izmjena "
"težina sastojka</link> za pomoć sa ovom funkcijom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, if you do wish to remove a weight, it is possible to do it. With "
"the appropriate ingredient selected, click on the weight that you wish to "
"remove. Then, click the <guibutton>-</guibutton> button that appears to the "
"right of your <guilabel>Ingredient Weights</guilabel> list. An alert will "
"appear stating <emphasis>Recipes may require this information for nutrient "
"analysis. Are you sure you want to delete this entry?</emphasis> Click the "
"<guibutton>Continue</guibutton> button to continue with the deletion of the "
"ingredient weight, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to "
"discontinue the deletion and close the alert window."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, ako želite izbaciti težinu, to je moguće uraditi. Sa odgovarajućim "
"izabranim sastojkom , kliknite na težinu koju želite ukloniti. Onda kliknite "
"na tastere <guibutton>-</guibutton>  koji će se pojaviti na desnoj strani "
"vaše liste<guilabel>Sastojak Težine</guilabel>. Jedno upozorenja će se "
"pojaviti navodeći <emphasis> Recepti mogu zahtjevati ove informacije za "
"analizu nutrijenata. Jeste li sigurni da želite izbrisati ovaj unos?</"
"emphasis> Kliknite taster <guibutton>Nastavi</guibutton> da nastavite sa "
"brisanjem težine izabranog sastojka, ili na taster <guibutton>Otkazi</"
"guibutton> da pekine da brisanjem i zatvori prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3602
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will also notice a tick box beside the label <guilabel>Do not ask again</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Takođe ćete primijetiti potvrdni okvir pored oznake <guilabel>Ne pitaj "
"ponovo</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3605
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on the tickbox, this will prevent the alert from appearing when "
"you attempt to remove an ingredient weight. The ingredient weight will be "
"removed silently and as stated in the alert, this may affect nutrient "
"analysis of your recipe(s). Note the status indicator (the <emphasis>LED</"
"emphasis>) on your recipes. If it has changed in any of them, it could be "
"due to the removal of an ingredient weight."
msgstr ""
"Ako kliknete na potvrdi okvir, ovo će spriječiti upozorenja da se pojavi "
"kada pokušate ukloniti težinu sastojka. Težina sastojka ce biti pomjereno "
"nečujno i kao što je navedeno u upozorenju, to može utjecati na nutrijenata "
"analizu recepta. Napomena indikator statusa (the <emphasis>LED</emphasis>) "
"za vas recept. Ako je promijenio u bilo kojoj od njih, to bi moglo biti zbog "
"uklanjanja sastojka težine."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3615
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Ingredient Weights"
msgstr "Izmjena težina sastojka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3616
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any portion of the ingredient weight that is listed in the "
"<guilabel>Ingredient Weights</guilabel> list can be edited by double-"
"clicking the part that you want to edit as follows: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Bilo koji dio težine sastojka koja je navedena u listi <guilabel>Težine "
"sastojka</guilabel> može se izmijeniti dvoklikom na dio kojeg želite da "
"izmijenite na sljedeći način: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you double-click the portion under the <guilabel>Weight</guilabel> "
"heading, a dialog box will appear. Under the heading <guilabel>Weight</"
"guilabel>, the existing weight will show in the text box, but you can delete "
"this and enter a new value. Beside the <guilabel>Weight</guilabel> text box, "
"the drop-down menu for the weight measure displays the current setting. "
"However, this can be changed by selecting another from the menu. Finally, "
"click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to complete the change, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the dialog box without "
"changing."
msgstr ""
"Ako kliknete dvaput na dio pod naslovom <guilabel>težina</guilabel> pojavit "
"će se dijalog. Pod naslovom <guilabel>Težina</guilabel>, postojeće težine će "
"se prikazati u polju sa tekstom, ali možete obrisati i unijeti novu "
"vrijednost. Pored okvira za tekst <guilabel>Težina</guilabel>, u padajućem "
"izborniku za mjeru težine prikazuje trenutne postavke. Međutim, to se može "
"promijeniti odabirom drugog izbornika. Konačno, kliknite na tipku "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da biste dovršili promjene, ili tipkue "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da biste zatvorili okvir za dijalog bez "
"promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3631
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you double-click the portion under the <guilabel>Per Amount</guilabel> "
"heading, again, a dialog box will appear. Under the heading "
"<guilabel>Amount</guilabel>, the existing amount will show in the text box, "
"but you can delete this and enter a new value. Beside the <guilabel>Amount</"
"guilabel> text box, the drop-down menu for selecting the unit that the "
"amount applies to displays the current setting. However, this can be changed "
"by selecting another from the menu. Next to the drop-down menu for "
"specifying the unit, another drop-down menu displays from which you can "
"select a preparation method. Again, this will display the current setting, "
"if a preparation method has been used for the ingredient weight. Finally, "
"click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to complete the change, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the dialog box without "
"changing."
msgstr ""
"Ako kliknete dvaput na dio pod <guilabel>Po iznosu</guilabel>, dijalog će se "
"ponovo pojaviti. Pod naslovom <guilabel>Iznos</guilabel>, postojeći iznos će "
"se prikazati u polju, ali možete obrisati ovaj i unijeti novu vrijednost. "
"Pored okvira za tekst <guilabel>Iznos</guilabel>, u padajućem meniju za "
"odabir jedinice koja se odnosi na iznos prikazuje trenutne postavke. "
"Međutim, to se može promijeniti odabirom drugog izbornika. Pored padajućeg "
"izbornika za određivanje jedinice, još jedan drop-down prikazuje izbornik iz "
"kojeg možete odabrati način pripreme. Opet, to će prikazati trenutnu "
"postavku, ako se metoda pripreme koristi za težinu sastojka. Konačno, "
"kliknite na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da biste dovršili promjene, ili "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da biste zatvorili okvir za dijalog bez "
"promjene."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3653
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The Properties Component</title>"
msgstr "<title>Komponenta Osobine</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3655
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Properties</emphasis> component is where nutrients are "
"globally added and removed. To access this component, first click on the "
"<guibutton>Data</guibutton> button in the left pane of the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window and then, click on the "
"<guibutton>Properties</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Svojstva</emphasis> komponenta je mjesto gdje hranjive tvari su "
"globalno dodaju i uklanjaju. Da biste pristupili ovom komponentu, prvo "
"kliknite na tipku <guibutton>Podaci</guibutton> na lijevoj strani "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> prozora, a zatim kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Svojstva</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3661
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with other <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> components, the name of the "
"component appears in the right pane of the window at the top. Below this, "
"beneath the heading <guilabel>Property</guilabel>, the list of nutrients is "
"displayed. Beneath the heading <guilabel>Units</guilabel>, the units "
"associated with the properties are shown."
msgstr ""
"Kao i kod drugih <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> komponenti,  ime komponente "
"se pojavljuje u desnom oknu prozora na vrhu.  Ispod toga, ispod naslova "
"<guilabel>Svojstva</guilabel>, prikazuje se popis svis svih hranljivih "
"trari. Ispod naslova <guilabel>jedinice</guilabel>, jedinice povezane sa "
"svojstvima su prikazani."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3670
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Properties component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Osobine."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3679
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Properties Component</para>"
msgstr "<para>Komponenta Osobine</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3684
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, one of the nutrients under the <guilabel>Property</guilabel> "
"heading is <quote>iron</quote>. If a recipe ingredient contains this "
"nutrient, the amount of iron contained in the ingredient will show as a "
"number of <emphasis>milligrams</emphasis> or <quote>mg</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, jedan od hranljivih materija pod <guilabel>Property</guilabel> "
"zaglavljem je <quote>iron</quote>. Ako je recept sadrži u sastojku ovu "
"hranjivu tvar, u iznosu od željeza sadržani u sastojak će se pokazati kao "
"niz<emphasis>milligrams</emphasis> ili <quote>mg</quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3691
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Properties"
msgstr "Dodavanje osobina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3693
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A number of nutrients have been provided by default in the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program. By default, all available nutrients "
"are selected to be displayed in your recipes, if you choose to do so. "
"However, you will notice in the screenshot that you can select exactly which "
"nutrients that you want to display. This is a great way to watch your diet "
"for specific nutrient intake."
msgstr ""
"Broj hranjivih tvari pruza po defaultu program <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis>.Po defaultu, sve dozvoljene hranjive tvari su izabrane da budu "
"prikazane u receptu, ako izaberete da bude tako. Međutim, primijetit ćete u "
"screenshot da možete odabrati upravo koje hranjive tvari želite prikazati. "
"Ovo je odličan način da se pazi na ishranu za specifičnan unos hranjivih "
"tvari."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3700
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although the nutrient list provided by default is quite extensive, if there "
"is a nutrient missing, it is possible to add it to the list. To add a "
"missing nutrient, click the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> button that "
"appears near the top in the right-hand side of the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> window. The <interface>New Property</interface> window will "
"appear. In this window, the <userinput>name of the nutrient</userinput> can "
"be entered in the text box beside the <guilabel>Property name:</guilabel> "
"label, and the associated <userinput>unit of measure</userinput> is entered "
"in the text box beside the <guilabel>Units:</guilabel> label. Click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to proceed with the addition, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to close the window and return to the "
"previous screen."
msgstr ""
"Iako lista hranljivih vrijednosti koja je po defaultu je prilično opsežna, "
"ako nedostaje hranjivih tvari, moguće je dodati na listu. Da biste dodali "
"hranjivih tvari koje nedostaju, kliknite na <guibutton>Kreirajte...</"
"guibutton> koji se pojavljuje pri vrhu u desnom strani <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> prozora. Prozor <interface>Nova osobina</interface> će se "
"pojaviti. U ovom prozoru, na <userinput>Ime hranljive tvari</userinput> može "
"se upisati u polje pored oznake <guilabel>Naziv nekretnine:</guilabel>, a "
"povezani <userinput>Mjerna jedinica:</userinput> upisuje se u polje pored "
"oznake <guilabel>Jedinica: </guilabel>etiketu. Kliknite na <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> da biste nastavi sa dodatkom ili <guibutton>Odustani</guibutton> "
"da biste zatvorili prozor i vratite se na prethodni ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3714
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding a nutrient, or <emphasis>Property</emphasis>, is a two-step "
"procedure. First, the nutrient and associated unit is added in the "
"<emphasis>Properties</emphasis> component as described above. However, the "
"actual nutrient value &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> the number of mg of "
"iron, for example, contained in a particular ingredient must be added within "
"the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> component. This must be done for "
"<emphasis>EACH</emphasis> ingredient. Refer to the section <link linkend="
"\"ingredient-properties\">Properties in Ingredients</link> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Dodavanje hranjivih tvari, ili <emphasis>Property</emphasis>, je postupak u "
"dva koraka. Prvi, nutrijenati i povezane jedinice se dodaju u "
"<emphasis>Properties</emphasis> komponentu kao što je opisano gore. Međutim, "
"stvarna vrijednost nutrijenata &ndash; <abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> broj mg "
"željeza, na primjer, sadržan u određenom sastojaku mora biti dodan u okviru "
"<emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> componente. To se mora uraditi za "
"<emphasis>EACH</emphasis> sastojke. Pogledajte odjeljak <link linkend="
"\"ingredient-properties\">Properties in Ingredients</link> za vise "
"informacija."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3727
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting Properties"
msgstr "Brisanje osobina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3729
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a nutrient from the list, click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> "
"button that appears below the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> button that "
"was used to create a new nutrient."
msgstr ""
"Da uklonite hranljivu tvar iz liste, kliknite taster <guibutton>Izbriši</"
"guibutton> koji se pojavljuje ispod tastera <guibutton>Napravi...</"
"guibutton> koji se koristi za pravljene nove hranljive tvari."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3734
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An <quote>alert</quote> box will appear asking <emphasis>Are you sure you "
"want to delete this property?</emphasis> Click the <guibutton>Continue</"
"guibutton> button to proceed with the removal of the nutrient, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the action and close the "
"alert."
msgstr ""
"Pojavit će se okvir <quote>upozorenja</quote> sa pitanjem <emphasis>Da li "
"ste sigurni da želite da izbrišete ovu osobinu?</emphasis> Kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Nastavi</guibutton> da nastavite sa uklanjanjem hranljive tvari, "
"ili taster <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da otkažete radnju i da zatvorite "
"upozorenje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3741
#, no-c-format
msgid "Another method:"
msgstr "Drugi  način:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3743
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An alternative method to either add, remove, or edit a nutrient is to first, "
"select a nutrient and then, right-click to display a menu from which you can "
"select <guimenuitem>Create</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>, "
"or <guimenuitem>Rename</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Alternativna metoda za bilo dodavanje, uklanjanje ili uređivanje hranjivih "
"tvari je da prvo, odaberite hranjivie tvari, a zatim, desni klik da biste "
"prikazali izbornik iz kojeg možete izabrati <guimenuitem>Kreiraj</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Brisi</guimenuitem>, ili <guimenuitem>Preimenuj</"
"guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For quick functionality, the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</"
"keycap></keycombo> key combination can be used to <emphasis>Create</"
"emphasis> a new nutrient. To <emphasis>Delete</emphasis> a nutrient, press "
"the <keycap>Del</keycap> key on the keyboard &ndash; a prompt will appear "
"asking <emphasis>Are you sure you want to delete this property?</emphasis> "
"and can be acted on in the same manner as previously explained. The key "
"combination <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> "
"can be used to <emphasis>Rename</emphasis> an nutrient."
msgstr ""
"Za brzi funkcionalnost, <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></"
"keycombo> kombinacija tipki se može koristiti za <emphasis>Create</emphasis> "
"nove hranjihve tvari. Za  <emphasis>Brisi</emphasis> hranjihvih tvari, "
"pritisnite <keycap>Del</keycap>kljuc na tastaturi &ndash; a prompt will "
"appear asking <emphasis>Jeste li sigurni da zelite ovo izbrisati?</emphasis> "
"i može se postupiti na isti način kao što je prethodno objašnjeno. "
"Kombinacija tipki<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></"
"keycombo> moze se koristiti i za <emphasis>Rename</emphasis> hranjive tvari."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3764
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Units Component"
msgstr "Komponenta Mjere"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3766
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <emphasis>Units</emphasis> component, not only can units of measure "
"that are to be used in the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program be added "
"and removed, but conversions between the various measures can be set up!"
msgstr ""
"U komponenti <emphasis>Mjere</emphasis>, ne samo da se mogu dodavati i "
"uklanjati jedinice mjere koje će se koristiti u <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> programu, nego se mogu podesiti i pretvaranja između raznih mjera!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3771
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Units</emphasis> component is accessed by first, clicking on "
"the <guibutton>Data</guibutton> button to reveal the additional "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> components, and then, clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Units</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Pristupiti komponenti <emphasis>Units</emphasis> prvo je, kliknite na taster "
"<guibutton>Data</guibutton>  za otkrivanje dodatnih <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> komponenti, i onda kliknite na taster <guibutton>Units</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3776
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like other <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> components, the <emphasis>Units</"
"emphasis> component appears in the right-hand side of the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> window with the name of the component "
"appearing at the top. Three tabs exist &ndash; one for listing and "
"maintaining the units of measure and two for setting up the conversion "
"tables between the various units of measure."
msgstr ""
"Kao i druge <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> komponente, komponenta "
"<emphasis>Units</emphasis> se pojavljuje u desnoj strani<emphasis>&krecipes;"
"</emphasis> prozora sa imenom komponenti koje se pojavljuju na vrhu.  "
"Postoje tri kartice&ndash; jedan za listu oglasa i održavanje Mjerne "
"jedinice i dva za postavljanje stolova konverzije između različitih jedinica "
"mjere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3783
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the conversion tables is for <emphasis>mass</emphasis> conversions, "
"for instance, between grams and pounds. The other table is for "
"<emphasis>volume</emphasis> conversion, for example, between fluid ounces "
"and cups. It is these conversion tables, along with the ingredient weights "
"that determine the nutrient values in your recipes. See the section <link "
"linkend=\"ingredient-weights\">Working with Ingredient Weights</link> for "
"help with ingredient weights. Refer to <link linkend=\"set-equivalents"
"\">Completing Your Conversion Tables</link> later in this section for an "
"outline on setting your conversion factors."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od stolova pretvorbe je za <emphasis>masu</emphasis>, na primjer, "
"izmešu grama i kilograma. Drugi stol je za <emphasis>volumem</emphasis>, na "
"primjer, između fluida unci i čaše. To je ove tablice konverzije, zajedno sa "
"sastojkom težine koja određuju vrijednosti hranjivih tvari u vašem "
"receptima. Vidi poglavlje <link linkend=\"ingredient-weights\">Rad sa "
"sastojcima težine</link> za pomoć sa sastojkom težine. Pogledajte <link "
"linkend=\"set-equivalents\">Dovršetak vaše tabele konverzacije</link> "
"kasnije u ovom poglavlju za pregled na postavke faktora konverzije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3793
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Units</guilabel> tab, a list of all the units of measure "
"will appear. This list includes the units of measure that have been provided "
"by default and those that you have added, either by entering a new unit "
"while entering a new recipe, or by adding the unit within the "
"<emphasis>Units</emphasis> component."
msgstr ""
"U kartici <guilabel>Mjere</guilabel>, pojavit će se popis svih jedinica "
"mjere. Ova lista uključuje Mjerne jedinice koje su dobile po defaultu i one "
"koje ste dodali, ili unosom nove jedinice, dok ulazi u novu recept, ili "
"dodavanjem jedinice unutar <emphasis>Units</emphasis> componente."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3801
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the Units tab in the &krecipes; Units component."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana kartice Mjere u &krecipes; komponenti Mjere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3810
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units Component &ndash; The Units List"
msgstr "Komponenta Mjere &ndash; Lista mjera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3816
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will also note that each unit allows a singular and plural form of that "
"unit, if one exists. Additionally, abbreviations for both singular and "
"plural forms can be set. A unit <emphasis>type</emphasis> can also be "
"specified for each unit."
msgstr ""
"Također ćete primijetiti da svaka jedinica omogućava jedninu i množinu te "
"jedinice,ako postoji.  Pored toga, skraćenice i za jedninu i množinu oblika "
"mogu se postaviti.Jedinica <emphasis>type</emphasis> može biti naveden za "
"svaku jedinicu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3822
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Units of Measure"
msgstr "Dodavanje jedinica mjere"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3823
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a unit of measure, click the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> button "
"that appears to the right of the <emphasis>Unit</emphasis> list. The "
"<interface>New Unit</interface> dialog box will appear where the name of the "
"new unit can be added. Beneath the heading <guilabel>New Unit</guilabel>, "
"there is a text box to <userinput>enter the singular form of the unit</"
"userinput> and one to <userinput>enter the plural form of the unit</"
"userinput>. To the right of each of these text boxes is another pair of text "
"boxes in which to <userinput>enter the abbreviation</userinput> for both "
"singular and plural forms respectively. However, since both singular and "
"plural abbreviations are most often identical, typing the abbreviation in "
"the singular text box, will result in the plural abbreviation being "
"automatically completed. On the rare occasion that the plural abbreviation "
"is different, you can easily edit the entry."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate jedinicu mjerenja,kliknite na taster <guibutton>Kreiraj...</"
"guibutton> koji ce se pojaviti desno od liste <emphasis>Unit</emphasis>. "
"Okvir za dijalog <interface>Nova jedinica</interface>  će se pojaviti gdje "
"se može dodati naziv nove jedinice. Ispod naslova <guilabel>Nova jedinica</"
"guilabel>, nalazi se okvir za tekst za <userinput>unos jednine jedinice</"
"userinput> i jedan do<userinput>unos vise jedinica</userinput>. Desno od "
"svake ove teksta kutije je jos jedna par teksta kutije <userinput>unesite "
"skraćenica</userinput> i za jedninu i množinu oblika. Međutim, budući da su "
"jednina i množina skraćenice najčešće identične, upisivanjem skraćenica u "
"jednini okvir za tekst, će rezultirati u množini skraćenica automatski "
"završen. U rijetkim prilikama je množina skraćenica drugačija, iako možete "
"da unosete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3837
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, the unit <emphasis>type</emphasis> is selected from the drop-down "
"menu that appears beside the label <guilabel>Type:</guilabel>. Choices for "
"unit type are: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Konačno, <emphasis>vrsta</emphasis> mjere se bira iz padajućeg menija koji "
"se prikazuje pored oznake <guilabel>Vrsta:</guilabel>. Opcije za vrstu mjere "
"su: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3842
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other &ndash; this is the default and hence, this is what displays on the "
"drop-down menu"
msgstr ""
"Druga &ndash; ovo je standardna vrijednost i stoga, ovo se prikazuje u "
"padajućem meniju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3844
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This type is used for any unit that cannot be designated as mass of volume."
msgstr ""
"Ova vrsta se koristi za bilo koju mjeru koja se ne može označiti kao masa "
"volumena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3846
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mass &ndash; for those units that have a weight associated with them, for "
"example, gram or pound"
msgstr ""
"Masa &ndash; za one mjere koje su u vezi sa težinom, na primjer, gram ili "
"funta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3848
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Volume &ndash; for those units that are associated with a volume, for "
"example, cup, quart, liter"
msgstr ""
"Zapremina &ndash; za one mjere koje su u vezi sa zapreminom, na primjer, "
"čaša, kvart, litar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3852
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once all entries have been made, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button "
"to complete the addition, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to "
"cancel the addition and close the box. Below, is an example of what the "
"<interface>New Unit</interface> dialog box will look like once completed."
msgstr ""
"Nakon sto su svi upisi napravljeni, kliknite na taster<guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>da zavsi to complete the dodatak, ili taster <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> da otkaze dodataki zatvori okvir. U nastavku, je primjer kako ce "
"okvir za dijalog izzgledati kada bude zavrsen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3864
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Units of Measure"
msgstr "Uklanjanje jedinica mjere"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3865
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a unit of measure, in the <emphasis>Unit</emphasis> list, select "
"the unit that you wish to remove. Click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> "
"button that appears to the right of the list and below the "
"<guibutton>Create...</guibutton> button that is used to add units of "
"measure. A slight delay will occur while the database is searched to ensure "
"that no recipes exist that use that unit of measure and then, the unit of "
"measure will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Da uklonite jedinicu mjerenja, iz liste<emphasis>Unit</emphasis>, selektujte "
"jedinu koju zelite da uklonite.. Kliknite na taster <guibutton>Izbrisi</"
"guibutton> desno od liste ce se pojaviti i ispod je taster "
"<guibutton>Kreiraj...</guibutton> koji se koristi za dodavanje Mjerne. A "
"neznatno odlaganja će se dogoditi, dok baza podataka traži da se osigura da "
"ne postoje recepti koji koriste te jedinice mjere i tada jedinica mjere će "
"biti uklonjena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3873
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a recipe exists that uses the unit of measure selected to be removed, a "
"window will appear with the <quote>alert</quote> <emphasis>The following "
"will have to be removed also, since currently they use the element you have "
"chosen to be removed</emphasis>. Beneath the heading <guilabel>Recipes</"
"guilabel>, the list of recipes utilizing that unit will appear. Beneath the "
"heading <emphasis>Ingredient Weights</emphasis> a list of ingredients is "
"shown that utilize the unit of measure in the <emphasis>Ingredient Weights</"
"emphasis> section. Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to proceed "
"with the removal of the unit of measure AND <emphasis>any or all</emphasis> "
"recipes/ingredients using that unit. Click the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
"button to cancel the action and close the window."
msgstr ""
"Ako postoji recept koji koristi jedinicu mjere bice izabrana da se ukloni, "
"prozor će se pojaviti sa<quote>upozorenja</quote> <emphasis>sljedeće se mora "
"ukloniti , budući da se trenutno koriste element koji ste odabrali da se "
"uklone</emphasis>. Ispod naslova<guilabel>Recepti</guilabel>, je lista "
"recepata koja koristi te jednice mjerenja.  Ispod naslova<emphasis>Sastojak "
"Težine</emphasis> je prikazana lista recepata koja sadzi te mjerne jedinice "
"u <emphasis>Sastojak Težine </emphasis> poglavlju. Kliknite na taster "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>  da nastavi sa uklanjanje jedinicu mjere "
"I<emphasis>bilo koji ili sve</emphasis> recepti / sastojci koriste tu "
"jedinicu. KLiknite na taster <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> da zatvori radnje "
"i prozor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3889
#, no-c-format
msgid "Completing Your Conversion Tables"
msgstr "Završavanje vaše tabele za pretvaranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Conversions between units are entered in the <guilabel>Mass Conversions</"
"guilabel> tab for those units associated with a weight. For those units "
"associated with a volume, the conversions are set in <guilabel>Volume "
"Conversions</guilabel> tab. Both of these tables are set up in a "
"<quote>spreadsheet</quote> style format. Down the side of the table, you "
"will note that each <quote>row</quote> is labeled with a unit name. "
"Similarly, along the top, each <quote>column</quote> is also labeled with a "
"unit name. The <quote>cells</quote> in the body of the table are used to set "
"the equivalencies. 1 to 1 equivalencies are provided by default."
msgstr ""
"Konverzije između jedinica su ušli u <guilabel>Mass Konverzije</guilabel> "
"Kartica za te jedinice su povezane s težinom. Za one jedinice koje su "
"povezane sa zapreminom, konverzije su postavljeni u kartici "
"<guilabel>Volumen Konverzije</guilabel> . Obje ove tabele su postavljene u "
"<quote>spreadsheet</quote> stil formata. Donja strana tabele, imaćete  na "
"umu da svaki <quote>red</quote> je označen s jedinicom imena. Slično tome, "
"po gornjoj, svaka <quote>kolona</quote> je označena sa jedinicom imena.  "
"<quote>ćelije</quote> u tekstu tabele koristi za postavljanje jednakosti. 1 "
"do 1 Jednakosti se pružaju po defaultu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3903
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the Mass Conversions tab in the &krecipes; Units "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana kartice Pretvaranje mase u the &krecipes; "
"komponenti Mjere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3912
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units Component &ndash; Mass Unit Conversions"
msgstr "Komponenta Mjere &ndash; Pretvaranje jedinica mase"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3920
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the Volume Conversions tab in the &krecipes; Units "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana kartice Pretvaranja zapremine u &krecipes; "
"komponenti Mjere."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3929
#, no-c-format
msgid "Units Component &ndash; Volume Unit Conversions"
msgstr "Komponenta Mjere &ndash; Pretvaranja jedinica zapremine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3935
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Both of these conversion tables are completed in the same manner. Using the "
"<emphasis>Volume Conversion</emphasis>, table as an example, down the left "
"side of the spreadsheet, suppose there is a unit of measure labeled "
"<emphasis>cup</emphasis> . Using the <quote>horizontal scroll bar</quote> at "
"the bottom of the window, if necessary, find the column that has the label "
"<emphasis>fluid ounces</emphasis> at the top. Click on the cell that is "
"beside <emphasis>cup</emphasis> and below <emphasis>fluid ounces</emphasis>. "
"You can now enter 8, which is the equivalent in fluid ounces of 1 cup, in "
"the cell. You can also use the directional arrows to navigate to the correct "
"position for entering the equivalent if another cell is already active."
msgstr ""
"Obje ove tablice konverzije su završili na isti način. Koristeci "
"<emphasis>Volumen Konverzije</emphasis>, tabele kao primjer, na lijevoj "
"strani proračunske tablice, pretpostavlja se da je jedinica mjere označena "
"<emphasis>cup</emphasis> .  Koristeci  <quote>horizontala traka pomjeranja</"
"quote> na dnu prozora, ako je neophodno, pronadjite kolonu koji ima oznaku "
"<emphasis>unce tečnosti</emphasis> na vrhu. Kliknite na ćeliju koja je pored "
"<emphasis>kup</emphasis>i dolje <emphasis>unce tečnosti</emphasis>. Sada "
"možete unijeti 8, što je ekvivalentno u tečnosti unci 1 kup, u ćeliji. "
"Također možete koristiti strelice za kretanje u ispravnom položaju za ulazak "
"u drugu ćeliju ekvivalenta, ako je već aktivan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3946
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For large number equivalents, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will "
"automatically format the number with a <emphasis>thousands</emphasis> "
"separator. For instance, to enter the milligram equivalent of 1 pound in the "
"<emphasis>Mass Conversion</emphasis> table, you would enter 454000. Once you "
"move off the cell, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will display the number "
"as 454,000."
msgstr ""
"Za veliki broj ekvivalenata, <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> će automatski "
"formatirati broj za <emphasis>thousands</emphasis> rastavljanje. Na primjer, "
"da biste ušli u miligrama ekvivalent 1 £ u <emphasis> Mass pretvorbe </"
"emphasis> tablice, ući 454000. Jednom kada pomerite sa ćelije, "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> će prikazati broj kao 454.000."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3953
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program knows the some of the "
"conversions, it can automatically calculate others. For example, if the "
"program has been informed that there are 8 fluid ounces in a cup, "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> will automatically calculate that 1 fluid "
"ounce is equal to .125 (or 1/8) of a cup."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što program <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> poznaje neke od "
"konverzije, može automatski izračunati drugima. FNa primjer, ako je program "
"bio obaviješten da postoji 8 unce tečnosti u šolju,<emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> će automatski izračunati da 1 tečnosti je jednaka 0,125 (ili 1/8) "
"od kup."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:3961
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Measurement Converter"
msgstr "Upotreba pretvarača mjera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3962
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <interface>Measurement Converter</interface> is accessed by selecting "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Measurement Converter</"
"guimenuitem> from the &krecipes; menu. The interface can also be activated "
"by using the <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> "
"key combination."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Mjerenje Konverter</interface> se pristupa odabirom "
"<guimenu>Alati</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Mjerenje Konverter</guimenuitem> iz "
"&krecipes; menija.Interfejs može se aktivirati pomoću <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> kombinacijom tipki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3968
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <interface>Measurement Converter</interface> works in conjunction with "
"your <emphasis>Ingredient Weights</emphasis> and/or your conversion tables. "
"If your conversion tables have not been completed, or you have not specified "
"a unit type in the <guilabel>Units</guilabel> tab of the <emphasis>Units</"
"emphasis> component, for example, mass or volume, the <interface>Measurement "
"Converter</interface> <emphasis>will not</emphasis> be able to do its job. "
"It will also not provide conversions if the <guilabel>Ingredient Weights</"
"guilabel> have not been completed in the <emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Interfejs <interface>Mjerenje Konverter</interface>radi u vezi sa vašim "
"<emphasis>Sastojak Težine</emphasis> i/ili vašu tablicu konverzije.Ako niste "
"završili vašu tablicu konverzije, ili niste odredili jedinicu tipa u "
"<guilabel>Units</guilabel> tabu  <emphasis>Jedinice</emphasis> komponenti, "
"npr., mase ili volumena, <interface>Mjerenje Konverter</interface> "
"<emphasis>will not</emphasis> biti u stanju da radi svoj posao. To nece "
"pružitikonverziju ako <guilabel>Sastojci Tezine</guilabel> ne budu bili "
"zavrseni u<emphasis>Ingredients</emphasis> komponenti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:3980
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the Measurement Converter tool."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana alata Pretvarač mjera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3988
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Measurement Converter."
msgstr "Pretvarač mjera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3993
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you will note from the screenshot, when the <interface>Measurement "
"Converter</interface> starts, beside the label <guilabel>Convert</guilabel> "
"there is a text box in which the enter <userinput>the amount you want to "
"convert</userinput>. Beside this text box, there is a drop-down menu from "
"which to select the unit of measure that is associated with the amount that "
"you are converting."
msgstr ""
"Kao što ćete napomenuti iz slike ekrana, kada<interface>Measurement "
"Converter</interface> starta,pored oznake <guilabel>Convert</guilabel> "
"nalazi se okvir za tekst u koji se unosi <userinput>iznos koji želite "
"pretvoriti</userinput>. Pored ovog okvira za tekst, nalazi se padajući "
"izbornik iz kojeg biste odabrali jedinicu mjere koja je povezana sa iznosom "
"koji ste pretvorili."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4000
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the amount and unit that you want to convert, there are two drop-down "
"menus from which making a choice is optional. The first menu is labeled "
"<guilabel>--Ingredient (optional)--</guilabel> and is for choosing an "
"ingredient. The second is labeled <guilabel>-No Preparation-</guilabel> and "
"is for selecting a preparation method, if desired. However, it is these two "
"menus that cause your <emphasis>Ingredient Weights</emphasis> to come into "
"play. For example, suppose one of your recipes calls for 8 cups of apples "
"and you want to know how many pounds of apples you need to buy. The "
"<interface>Measurement Converter</interface> can help!"
msgstr ""
"Ispod iznosa i jedinice koju želite pretvoriti, postoje dva padajućeg menija "
"iz kojih donošenja izbor je opcionalno. Prvi izbornik je označen <guilabel>--"
"Ingredient (optional)--</guilabel> i to je za izbor sastojka. Drugi izbornik "
"jeoznacen <guilabel>-No Preparation-</guilabel> je za odabir metode, ako "
"želite. Međutim, to su dva menija koji uzrokuju vašu <emphasis>Ingredient "
"Weights</emphasis> dodje do izražaja. Na primjer, pretpostaviti da jedan od "
"vaših recepti poziva na 8 čaša jabuka i želite znati koliko kilograma jabuka "
"trebate kupiti.  <interface>Measurement Converter</interface> moze pomoci!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4010
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beside the label <guilabel>To</guilabel> is a drop-down menu for selecting "
"the unit that you want to convert to. Below this menu and beside the label "
"<guilabel>Result:</guilabel> the result displays. Of course, before the "
"result will display, you must click the <guibutton>Convert</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Pored oznake<guilabel>To</guilabel> je padajući izbornik za odabir jedinice "
"koji želite pretvoriti. Pored ovog menija i pored oznake <guilabel>Result:</"
"guilabel> prikazuje rezultate. Naravno, prije nego se rezultat pojavina "
"ekranu, morate kliknuti na taster <guibutton>Convert</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4016
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Two other buttons exist at the bottom of the <interface>Measurement "
"Converter</interface> window &ndash; the <guibutton>Close</guibutton> button "
"that will close the window without performing a conversion, or once you have "
"performed a conversion and finished using the information displayed, and the "
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton> button, which opens the &krecipes; Handbook to "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Druge dvije tipke postoje na dnu <interface>Measurement Converter</"
"interface> window &ndash;<guibutton>Close</guibutton> taster koji ce "
"zatovriti prozor bezobavljanje konverzije, ili nakon što ste izvršili "
"konverziju i završite s korištenjem informacije koje se prikazuju, i taster "
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton>, koji otvara &krecipes; prirucnik ove sekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4023
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As previously stated, the drop-down menus for selecting an ingredient and "
"preparation method are optional unless you are converting ingredient "
"amounts. The <interface>Measurement Converter</interface> can also be used "
"for straight numeric conversion. For instance, the situation might exist "
"where you have a recipe that lists the ingredients in imperial measure, but "
"you want to convert them to metric measure. The <interface>Measurement "
"Converter</interface> can also be used to find the equivalent for a "
"multiple, for instance, how many milliliters are there in 4 fluid ounces? "
"You won't want to be without this handy tool!"
msgstr ""
"Kao što je ranije navedeno, padajući meniji za izbor sastojak i priprema "
"metode su opcija osim ako su pretvorili izabranog sastojka iznosima. "
"<interface>Measurement Converter</interface> može se koristiti i za ravno "
"numeričke konverzije. Recimo, možda postoji situacija gdje imate recept koji "
"navodi sastojke u mjeri, ali želite da ih pretvoriti u metričke mjere. "
"<interface>Measurement Converter</interface> može se koristiti za "
"pronalaženje ekvivalentna za više, na primjer, koliko mililitara ima u 4 "
"unce tečnosti? Vi ne želite da bude bez ovog alata pri ruci!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4040
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The Preparation Methods Component</title>"
msgstr "<title>Komponenta Načini pripreme</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4042
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the <emphasis>Preparation Methods</emphasis> component, first "
"click on the <guibutton>Data</guibutton> button to reveal additional "
"components and then, click the <guibutton>Preparation Methods</guibutton> "
"button. In the right-hand pane of the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"window, a list of preparation methods will be displayed under the heading "
"<quote>Preparation Method</quote>. Note that the name of the component also "
"appears at the top of the pane."
msgstr ""
"Za pristup <emphasis>Načini pripreme</emphasis> komponenti, prvi klik na "
"<guibutton>Data</guibutton> taster da otkrije dodatne komponente, a zatim, "
"kliknite na taster <guibutton>Načini pripreme</guibutton>. U desnom oknu "
"prozora<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, spisak metoda pripreme će biti "
"prikazan pod naslovom <quote>Načini pripreme</quote>. Imajte na umu da se "
"naziv komponente također pojavljuje na vrhu okna."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4052
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Preparation Methods component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Načini pripreme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4061
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Preparation Methods Component</para>"
msgstr "<para>Komponenta Načini pripreme</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4066
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The preparation methods listed include those installed by default with the "
"program and those that are automatically added when a method is typed into "
"the <quote>Preparation Method</quote> field while entering a new recipe. See "
"the section <link linkend=\"add-recipe\">Adding a New Recipe</link>."
msgstr ""
"Metode pripreme navedene uključuju one instalirane po defaultu sa programom "
"i onih koja se automatski dodaje kada je metoda je upisan u "
"<quote>Preparation Method</quote> oblasti, dok ulazi u novu recept. Vidi "
"poglavlje<link linkend=\"add-recipe\">Dodavanje noog recepta</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4072
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a New Preparation Method"
msgstr "Dodavanje novog načina pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4074
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a new preparation method, click the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> "
"button that is seen in the upper right-hand portion of the screen. A dialog "
"box will appear containing a text box that allows entry of the new "
"preparation method under the heading <quote>New Preparation Method</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodali novi način pripreme, kliknite na taster <guibutton>Create..."
"</guibutton>  koji se vidi u gornjem desnom dijelu ekrana. A dijalog će se "
"pojaviti koji sadrži okvir za tekst koji omogućava ulazak novih metoda "
"pripreme pod naslovom<quote>Nove metode pripreme</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4080
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>Enter the name of the new preparation method</userinput>, for "
"example, <emphasis>Slightly beaten</emphasis> in the text box provided. "
"Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to complete the addition, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the addition and return to "
"the <quote>Preparation Method</quote> list."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>Unesite ime nove metode pripreme</userinput>, na primjer, "
"<emphasis>Blago pretučen</emphasis> u okvir za tekst pod uslovom. KLiknite "
"na taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> da završi to, ili<guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton> na taster da otakze to i vracanje na<quote>Metode pripreme</"
"quote> listu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4088
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting a Preparation Method"
msgstr "Brisanje načina pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4090
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a preparation method, first select the method to be removed from "
"the list of preparation methods displayed. Then, click on the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button that is displayed in the upper, right-"
"hand portion of the screen beneath the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Da izmijenite metodu pripreme, prvo odaberite metodu da se ukloni sa liste "
"metoda pripreme koja se prikazuje. Onda, kliknite nataster "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> koji se prikazuje u gornjem, desnom dijelu "
"ekrana <guibutton>Kreiraj...</guibutton> tastera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4096
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Should the preparation method selected for deletion be used by a recipe, a "
"dialog box will appear stating <emphasis>The following elements will have to "
"be removed also, since currently they use the element you have chosen to be "
"removed.</emphasis> Below this, the list of recipes utilizing the "
"preparation method will show. Click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to "
"proceed &ndash; REMINDER: This will delete not only the preparation method, "
"but the recipes utilizing that method as well! To cancel removal of the "
"preparation method, click the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Ako metoda pripreme odabrana za brisanje će koristiti recept, a dijalog će "
"se pojaviti navodeći<emphasis>Sledeći elementi će se morati ukloniti , "
"budući da se trenutno koriste element koji ste odabrali da se ukloni.</"
"emphasis> Ispod toga, popis recepti korištenjem metode pripreme će pokazati. "
"Kliknite na taster <guibutton>OK</guibutton> za nastavak&ndash; PODSJETNIK: "
"Ovo će izbrisati ne samo način pripreme, ali recepte koji koriste taj metod, "
"kao i! Da biste otkazali uklanjanje metoda pripreme, kliknite na "
"taster<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Should no recipe utilize the preparation method selected for deletion, no "
"prompt will be given."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko nijedan recept ne koristi način pripreme izabran za brisanje, neće "
"biti nikakve poruke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Preparation Methods"
msgstr "Izmjena načina pripreme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Preparation methods can also be edited simply by double-clicking on the "
"desired method."
msgstr ""
"Načini pripreme se mogu takođe jednostavno mijenjati dvoklikom na željeni "
"način."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, to change the method <emphasis>Slightly beaten</emphasis> to "
"<emphasis>Slightly Beaten</emphasis>, double-click on the method in the "
"list. A box will appear around the method, the method will be highlighted "
"and an insertion point will appear. Use the <keycap>&#8592;</keycap> or the "
"<keycap>&#8594;</keycap> directional arrow keys as required to position the "
"cursor in the appropriate position to change the lowercase b in "
"<quote>beaten</quote> to uppercase. Press the &Enter; key to complete the "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, za promijenu metode <emphasis>Slightly beaten</emphasis> u "
"<emphasis>Slightly Beaten</emphasis>, dupli klik na metodu iz liste. A "
"kutija će se pojaviti kao metoda, metoda će biti istaknuta i umetanja će se "
"pojaviti. Koristite <keycap>&#8592;</keycap> ili<keycap>&#8594;</keycap> "
"smjera strelice prema potrebi postavite pokazivač u odgovarajući položaj za "
"promjenu malog slova b u<quote>beaten</quote> u velika slova. Pritisnite "
"kljuc &Enter; da zavrsite promijene."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4128
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The Categories Component</title>"
msgstr "<title>Komponenta Kategorije</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <emphasis>Categories</emphasis> component is selected, the list of "
"all created categories will appear under the heading <guilabel>Category</"
"guilabel>. Those categories that have <emphasis>sub-categories</emphasis> "
"will be shown with a + (plus) sign beside them, indicating that the category "
"can be expanded. Once expanded, the main category will show a - (dash) "
"beside it and the list of sub-categories will be visible."
msgstr ""
"Kada je odabrana komponenta iz <emphasis>Kategorije</emphasis> lista svih "
"stvorenih kategorija će se pojaviti pod naslovom <guilabel>Kategorija</"
"guilabel>. One kategorije koji imaju <emphasis>sub-categories</emphasis>  će "
"biti prikazane + (plus) znakom pored njih, što ukazuje da se kategorija može "
"proširiti, Kada proširimo, glavna kategorija će prikazati - (crtice) pored "
"nje i spisak podkategorije će biti vidljiv."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Categories component."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Kategorije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4149
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Categories Component</para>"
msgstr "<para>Komponenta Kategorije</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a New Category"
msgstr "Dodavanje nove kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a new category, click on the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate novu kategoriju, kliknite na taster <guibutton>Napravi...</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window will pop up where the name of the new category can be entered in a "
"text box under the label <guilabel>New Category</guilabel>. A subcategory "
"can be selected using the <guimenu>Subcategory of</guimenu> drop-down menu, "
"which lists existing categories. The default for the subcategory is "
"<emphasis>&#042;&#042;NONE&#042;&#042;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Šrozor će se pojaviti gdje se ime nove kategorije može se upisati u okvir za "
"tekst pod oznakom <guilabel>Nova kategorija</guilabel>.podkategorija se može "
"izabrati pomoću <guimenu>Podkategorija od</guimenu> padajućem izborniku u "
"kojem se nalaze postojće kategorije.defaukt podkategorija je <emphasis>&#042;"
"&#042;NONE&#042;&#042;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the name of the new category has been entered in the text box, click "
"the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to create the category and return to "
"the category list. The list will now show the new category."
msgstr ""
"Kada se ime nove kategorije unese u okvir za tekst, kliknite na tipku "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>da biste kreirali kategorije i vratite u listu "
"kategoriju. Na listi će sada pokazati novu kategoriju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To cancel the addition of a new category and clear the window, click on the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Da otkažete dodavanje nove kategorije i očistite prozor, kliknite na taster "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a Category"
msgstr "Uklanjanje kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a category, select it from the list of categories and click the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Da uklonite kategoriju, izaberite je iz liste kategorija i kliknite taster "
"<guibutton>Izbriši</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A prompt will appear asking, <emphasis>Are you sure you want to remove this "
"category and all its subcategories?</emphasis>. Click the "
"<guibutton>Continue</guibutton> button to remove the category, or the "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the removal."
msgstr ""
"Prompt će pitati, <emphasis>Jeste li sigurni da želite ukloniti ovu "
"kategoriju i sve njene podkategorije? </emphasis>. Klikom na tipku "
"<guibutton>nasatvi</guibutton> da biste uklonili kategoriju ili tipku "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da otkaže uklanjanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before deleting a category, ensure that it contains NO recipes! Despite the "
"warning <emphasis>Are you sure you want to remove this category and all its "
"subcategories?</emphasis>, clicking the <guibutton>Continue</guibutton> "
"button will result in the deletion of the category whether or not it "
"contains recipes!"
msgstr ""
"Prije brisanja kategorije, da bi se osiguralo da ne zadrži recepte! Bez "
"obzira na upozorenja <emphasis>Jeste li sigurni da đelite uloniti ovu "
"kategoriju i sve njenje podkategorije </emphasis>, klikom na tipku "
"<guibutton>Nasatvi</guibutton>  će rezultirati brisanjem kategoriji li ili "
"ne sadrži recepte!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4197
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Authors Component"
msgstr "Komponenta Autori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Authors</emphasis> component is where the author or "
"contributor of the recipe is maintained."
msgstr ""
"Komponenta <emphasis>Autori</emphasis> je gdje se vodi autor ili saradnik "
"recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Within this component, the component title appears at the top and the list "
"of authors appears in the main portion of the window."
msgstr ""
"U okviru ove komponente, naslov komponente se prikazuje na vrhu a lista "
"autora u glavnom dijelu prozora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding an Author or Contributor"
msgstr "Dodavanje autora ili saradnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add an author/contributor, click on the <guibutton>Create...</guibutton> "
"button on the right-hand side of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate autora/saradnika, kliknite na taster <guibutton>Napravi...</"
"guibutton> na desnoj strani ekrana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A window will appear that allows entry of the author's name in the text box "
"labeled <guilabel>New Author</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Pojaviće se prozor koji omogućava unos imena autora u okvir za tekst sa "
"oznakom <guilabel>Novi autor</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Authors Component showing the addition "
"of a new author."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; komponente Autori koja prikazuje "
"dodavanje novog autora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Authors Component &ndash; Adding an Author"
msgstr "Komponenta Autori &ndash; Dodavanje autora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once a name has been entered, click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to "
"create the entry, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel "
"entry of a new author's name and close the window."
msgstr ""
"Jedno novo ime je uneseno, klikom na tipku <guibutton>OK</guibutton>kreirat "
"će novi unos, ili klikom na <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> da biste poništili "
"unos imena novog autora i zatvaranje prozora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing an Author/Contributor"
msgstr "Uklanjanje autora/saradnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove an author/contributor from the list, select the author from the "
"list and click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button on the right-hand "
"side of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uklonili autora/kreatora sa liste, izaberite autora sa liste i "
"kliknite na tipku <guibutton>Obriši</guibutton> na desnoj strani ekrana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this button has been clicked, an alert will appear with the stating "
"<emphasis>WARNING: The following currently use the element you have chosen "
"to be removed</emphasis>. Beneath the heading <guilabel>Recipes</guilabel>, "
"the list of recipes that have specified this author as the contributor will "
"appear. Click the <guibutton>Continue</guibutton> button to delete the "
"author, or the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button to cancel the deletion."
msgstr ""
"Kada se klikne na ovu tipku, ubrzo će se pojaviti <emphasis>UPOZORENJE: "
"Sljedeći izabrani elementi će biti uklonjeni</emphasis>. Ispod naslova "
"<guilabel>Recepti</guilabel>, lista recepata od navedenog autora če se "
"pojavititi. Klikom na tipku <guibutton>Nastavi</guibutton> za brisanje "
"autora ili klikom na tipku <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> da biste otkazali "
"brisanje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting Preferences in <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"
msgstr "Postavljanje preferiranih opcija u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> is extremely configurable and allows the "
"setting of many preferences besides those defined in the <link linkend="
"\"krecipes-page-setup\">Page Setup</link> section."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> je veoma podesiv i omogućava podešavanje "
"mnogih preferiranih opcija pored onih koje su definisane u <link linkend="
"\"krecipes-page-setup\">Podešavanje stranice</link> section."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4267
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating Shortcuts"
msgstr "Pravljenje kratica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the Shortcut configuration interface, select <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu. The <interface>Configure Shortcuts "
"&ndash; &krecipes;</interface> screen will appear."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pristupili konfiguracijskom interfejsu, odaberite "
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Postavke prečica...</guimenuitem> "
"od menija <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>. <interface>Postavke prečica "
"&ndash; &krecipes;</interface> na ekranu će se pojaviti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the Configure Shortcuts &ndash; &krecipes; starting "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike početnog &ndash; &krecipes; ekrana Podesite kratice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configure Shortcuts &ndash; <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> Starting Point"
msgstr "Podesite kratice &ndash; <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> početna tačka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information read the section about <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"config.html#shortcuts\">Using and Customizing Shortcuts</ulink> of the &kde; "
"Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija pročitajte poglavlje o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"config.html#shortcuts\">Upotreba i prilagođavanje kratica</ulink> u &kde; "
"Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing the Toolbar"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the Toolbar configuration interface, select <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu. The <guilabel>Configure Toolbars "
"&ndash; &krecipes;</guilabel> screen will appear."
msgstr ""
"Da pristupite interfejsu za podešavanje alatne trake, izaberite "
"<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Podesi alatne trake...</"
"guimenuitem> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menija. Pojaviće se ekran "
"<guilabel>Podesi alatne trake &ndash; &krecipes;</guilabel>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4307
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Toolbar configuration screen."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike &krecipes; ekrana Podešavanje alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Configure Toolbars "
"interface"
msgstr ""
"Podesi <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Podesi interfejs alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the screenshot, you will notice that choices available for addition to "
"the toolbar are on the left under the heading <guilabel>Available actions:</"
"guilabel>. On the right, under the heading <guilabel>Current actions:</"
"guilabel> are the icons that presently appear on the toolbar &ndash; note "
"that your toolbar, by default, may appear differently from that displayed in "
"the screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Iz slika ekrana ćete primjetiti da je izbor na raspoloaganju za dodatak na "
"alatnoj traci se nalaze na lijepo strani pod naslocom <guilabel>Dostupne "
"radnje:</guilabel>. Ma desnoj strani, pod naslovom <guilabel>Trenutne akcije:"
"</guilabel> su ikone koje trenutno pojavljuju u alatnoj traci &ndash; imajte "
"na umu da alatna traka, po defaultu, može izgledati drugačije od onog "
"prikazane na slici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4330
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Between the two lists are four arrows, which allow for directional movement "
"between the lists, or up and down in the list. When an item is selected from "
"either list, the directional arrow(s) that are functional are colored, while "
"the non-functional arrow(s) are grayed. Movement is accomplished by clicking "
"on the appropriate directional arrow, as necessary, to move the selection "
"into the desired position."
msgstr ""
"Između dvije liste su četiri strelice, koje omogućavaju smjer kretanja "
"između liste, ili gore i dolje na listi. Kada je izabrana stavka iz bilo "
"liste, strelica(e) koje su funkcionalni su obojne, dok su nefunkcionalne "
"strelica(s) su sive boje. Pokret se postiže klikom na odgovarajuću strelicu, "
"po potrebi, da se pomjeri na željenu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The icon for your selection can be changed by clicking the <guibutton>Change "
"Icon...</guibutton> button. This will bring up a window from which you can "
"select the icon that you want to use. Once selected, click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button that appears on the icon selection screen "
"to close the window and attach the icon to the toolbar selection."
msgstr ""
"Ikona za svoj izbor može se mijenjati klikom na tipku <guibutton>Promijeni "
"ikonu...</guibutton>. Ovo će prozor u kojem možete odabrati ikoju koju "
"želite kosititi. jednom odaberite, kliknite na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> i "
"pojavljuje se na ekranu za izbor ikone za zatvaranje prozora i pričvrstite "
"ikonu za odabir na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to apply your changes, you must click the <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> button that appears at the bottom of the <guilabel>Configure "
"Toolbars &ndash; &krecipes;</guilabel> screen. This will apply your changes, "
"but leave the window open in order to make other changes, if desired. To "
"apply your changes and exit the interface, click the <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> button. Clicking the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> will cancel "
"<emphasis>any changes made since the last time the <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> button was clicked</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste se primjenili svoje promjene, morate kliknuti na tipku "
"<guibutton>Primjeni</guibutton> koja se pojavljuje na dnu "
"ekrana<guilabel>Postavki alatne trake &ndash; &krecipes;</guilabel>. Ovo će "
"se primjenjivati svoje promjene, ali ostavite otvoren prozor kako bi druge "
"promjene, ako je potrebno. Da biste prijavili svoje promjenei napustili "
"interfejs, kliknite na tipku<guibutton>OK</guibutton>. Klikom na "
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> će otkazati <emphasis>sve pormjene do zadnjeg "
"klika na tipku<guibutton>primjeni</guibutton></emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4357
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"
msgstr "Podešavanje <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you choose <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&krecipes;</guimenuitem> from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> menu, the "
"<interface>&krecipes; Preferences - &krecipes;</interface> window appears. "
"From this window, you can choose one of five pages to configure various "
"aspects of <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Kada izaberete <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&krecipes;</guimenuitem> iz menija<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> , prozor "
"<interface>&krecipes; Postavke - &krecipes;</interface> se pojavljuje. Iz "
"ovog prozora, možete odabrati jedan od pet stranica konfigurirati različitih "
"aspekta<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4365
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server Settings"
msgstr "Postavke servera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first preference that you can configure is the <guilabel>Database Server "
"Options</guilabel>. You will notice from the following screenshot that this "
"label shows that an SQLite database has been selected. However, if the "
"database selected is either <emphasis>MySQL</emphasis> or "
"<emphasis>PostgreSQL</emphasis> the label would show the name of the "
"appropriate database format. The <guilabel>Database file:</guilabel> label "
"shows the complete path to the database file."
msgstr ""
"Prva prednost je da možete konfigurisati <guilabel>Opcije servera baze "
"podataka</guilabel>. To ćete primjetiti iz sljedećih slika ekrana da ova "
"oznaka pokazuje da je izabrana SQLite baza podataka. Međutim, ako je "
"odabrana baza podataka ili <emphasis>MySQL</emphasis> ili "
"<emphasis>PostgreSQL</emphasis> etiketa će prikazati naziv odgovarajućeg "
"formata baze podataka. <guilabel>Datoteke baze podatka:</guilabel> oznake "
"prikazuju cjelokupnu putanju do datoteke baze podataka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Server Settings configuration window."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike &krecipes; prozora Podešavanje server postavki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Server Settings interface"
msgstr ""
"Podesi <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Interfejs server postavki"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you wanted to choose another database file, you would click on the "
"<guiicon>File</guiicon> icon and in the window that appears, navigate to the "
"location of the database file that you want to use. This change would be "
"reflected in the <guilabel>Database file:</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da izaberete drugu datoteku bazu podataka, kliknite na "
"<guiicon>Datoteka</guiicon> ikonicu i u prozor koji se pojavi, idite na "
"lokaciju datoteke baze podataka koju želite koristiti. Ova promjena će se "
"odraziti i na<guilabel>datoteka baza podataka:</guilabel> Okvir za tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second preference available for configuration in the <guilabel>Server "
"Settings</guilabel> screen is for the <emphasis>Backup</emphasis> operation. "
"It is required that the path to your database program be known for the "
"<emphasis>Backup</emphasis> operation to work properly. Therefore, beside "
"the label that is shown in the screenshot as <guilabel>Path to 'sqlite3':</"
"guilabel>, there is a text box which shows the name of the database program. "
"The text in this box can be changed by directly editing it, or by clicking "
"the File icon, which will activate the screen that allows you to navigate to "
"the location of your database program executable file."
msgstr ""
"Druga prednost na raspolaganju za konfiguraciju u <guilabel>Postavkama "
"servera</guilabel> je za operaciju <emphasis>Backup</emphasis>. Potrebno je "
"da put program baze podataka bude poznat za <emphasis>Backup</emphasis> i "
"operacija će raditi ispravno. Stoga, osim natpisa koji je prikazan na slici "
"kao <guilabel>Put u 'sqlite3':</guilabel>, postoji okvir za tekst koji "
"pokazuje naziv programa baze podataka. Tekst u ovom okviru se može "
"promijeniti i neposredno uređivati, ili klikom na ikonu Datoteka, koji će "
"aktivirati ekran koji vam omogućuje da se odete na lokaciju izvršne datoteke "
"vašeg programa baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to do this if you have chosen to install your database "
"program to a location that is different from the default. Also note that, in "
"the screenshot, the database program shows as <quote>sqlite3</quote>. "
"However, if you use another database program, for instance MySQL or "
"PostgreSQL, the appropriate database would be shown."
msgstr ""
"Možda želite da učiniti ako ste izabrali da instalirate program baze "
"podataka na lokaciji koja je razlikuje od default lokacije. također imajte "
"na umu da je, u slikama ekrana, program baze podataka pokazuje kao "
"<quote>sqlite3</quote>. Međutim, ako koristite neki drugi program za bazu "
"podataka, na primjer MySQL ili PostgreSQL, će biti prikazane odgovarajuće "
"baze podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting is for the purpose of setting the location of the database "
"file. For specific information on backing up your database, see the section "
"<link linkend=\"backup-db\">Backing Up Your &krecipes; Database</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ova postavka je za potrebe postavljanja lokaciju datoteke bazu podataka. Ili "
"konkretne informacije o sigurnosti kopije baze podataka, vidite sekciju "
"<link linkend=\"backup-db\">Backing Up Your &krecipes; Database</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also exclusive to the <guilabel>Server Settings</guilabel> screen, is the "
"<guilabel>Re-run wizard on next startup</guilabel> tickbox that can be "
"selected to reload the database with the recipes and USDA data that come as "
"defaults with the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program."
msgstr ""
"Također ekskluzivno u <guilabel>Podešavanje servera</guilabel> ekranu, "
"je<guilabel>Re-run wizard on next startup</guilabel> potvrdni okvir koji "
"moze biti izabran da ponovo bazu podataka s recepte i USDA podatke koje "
"dolaze kao zadane sa  <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> programom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Buttons that appear at the bottom of the <guilabel>Server Settings</"
"guilabel> screen are common to each of the preference screens and function "
"as follows &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Tasteri koji se prikazuju na dnu ekrana <guilabel>Server postavke</guilabel> "
"su zajednički za svaki od ekrana preferiranih opcija i funkcionišu na "
"sljedeći način &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> &ndash; sets any changes made and closes the "
"<interface>&krecipes; Preferences - &krecipes;</interface> window"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> &ndash; postavlja sve promjene i zatvara prozor "
"<interface>&krecipes; Preferirane opcije - &krecipes;</interface>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4433
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> &ndash; cancels changes, if any have been "
"made, and closes the <interface>&krecipes; Preferences - &krecipes;</"
"interface> window"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton> &ndash; otkazuje promjen, ako je ijedna "
"napravljena, i zatvara prozor <interface>&krecipes; Preferirane opcije - "
"&krecipes;</interface>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton> opens the <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"Handbook to the associated section"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Pomoć</guibutton> otvara <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"priručnik za povezanp poglavlje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4443
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing Formatting"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje formatiranja"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4446
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Formatting configuration window."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; prozora Podešavanje formatiranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Formatting interface"
msgstr "Podesi <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Interfejs formatiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From this window, there are two formatting preferences that can be "
"customized &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Iz ovog prozora se mogu prilagoditi dvije preferirane opcije formatiranja "
"&mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4463
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Number Format</guilabel> &ndash; either <guilabel>Fraction</"
"guilabel> or <guilabel>Decimal</guilabel> can be selected by clicking on the "
"appropriate radio button and this choice controls how the units of measure "
"will display in your recipes"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Format broja</guilabel> &ndash; ili <guilabel>Razlomak</guilabel> "
"ili <guilabel>Decimalni broj</guilabel> se mogu izabrati klikom na "
"odgovarajući radio button i ovaj izbor upravlja kako će se jedinice mjere "
"prikazivati u vašem receptu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use abbreviations</guilabel> &ndash; this feature is turned on by "
"clicking on the tickbox beside the label"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristi skraćenice</guilabel> &ndash; ova funkcija se uključuje "
"klikom na potvrdni okvir pored oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4474
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the abbreviations have been completed for your units, the result of "
"selecting to <emphasis>Use abbreviations</emphasis> is that your units of "
"measure will be displayed in their abbreviated form when you are viewing or "
"printing your recipe, and in the printable version of your "
"<emphasis>Shopping List</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Ako su završeni sa skraćenicama za vaše jedinice, rezultat izbora "
"<emphasis>Use abbreviations</emphasis> je takav da vaša jedinica mjere će "
"biti prikazan u svom skraćenom obliku kada gledate ili štampate vaše "
"recepte, u verziji za štampanje <emphasis>Shopping List</emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4486
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choosing Import/Export Preferences"
msgstr "Izbor preferiranih opcija za importovanje/eksportovanje"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4490
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Import/Export configuration window."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; prozora za podešavanje importovanja/"
"eksportovanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4499
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Import/Export interface"
msgstr ""
"Podesi <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Interfejs za importovanje/"
"eksportovanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On this screen under the heading <guilabel>Import</guilabel>, two options "
"exist &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Na ovom ekranu ispod naslova <guilabel>Importovanje</guilabel>, postoje "
"dvije opcije &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first is <guilabel>Overwrite recipes with same title</guilabel> and this "
"feature can be turned on by clicking the tickbox beside the label. This "
"might be a good idea if you are re-importing a currently loaded database."
msgstr ""
"Prvi je <guilabel>Prepiši recepte sa istim nazivom</guilabel> i ova "
"karakteristika se može uključiti klikom na Potvrdni okvir pored oznake. To "
"može biti dobra ideja, ako ponovno želite da re imortujete trenutno učitanu "
"bazu podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4514
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Should you choose NOT to overwrite existing recipes and you have a recipe "
"titled <emphasis>Chocolate Cheesecake</emphasis>, for example, in your "
"recipe list, if you import another Chocolate Cheesecake recipe, the listing "
"will appear as &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Ako odlučite da NE da zamenite postojeće recepte i imate recept pod "
"nazivom<emphasis>Kopiraj tekstČokoladni kolač od sira</emphasis>, na "
"primjer, u listu recepa, ako vam je važan druga kopija teksta "
"receptaČokoladni kolač od sira, popis će se pojaviti kao &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4519
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chocolate Cheesecake"
msgstr "Čokoladni kolač od sira"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4520
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chocolate Cheesecake (2)"
msgstr "Čokoladni kolač od sira (2)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second option is <guilabel>Ask which recipes to import</guilabel> and "
"again, this feature can be turned on by selecting the text box. If this "
"feature is not turned on, your recipes will be imported silently with no "
"prompt. See the section <link linkend=\"import-export-recipes\">Importing "
"and Exporting Recipes</link> for a screenshot that will show the result of "
"this option being selected."
msgstr ""
"Druga opcija je <guilabel>Traži recepte za uvoz</guilabel> i izpočetka, ova "
"funkcija se može ukljuciti odabirom teksta. Ako ova funkcija nije uključena, "
"vaš recept će se uvoziti tiho bez brz. Vidi poglavlje <link linkend=\"import-"
"export-recipes\">Uvoz i izvoz recepata</link> za screenshot koji će pokazati "
"rezultat ove opcije bude odabran."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4530
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copying to the Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiranje u međuspremnik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the heading <guilabel>Export</guilabel>, a drop-down menu exists from "
"which you can select the <quote>Copy to Clipboard</quote> format you wish to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Pod naslovom <guilabel>Eksportovanje</guilabel>, postoji padajući meni iz "
"kojeg možete izabrati format za <quote>kopiranje u međuspremnik</quote> "
"kojeg želite koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Essentially, copying to the clipboard is the same as exporting a recipe. The "
"difference lies in the end result of the export. The traditional export "
"function creates a <emphasis>file</emphasis> (see the section <link linkend="
"\"export-recipe\">Exporting Recipes to Other Formats</link> for a complete "
"description of this). The <quote>Copy to Clipboard</quote> function creates "
"a copy of the recipe in the specified format and places the copy on the "
"clipboard. This provides the ability to paste that copy into an email, for "
"example. The usefulness of this might be in the situation where an "
"attachment to an email might be scrubbed."
msgstr ""
"U suštini, kopiranje u clipboard je isto kao i izvoz recepta. Razlika je u "
"krajnim rezultatima izvora. Tradicionalni izvoz funkcija stvara "
"<emphasis>Datoteku</emphasis> (vidi poglavlje <link linkend=\"export-recipe"
"\">Izvoz recepata u ostale formate</link> za detaljna uputstva). Funkcija "
"<quote>Kopiraj  u clipboard</quote> kreira kopiju recepta u navedenom "
"formatu i stavlja kopiju u clipboard. To daje mogućnost da se kopira u "
"email, na primjer. Korisnost bi to moglo biti u situaciji u kojoj bi kao "
"prilog emailu ostao trajan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4545
#, no-c-format
msgid "The available choices for <quote>Copy to Clipboard</quote> are &mdash;"
msgstr "Dostupne opcije za <quote>kopiranje u međuspremnik</quote> su &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plain Text (*.txt) &ndash; If copied to the clipboard in this format, the "
"result will be a plain text copy of the recipe."
msgstr ""
"Obični tekst (*.txt) &ndash; Ako se kopira u međuspremnik u ovom formatu, "
"rezultat će biti obična tekstualna kopija recepta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4551
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krecipes; (*.kreml) &ndash; If copied to the clipboard in this format, the "
"result will contain all the associated markup tags that allow formatting "
"which is associated with <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"&krecipes; (*.kreml) &ndash; Ako se kopira u međuspremnik u ovom formatu, "
"rezultat će sadržavati sve markup oznake koje omogućavaju formatiranje u "
"vezi sa <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4555
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Meal-Master (*.mmf) &ndash; If copied to the clipboard in this format, the "
"result will be a format that is recognized by the Meal-Master program."
msgstr ""
"Meal-Master (*.mmf) &ndash; Ako se kopira u međuspremnik u ovom formatu, "
"rezultat će biti format koji može biti prepoznat od strane Meal-Master "
"programa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4558
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rezkonv (*.rk) &ndash; If copied to the clipboard in this format, the result "
"will be a format that is recognized by the Rezkonv program."
msgstr ""
"Rezkonv (*.rk) &ndash; Ako se kopira u međuspremnik u ovom formatu, rezultat "
"će biti format koji može biti prepoznat od strane  Rezkonv programa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4561
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"RecipeML (*.xml) &ndash; If copied to the clipboard in this format, the "
"result will contain all the associated markup tags that allow formatting "
"associated with RecipeML."
msgstr ""
"RecipeML (*.xml) &ndash; Ako se kopira u međuspremnik u ovom formatu, "
"rezultat će sadržavati sve povezane markup oznake koje omogućavaju "
"formatiranje u vezi sa RecipeML."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As previously stated, once the recipe is copied to the clipboard in the "
"desired format, it can be pasted into an email. It can also be pasted into a "
"text editor for the purpose of saving the document. When a recipe is copied "
"to the clipboard in a plain text format and then pasted into an email or "
"another document, it is not intended to be imported back into "
"<emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> or any other recipe program. However, "
"suppose another format has been selected for <quote>Copy to Clipboard</"
"quote>. What do you do then and how do you get it back into a related recipe "
"program?"
msgstr ""
"Kao što je ranije navedeno, kada se recept kopiran u clipboard u željenom "
"formatu, može se zalijepiti u email. Također se može zalijepiti u tekst "
"editor u svrhu spremanja dokumenta. Kada je recept kopiran u clipboard u "
"običnom tekst formu, a zatim zalijepiti u email ili drugi dokument, nije "
"namijenjen da se uveze u <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> ili bilo koji drugi "
"program za recepte. Međutim, pretpostavimo da je drugi format odabran za "
"<quote>Kopiraj u clipboard</quote>. Što se onda to radi i kako ga vratiti u "
"povezani program za recepte?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4575
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the recipe has been copied into an email and sent, the recipient could "
"just copy the section associated with the recipe and then, paste it into a "
"text editor and save it to a file with the extension associated with the "
"format &ndash; <emphasis>.kreml</emphasis> for <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> format, <emphasis>.mmf</emphasis> for Meal-Master format, "
"<emphasis>.rk</emphasis> for Rezkonv format, or <emphasis>.xml</emphasis> "
"for RecipeML format. Once saved, this file could then be imported back into "
"the associated recipe program."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je recept kopiran u email i poslan, primalac bi mogao samo kopirati "
"sekciju povezanu sa receptom, a zatim, zalijepiti ga u tekst editor i "
"spremiti ga u datoteku s nastavkom povezanog formata &ndash; <emphasis>."
"kreml</emphasis> za <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> format, <emphasis>.mmf</"
"emphasis> za Meal-Master format, <emphasis>.rk</emphasis> za Rezkonv format, "
"ili <emphasis>.xml</emphasis> za RecipeML format. Jednom snimljena ova "
"datoteka bi se onda mogla uvesti u  povezani program za recepte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4584
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the contents of the clipboard have been pasted directly into a text "
"editor, the file can then be saved with the appropriate extension as "
"previously listed and imported back into the associated recipe program."
msgstr ""
"Ako su sadržaji međuspremnika zalepljeni izravno u izmjena teksta,, datoteka "
"se onda može sačuvati s odgovarajućim proširenjem kao što je prethodno "
"navedeno i ponovo importujt u povezani recept program."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4592
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancing Performance"
msgstr "Poboljšanje performansi"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4596
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; Performance configuration window."
msgstr "Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; prozora Podešavanje performansi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4605
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Performance interface"
msgstr "Podesi <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> &ndash; Interfejs performansi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4611
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this interface, you are customizing two settings. For a reason that you "
"might want to do this, see the section <link linkend=\"config-performance-"
"reason\">Reasons for Configuring Performance Settings</link>. These settings "
"can be used individually or together or not at all."
msgstr ""
"U ovom interfejsu, prilagođavate dvije postavke. Iz razloga šta možda želite "
"učiniti, pogledajte odjeljak<link linkend=\"config-performance-reason"
"\">Razlozi za podešavanje performansnih postavki</link>. Ove postavke se "
"mogu koristiti pojedinačno ili zajedno ili nikako."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first is to set the number of categories that appear in the list when "
"the <emphasis>Find/Edit Recipes</emphasis> component is selected. By "
"default, this number is set to <quote>Unlimited</quote>, which means that "
"all categories will be displayed. To change this setting, adjust the "
"<quote>slider</quote> that appears below the label <guilabel>Number of "
"categories to display at once:</guilabel> until the desired number appears, "
"or use the <quote>spinbox</quote> to set the number."
msgstr ""
"Prvo je da postavite broj kategorija koje se pojavljuju u listi kada je "
"<emphasis>Pronadji/Izmijeni Recepte</emphasis>  odabrana komponenta. Po "
"defaultu, ovaj broj je postavljen na <quote>Neograničeno</quote>, što znači "
"da će se sve kategorije biti prikazane.Za promjenu ove postavke, podesite "
"<quote>slajder</quote> koji se nalazi ispod oznake <guilabel>Broj kategorija "
"za prikaz istovremeno:</guilabel> sve dok se ne pojavi željeni broj, ili "
"koristite <quote>spinbox</quote> da biste podesili broj."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4625
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second setting that you might wish to change is for the number of items "
"that are displayed in lists, for example, the <emphasis>Ingredients</"
"emphasis> list or <emphasis>Properties</emphasis> list. Again, by default "
"this is set to <quote>Unlimited</quote> and to change the setting you would "
"adjust the <quote>slider</quote> that appears below the label "
"<guilabel>Number of elements to display at once:</guilabel>, or use the "
"<quote>spinbox</quote> until the desired number appears."
msgstr ""
"Druga postavka koju želite da promenite je za broj stavki koje se prikazuju "
"na listama, na primjer <emphasis>Sastojci</emphasis> liste ili lista "
"sa<emphasis>Svojstvima</emphasis>. Ponovo, po defaultu ovo je  opcija za "
"podešavanja <quote>Neograničeno</quote> i za promjenu postavki koju biste "
"podesili <quote>slider</quote> koji se nalazi ispod oznake<guilabel>Broj "
"elemenata za prikaz istovremeno:</guilabel>, ili koristite <quote>spinbox</"
"quote> sve dok se ne pojavi željeni broj."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4634
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It should be noted that for the <guilabel>Number of elements to display at "
"once:</guilabel> setting, the adjustment is done in increments of 1000 when "
"using the <quote>spinbox</quote>. Should you wish to set smaller numbers, "
"you can do this by highlighting the word <quote>Unlimited</quote> or "
"whatever numeric entry appears in the box and type the number that you wish "
"to use. However, this feature is ideally used when you have a very large "
"database of recipes."
msgstr ""
"Treba napomenuti da je za postavke <guilabel>Broja elemenata za prikaz "
"odjednom:</guilabel>, Podešavanje se vrši u koracima od 1000 kada se koristi "
"<quote>spinbox</quote>. Ukoliko želite da postavite manji broj, možete to "
"učiniti označavanjem riječi <quote>Neograničeno</quote> ili koji god "
"numeričke unos pojavljuje u prostoru i unesite broj koji želite koristiti. "
"Međutim, ova opcija je idealno koristi kada imate jako veliku bazu recepata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4643
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reasons for Configuring Performance Settings"
msgstr "Razlozi za podešavanje performansnih postavki"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4645
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In most instances, the settings to adjust the <guilabel>Number of categories "
"to display at once:</guilabel> and/or the <guilabel>Number of elements to "
"display at once:</guilabel> will not have to be changed. The ultimate reason "
"that you might want to do so occurs when you have a very large database of "
"recipes. Adjusting these settings so that your Categories or list items are "
"loaded in groups will greatly improve the speed of loading for these items."
msgstr ""
"In most instances, postavke da prilagode <guilabel>Broj kategorija za prikaz "
"odjednom:</guilabel> i/ili <guilabel>Broj elemenata za prikaz odjednom:</"
"guilabel> nece bit promijenjen. Konačni razlog zbog kojeg možda želite to "
"učini se javlja kada imate jako veliku bazu podataka recepata. Podešavanje "
"ove postavke, tako da vaše Kategorije ili popis stavki se učitavaju u "
"grupama će znatno poboljšati brzinu opterećenja za ove stavke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4662
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting Problems"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje problema"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4664
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the event that <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program does something "
"unexpected and you think this might be a bug, you can submit a bug report to "
"the program maintainer. Even if you do not encounter any problems and you "
"have an idea to improve <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, you can submit this "
"request as well. By submitting a report in either of these situations, it "
"will help us to continually improve <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> program uradi nesto "
"neprihvatljivo i mislite da je bag , možete podnijeti izvještaj bug u "
"programu održavatelja. Čak i ako nemate nikakvih problema i imate ideju za "
"poboljšanje <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>, možete podnijeti ovaj zahtjev. "
"Podnošenjem izvještaja u bilo kojem od tih situacija, će nam nam pomoći da "
"se kontinuirano poboljšava <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4672
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting Bugs/Requesting Feature Enhancements"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje grešaka/Zahtijevanje funkcionalnih poboljšanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4674
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To submit a bug report, select <guimenu>Help</guimenu> and "
"<guimenuitem>Report Bug</guimenuitem> from the <emphasis>&krecipes;</"
"emphasis> menu bar. The <emphasis><interface>Submit Bug Report &ndash; "
"&krecipes;</interface></emphasis> window appears as in the screenshot below:"
msgstr ""
"Da podnesete izvještaj o grešci, izaberite <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> i "
"<guimenuitem>Prijavi grešku</guimenuitem> iz <emphasis>&krecipes;</emphasis> "
"trake menija. Prozor <emphasis><interface>Podnesi izvještaj o grešci &ndash; "
"&krecipes;</interface></emphasis> se pojavi kao na snimljenoj slici ekrana "
"ispod:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:4682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here's a screenshot of the &krecipes; interface for submitting bugs or "
"feature requests."
msgstr ""
"Evo snimljene slike ekrana &krecipes; interfejsa za podnošenje izvještaja o "
"grešci ili funkcionalnih zahtjeva."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4691
#, no-c-format
msgid "Submitting Bug Reports and Feature Requests"
msgstr "Podnošenje izvještaja o grešci ili funkcionalnih zahtjeva"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4697
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the actual interface used to submit the bug report or feature "
"enhancement in a web browser window on <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org"
"\">bugs.kde.org</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je stvarni interfejs koji se koristi za podnošenje izvještaja o grešci "
"ili funkcionalnih zahtjeva u prozoru web pretraživača na <ulink url=\"http://"
"bugs.kde.org\">bugs.kde.org</ulink>."

