"mašini, i trenutno se testira sa 50,000+ recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5042
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's what you can do:"
msgstr "Evo šta možete uraditi:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5045
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the MySQL or PostgreSQL backends. They provide better overall "
"performance than SQLite, especially for a huge amount of recipes."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite MySQL ili PostgreSQL bazu podataka. One pružaju bolje ukupne "
"performanse od SQLite baze podataka, posebno za ogromnu količinu recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5048
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Configure &krecipes; dialog, tune the <link linkend=\"configure-"
"performance\">Performance options</link>."
msgstr ""
"U &krecipes; dijalogu Podesi, podesite <link linkend=\"configure-performance"
"\">Opcije performansi</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5050
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Categorize your recipes. &krecipes; will load much faster if all recipes are "
"categorized."
msgstr ""
"Kategorišite svoje recepte. &krecipes; će se učitavati puno brže ako su svi "
"recepti kategorizisani ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5059
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Ingredient Matcher never matches any recipes. What am I doing wrong?"
msgstr "Uparivač sastojaka nikad ne upari nijedan recept. Šta radim pogrešno?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5063
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of the Ingredient Matcher is to find recipes that you are able "
"to make (or almost make) with ingredients that you select. That means you "
"have to select every single ingredient used in a recipe (or all but a few, "
"depending on how many ingredients can be missing) to match that recipe. See "
"the <link linkend=\"ingredient-matcher\">Ingredient Matcher section</link> "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"Svrha Uparivač sastojaka je da pronađe recepte koje (skoro da) možete da "
"napravite sa sastojcima koje izaberete. To znači da morate da izaberete "
"svaki od sastojaka upotrijebljenih u receptu (ili svaki osim nekoliko, "
"zavisno od toga koliko sastojaka može nedostajati) da biste uparili taj "
"recept. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"ingredient-matcher\">poglavlje Uparivač "
"sastojaka</link> za detalje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5070
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to see which recipes use particular ingredients, then you want "
"to use the <link linkend=\"using-adv-ingredients\">The Ingredients Search</"
"link>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da vidite koji recepti koriste određene sastojke, onda želite "
"koristiti <link linkend=\"using-adv-ingredients\">Pretraživanje sastojaka</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5081
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are all the recipes?"
msgstr "Gdje su svi recepti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5084
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While running the &krecipes; wizard will allow you to choose to install "
"sample recipes, the prime function of the program is to allow you to store "
"and manage your own recipe collection."
msgstr ""
"Iako će vam pokretanje &krecipes; čarobnjaka omogućiti da odaberete da "
"instalirate primjere recepata, glavna funkcija programa je da vam omogući da "
"čuvate i upravljate svojom zbirkom recepata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5088
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are looking to augment your personal recipe collection, there are "
"Internet sites that host thousands of recipes that are freely available. "
"Among these are: &mdash;"
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da povećate svoju ličnu zbirku recepta, postoje internet stranice "
"koje nude hiljade besplatnih recepata. Među njima su: &mdash;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:5096
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All you have to do is download the recipe and then, import it into your "
"database. See the section <link linkend=\"file-import\">Importing from a "
"File</link> for help with this function."
msgstr ""
"Sve što treba da uradite je da preuzmete recept, a zatim da ga importujete u "
"svoju bazu podataka. Pogledajte poglavlje <link linkend=\"file-import"
"\">Importovanje iz datoteke</link> za pomoć sa ovom funkcijom."

